<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CH" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Taruxune Singen Sora</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yuda Mangane Fe Taruxune</para>
  <para style="toc2">Taruxune Singena</para>
  <para style="mt1">Taruxune Singena</para>
  <para style="mt2">Yuda Mangane Fe Taruxune</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabun yire firinna naxanye xili “Taruxune,” ne Yuda bɔnsɔnna mangane nan ma fe falama. Taruxune Singena Isirayila kaane benbane bari feen nan falama keli N Benba Adama ma han sa dɔxɔ Dawuda sayaan waxatin na. Manga Dawuda fe taruxun nan Kitabun yireni ito kui, yanyina nde ɲɛɛ wuli keden ɲɔxɔn benun Yesu xa bari. Taruxune Singen nun Samuyɛli Firinden nun Mangane Singen kitabu yirene e maliga yire wuyaxi yi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CH 1"/>
  <para style="s">Isirayila kaane benbane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 1:1"/>Adama nan Seti sɔtɔ. Seti yi Enosi sɔtɔ. Enosi yi Kenan sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 1:2"/>Kenan yi Mahalaleli sɔtɔ. Mahalaleli yi Yarɛdi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 1:3"/>Yarɛdi yi Xenɔki sɔtɔ. Xenɔki yi Matusela sɔtɔ. Matusela yi Lameki sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 1:4"/>Lemeki yi Nuhan sɔtɔ. Nuhan yi Semi nun Xami nun Yepeti sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="r">Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 10.2-20</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 1:5"/>Yepeti a diine xinle ni itoe ra: Gomɛrɛ nun Magogo nun Madayi nun Yawani nun Tubali nun Mesɛki nun Tirasi.<verse eid="1CH 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 1:6"/>Gomɛrɛ a diine xinle ni itoe ra: Asikenasi nun Rifati nun Togarama.<verse eid="1CH 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 1:7"/>Yawani a diine xinle ni itoe ra: Elisaha nun Tarasisi nun Sipiri nun Rodanimi.<verse eid="1CH 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 1:8"/>Xami a diine xinle ni itoe ra: Kusi nun Misiran nun Puti nun Kanan. <verse eid="1CH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 1:9"/>Kusi a diine xinle ni itoe ra: Sɛba nun Xawila nun Sabata nun Raama nun Sabiteka. Raama diini itoe nan sɔtɔ: Saba nun Dedan. <verse eid="1CH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 1:10"/>Kusi yi Nimirodi bari. Na findi yɛngɛso belebelen nan na dunuɲa yi. <verse eid="1CH 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 1:11"/>Misiran yi diine sɔtɔ naxanye findixi Ludu kaane nun Anami kaane nun Lehaba kaane nun Nafatu kaane nun <verse eid="1CH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 1:12"/>Patirusu kaane nun Kasaluxu kaane nun Kafatoro kaane ra. Filisitine benbane nan Kafatoro kaane ra. <verse eid="1CH 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 1:13"/>Kanan yi a dii singen Sidɔn sɔtɔ e nun gbɛtɛye naxanye findixi Xitine nun <verse eid="1CH 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 1:14"/>Yebusu kaane nun Amorine nun Girigasane nun <verse eid="1CH 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 1:15"/>Xiwine nun Arakane nun Sini kaane nun <verse eid="1CH 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 1:16"/>Arawada kaane nun Sɛmara kaane nun Xamata kaane ra.<verse eid="1CH 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="r">Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 10.21-31 nun 11.10-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 1:17"/>Semi a diine xinle ni itoe ra: Elan nun Asuri nun Arapaxadi nun Ludu e nun Arami.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 1:17">Arami a diine ni i ra: Yusu nun Xulu nun Geteri e nun Mesɛki.<verse eid="1CH 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 1:18"/>Arapaxadi yi Selaxa sɔtɔ. Selaxa yi Eberi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 1:19"/>Eberi yi dii xɛmɛ firin sɔtɔ. Keden xili Pɛlɛgi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.19</char> <char style="fk">Pɛlɛgi</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “Mayitaxunna.”</note> bayo dunuɲa yitaxun a waxatin nin. A xunyɛn xili Yokatan.<verse eid="1CH 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 1:20"/>Yokatan ma diine ni i ra: Alomodadi nun Selefa nun Xasaramaweti nun Yera nun <verse eid="1CH 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 1:21"/>Hadoran nun Yusali nun Dikila nun <verse eid="1CH 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 1:22"/>Ebali nun Abimayele nun Saba nun <verse eid="1CH 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 1:23"/>Ofiri nun Xawila nun Yobabo. Yokatan ma diine nan ne ra.<verse eid="1CH 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 1:24"/>Semi yi Arapaxadi sɔtɔ. Arapaxadi yi Selaxa sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 1:25"/>Selaxa yi Eberi sɔtɔ. Eberi yi Pɛlɛgi sɔtɔ. Pɛlɛgi yi Rewu sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 1:26"/>Rewu yi Serugu sɔtɔ. Serugu yi Nahori sɔtɔ. Nahori yi Tera sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 1:27"/>Tera yi Iburama sɔtɔ naxan findixi Iburahima ra.<verse eid="1CH 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nabi Iburahimaa diine</para>
  <para style="r">Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 25.12-16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 1:28"/>Iburahima yi Isiyaga nun Sumayila sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 1:29"/>Sumayilaa dii singen yi xili nɛn Nebayoti. Kedari nun Adibeli nun Mibisan nun <verse eid="1CH 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 1:30"/>Misema nun Duma nun Masa nun Xadada nun Tema nun <verse eid="1CH 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 1:31"/>Yeturi nun Nafisi nun Kedema, Sumayilaa diine nan yi ne fan na.<verse eid="1CH 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="r">Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 25.1-4</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 1:32"/>Iburahima a konyi ɲaxanla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.32</char> <char style="fk">Konyi ɲaxanle</char> sariyan sɛbɛxi Xɔrɔyaan 21.7-11 kui. Konyin na a ra a naxan sɔtɔ a ɲaxanla ra.</note> Keturaa dii xɛmɛne xinle ni itoe ra a naxanye bari Iburahima xa: Simiran nun Yokan nun Medan nun Midiyan nun Yisebaki nun Suwa. Yokan yi Saba nun Dedan sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 1:33"/>Midiyan yi Efa nun Efere nun Xanɔki nun Abida nun Elida sɔtɔ. Keturaa diine nan e birin na.<verse eid="1CH 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="r">Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 36.10-14</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 1:34"/>Iburahima yi Isiyaga sɔtɔ. Isiyaga yi Esayu nun Isirayila sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 1:35"/>Esayu a diine xinle ni itoe ra: Elifasi nun Reyuli nun Yewusi nun Yalami nun Kora.<verse eid="1CH 1:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 1:36"/>Elifasi a diine xinle ni itoe ra: Teman nun Omaru nun Sefo nun Gatami nun Kenasi nun Timina nun Amalɛki.<verse eid="1CH 1:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 1:37"/>Reyuli a diine xinle ni itoe ra: Naxati nun Sera nun Sama nun Misa.<verse eid="1CH 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="r">Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 36.20-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 1:38"/>Seyiri a diine xinle ni itoe ra: Lotan nun Sobali nun Sibeyon nun Ana nun Dison nun Eseri nun Disan.<verse eid="1CH 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 1:39"/>Lotan yi Xori nun Homami sɔtɔ. Lotan magilɛn yi xili nɛn Timina.<verse eid="1CH 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 1:40"/>Sobali yi Aliyan nun Manaxati nun Ebali nun Sefi nun Onan sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 1:40">Sibeyon yi Aya nun Ana sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 1:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 1:41"/>Ana yi Dison sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 1:41">Dison yi Xamaran nun Eseban nun Itiran nun Keran sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 1:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 1:42"/>Eseri yi Bilihan nun Saawan nun Yaakan sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 1:42">Disan yi Yusu nun Aran sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="r">Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 36.31-43</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 1:43"/>Mangane nan itoe ra naxanye yi Edɔn yamanan xun na benun Isirayila kaane xa mangan sɔtɔ waxatin naxan yi. Beyori a diin Bela yi findi manga singen na, naxan ma taan yi xili Dinhaba. <verse eid="1CH 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 1:44"/>Bela to faxa, Seraa diin Yobabo, Bosara kaan yi findi mangan na. <verse eid="1CH 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 1:45"/>Yobabo to faxa, Xusama, naxan yi kelixi Teman yamanani, na yi findi mangan na. <verse eid="1CH 1:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 1:46"/>Xusama to faxa, Bedadaa diin Xadada yi findi mangan na. A tan nan Midiyan kaane nɔ Moyaba bɔxɔni. A taan yi xili nɛn Abiti. <verse eid="1CH 1:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 1:47"/>Xadada to faxa, Masareka kaan Samala yi findi mangan na. <verse eid="1CH 1:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 1:48"/>Samala to faxa, Sayuli yi findi mangan na, naxan yi kelixi Rehoboti taani baan dɛ. <verse eid="1CH 1:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 1:49"/>Sayuli to faxa, Akibori a diin Baali-Xanan yi findi mangan na. <verse eid="1CH 1:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 1:50"/>Baali-Xanan to faxa, Xadada yi findi mangan na. A taan yi xili nɛn Pawu. A ɲaxanla yi xili nɛn Mehetabeli, Matirɛdi a dii tɛmɛna, Mesahabi mamandenna.<verse eid="1CH 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 1:51"/>Xadada to faxa, muxuni itoe nan findi Edɔn mangane ra: Manga Timina nun Manga Aliwa nun Manga Yetɛti nun <verse eid="1CH 1:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 1:52"/>Manga Yoholibama nun Manga Ela nun Manga Pinon nun <verse eid="1CH 1:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 1:53"/>Manga Kenasi nun Manga Teman nun Manga Mibisari nun <verse eid="1CH 1:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 1:54"/>Manga Magadiyɛli nun Manga Irami. Ne nan yi Edɔn mangane ra.<verse eid="1CH 1:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Isirayila yixɛtɛne</para>
  <para style="r">Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 35.23-26</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 2:1"/>Isirayilaa diine xinle ni itoe ra: Rubɛn nun Simeyɔn nun Lewi nun Yuda nun Isakari nun Sabulon nun <verse eid="1CH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 2:2"/>Dan nun Yusufu nun Bunyamin nun Nafatali nun Gadi nun Aseri.<verse eid="1CH 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="r">Ruti 4.18-22 Matiyu 1.3-6</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 2:3"/>Yuda a diine xinle ni itoe ra: Eri nun Onan nun Selaxa. Kanan kaa ɲaxanla nde nan na dii saxanne bari a xa, Suyaa dii tɛmɛna. Yudaa dii singena Eri yi fe ɲaxin liga Alatala yɛɛ ra yi. A yi a faxa na ma. <verse eid="1CH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 2:4"/>Yuda mamuxun Tamari yi Peresi nun Sera bari a xa. Yuda dii suulun sɔtɔ na kii nin.<verse eid="1CH 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 2:5"/>Peresi yi Xesirɔn nun Xamuli sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 2:6"/>Sera yi dii suulun sɔtɔ: Simiri nun Etani nun Heman nun Kalikɔli nun Dara. <verse eid="1CH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 2:7"/>Karimi yi Akan sɔtɔ, naxan tinxintareyaan liga Isirayila ra, a to se ratɔnxine tongo. <verse eid="1CH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 2:8"/>Etani yi Asari sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 2:9"/>Xesirɔn yi Yerameeli nun Rami nun Kalebi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.9</char> <char style="fk">Kalebi</char> mɔn xili nɛn Kelubayi.</note> sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 2:10"/>Rami yi Aminadabo sɔtɔ. Aminadabo yi Naxason sɔtɔ, naxan findi Yuda bɔnsɔnna kuntigin na. <verse eid="1CH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 2:11"/>Naxason yi Salimon sɔtɔ. Salimon yi Boosu sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 2:12"/>Boosu yi Obedi sɔtɔ. Obedi yi Yese sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 2:13"/>Yese a dii xɛmɛne xinle ni itoe ra: Eliyabi nan yi a dii singen na, a firindena Abinadabo, a saxandena Simeya, <verse eid="1CH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 2:14"/>a naanindena Natanɛli, a suulundena Radayi, <verse eid="1CH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 2:15"/>a sennindena Osemi, a soloferedena Dawuda. <verse eid="1CH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 2:16"/>Yese a dii tɛmɛne xinle ni itoe ra: Seruya nun Abigayili. Seruya yi dii xɛmɛ saxan sɔtɔ: Abisayi nun Yowaba nun Asahɛli. <verse eid="1CH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 2:17"/>Abigayili yi Amasa sɔtɔ Yeteri xa, naxan fataxi Sumayila bɔnsɔnna ra.<verse eid="1CH 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 2:18"/>Xesirɔn ma diin Kalebi a ɲaxanle Asuba nun Yeriyoti, ne yi diini itoe bari Kalebi xa: Yesere nun Sobaba nun Aradon. <verse eid="1CH 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 2:19"/>Asuba to faxa, Kalebi yi Efarata dɔxɔ, a yi Xuru bari a xa. <verse eid="1CH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 2:20"/>Xuru yi Yuri sɔtɔ. Yuri yi Bɛsalɛli sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 2:21"/>Dɔnxɛn na, Xesirɔn to ɲɛɛ tonge sennin sɔtɔ, a yi Galadi benban Makiri a dii tɛmɛn dɔxɔ, a yi a kolon ɲaxanla ra. E yi Segubu sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 2:22"/>Segubu yi Yayiri sɔtɔ, naxan findi taa mɔxɔɲɛn nun saxan xun na Galadi yamanani. <verse eid="1CH 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 2:23"/>Koni, Gesuri kaane nun Arami kaane yi Yayiri taane tongo e nun Kenata taan nun a rabilinne, e birin malanxina taa tonge sennin. Makiri yixɛtɛne nan ne birin na, naxan Galadi masɛgɛ.<verse eid="1CH 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 2:24"/>Xesirɔn to faxa Kalebi-Efarata taani, a ɲaxanla Abiya yi Asexuri bari a xa, naxan Tekowa taan masɛgɛ. <verse eid="1CH 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 2:25"/>Xesirɔn ma dii singen Yerameeli a diine ni i ra: a dii singen Rami nun Buna nun Oreni nun Osemi nun Axiya. <verse eid="1CH 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 2:26"/>Yerameeli a ɲaxalan bodena Atara yi Onan bari. <verse eid="1CH 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 2:27"/>Yerameeli a dii singen Rami a diine xinle ni itoe ra: Masi nun Yamin nun Ekeri. <verse eid="1CH 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 2:28"/>Onan yi Samayi nun Yada sɔtɔ. Samayi yi Nadaba nun Abisuri sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 2:29"/>Abisuri a ɲaxanla Abixali yi Axaban nun Molidi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 2:30"/>Nadaba yi Seleda nun Apayimi sɔtɔ. Seleda yi faxa diitareyani. <verse eid="1CH 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 2:31"/>Apayimi yi Yisi sɔtɔ. Yisi yi Sesan sɔtɔ. Sesan yi Axalayi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 2:32"/>Samayi xunyɛn Yada yi Yeteri nun Yonatan sɔtɔ. Yeteri yi faxa diitareyani. <verse eid="1CH 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 2:33"/>Yonatan yi Pɛlɛti nun Sasa sɔtɔ. Yerameeli yixɛtɛne nan ne ra. <verse eid="1CH 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 2:34"/>Sesan mi dii xɛmɛ yo sɔtɔ fɔ dii tɛmɛne. A konyi xɛmɛn Misiran kaan yi xili nɛn Yara. <verse eid="1CH 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 2:35"/>Sesan yi a dii tɛmɛn fi a konyi xɛmɛn Yara ma. A yi Atayi bari a xa. <verse eid="1CH 2:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 2:36"/>Atayi yi Natan sɔtɔ. Natan yi Sabadi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 2:37"/>Sabadi yi Efilali sɔtɔ. Efilali yi Obedi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 2:38"/>Obedi yi Yehu sɔtɔ. Yehu yi Asari sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 2:39"/>Asari yi Xɛlɛsi sɔtɔ. Xɛlɛsi yi Eleyasa sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 2:40"/>Eleyasa yi Sisimayi sɔtɔ. Sisimayi yi Salun sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 2:41"/>Salun yi Yekamiya sɔtɔ. Yekamiya yi Elisama sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 2:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 2:42"/>Yerameeli xunyɛn Kalebi a dii singen yi xili Mesa. Mesa yi Sifi nun Maresa sɔtɔ, naxan findixi Xebiron kaane benban na. <verse eid="1CH 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 2:43"/>Xebiron yi Kora nun Tapuwa nun Rekemi nun Sema sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 2:44"/>Sema yi Raxami sɔtɔ. Raxami yi Yorekami sɔtɔ. Rekemi yi Samayi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 2:45"/>Samayi yi Mayon sɔtɔ. Mayon yi Beti-Suru sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 2:46"/>Kalebi a konyi ɲaxanla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.46</char> <char style="fk">Konyi ɲaxanle</char> sariyan sɛbɛxi Xɔrɔyaan 21.7-11 kui. Konyin na a ra, a naxan sɔtɔ a ɲaxanla ra.</note> Efa yi Xarani nun Mosa nun Gasɛsi bari a xa. Xarani yi Gasɛsi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 2:47"/>Yadayi a diine xinle ni itoe ra: Regemi nun Yotami nun Gesana nun Peleti nun Efa nun Saafi. <verse eid="1CH 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 2:48"/>Kalebi a konyi ɲaxanla Maka yi Seberi nun Tirana bari a xa. <verse eid="1CH 2:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 2:49"/>Maka mɔn yi Madamanna fafe Saafi bari e nun Sewa, Makabena nun Gibeya fafe. Kalebi a dii tɛmɛn yi xili Akasa.<verse eid="1CH 2:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 2:50"/>Kalebi yixɛtɛ gbɛtɛye nan itoe fan na. A ɲaxanla Efarataa dii singen Xuru a diine ni i ra: Sobali naxan Kiriyati-Yeyarin taan masɛgɛ, <verse eid="1CH 2:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 2:51"/>Salima naxan Bɛtɛlɛmi taan masɛgɛ e nun Xarefi naxan Beti-Gaderi taan masɛgɛ. <verse eid="1CH 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 2:52"/>Sobali naxan Kiriyati-Yeyarin taan masɛgɛ, na yixɛtɛne ni i ra: Harowe nun Menuhoti kaane fɔxɔ kedenna nun <verse eid="1CH 2:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 2:53"/>Kiriyati-Yeyarin xabilan muxun naxanye findixi Yitirine nun Putine nun Sumane nun Miserayine ra. Ne nan findixi Sora taan muxune nun Esetayoli taan muxune ra. <verse eid="1CH 2:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 2:54"/>Salima yixɛtɛne ni i ra: Bɛtɛlɛmi kaane nun Netofa kaane nun Atiroti-Beti-Yowaba kaane nun Manaxati kaane fɔxɔ kedenna nun Sorine nun <verse eid="1CH 2:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 2:55"/>sɛbɛlitine xabilan naxanye yi dɔxi Yabɛsa taani e nun Tiratine nun Simeyatane nun Sukatine. Kenine nan ne ra, naxanye fataxi Xamati ra, Rekabu a denbayaan benbana.<verse eid="1CH 2:55"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CH 3"/>
  <para style="s">Manga Dawudaa diine</para>
  <para style="r">Samuyɛli Firinden 3.2-5</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 3:1"/>Dawuda diin naxanye bari Xebiron taani, ne ni i ra. A dii singen yi xili nɛn Aminon, naxan nga yi findixi Yɛsɛreli kaana Axinowami ra. A dii firinden yi xili Daniyɛli, naxan nga yi Karemele kaana Abigayili ra. <verse eid="1CH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 3:2"/>A saxanden yi xili Abisalomi, naxan nga yi findixi Gesuri taan Manga Talamayi a dii tɛmɛn Maka ra. A naaninden yi xili Adoniya, naxan nga yi findixi Xagiti ra. <verse eid="1CH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 3:3"/>A suulunden yi xili Sɛfati, naxan nga yi findixi Abitali ra. A senninden yi xili Yitireyami, naxan nga yi Egela ra. <verse eid="1CH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 3:4"/>Dii senninni itoe barixi Xebiron taan nin Dawudaa mangayaan naba dɛnaxan yi ɲɛɛ solofere kike sennin. A yi mangayaan naba Yerusalɛn taani ɲɛɛ tonge saxan ɲɛɛ saxan.<verse eid="1CH 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 3:5"/>Amiyɛli a dii tɛmɛn Batiseba dii naaninni itoe nan sɔtɔ Dawuda xa Yerusalɛn yi: Simeya nun Sobaba nun Natan nun Sulemani. <verse eid="1CH 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 3:6"/>Dawuda mɔn dii xɛmɛ solomanaanin gbɛtɛye sɔtɔ nɛn: Yibixari nun Elisuwa nun Elifeleti nun <verse eid="1CH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 3:7"/>Noga nun Nefegi nun Yafiya nun <verse eid="1CH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 3:8"/>Elisama nun Eliyada nun Elifeleti. <verse eid="1CH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 3:9"/>Dawudaa dii xɛmɛne nan ne ra. Konyi ɲaxanle<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.9</char> <char style="fk">Konyi ɲaxanle</char> sariyan sɛbɛxi Xɔrɔyaan 21.7-11 kui. Konyin nan ne ra, Dawuda naxanye sɔtɔ a ɲaxanla ra.</note> diin naxanye bari a xa, ne mi ne yɛ. Tamari nan yi e magilɛn na.<verse eid="1CH 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda Mangane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 3:10"/>Sulemani nan Robowan sɔtɔ. Robowan yi Abiya sɔtɔ. Abiya yi Asa sɔtɔ. Asa yi Yosafati sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 3:11"/>Yosafati yi Yehorami sɔtɔ. Yehorami yi Axasiya sɔtɔ. Axasiya yi Yowasa sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 3:12"/>Yowasa yi Amasiya sɔtɔ. Amasiya yi Asari sɔtɔ. Asari yi Yotami sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 3:13"/>Yotami yi Axasi sɔtɔ. Axasi yi Xesekiya sɔtɔ. Xesekiya yi Manase sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 3:14"/>Manase yi Amɔn sɔtɔ. Amɔn yi Yosiya sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 3:15"/>Yosiya a dii singen findi Yoxanan nan na, a dii firindena, Yehoyakimi, a saxandena, Sedeki, a naanindena, Salun. <verse eid="1CH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 3:16"/>Yehoyakimi yi Yoyakin nun Sedeki sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 3:17"/>Yoyakin naxan suxu konyiyani, na diine ni i ra: Selatili nun <verse eid="1CH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 3:18"/>Malakirami nun Pɛdaya nun Senasari nun Yekamiya nun Hosama nun Nedabiya. <verse eid="1CH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 3:19"/>Pɛdaya yi Sorobabeli nun Simeyi sɔtɔ. Sorobabeli yi Mesulan nun Xananiya sɔtɔ. Selomiti nan yi e magilɛn na. <verse eid="1CH 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 3:20"/>Pɛdaya mɔn yi dii suulun gbɛtɛye sɔtɔ: Xasuba nun Oheli nun Bereki nun Xasadiya nun Yusabi-Xeseda. <verse eid="1CH 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 3:21"/>Xananiya yixɛtɛne ni i ra: Pɛlati nun Yɛsaya nun Rɛfayaa diine nun Aranan ma diine nun Abadi a diine nun Sɛkani a diine. <verse eid="1CH 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 3:22"/>Sɛkani dii senninni itoe nan sɔtɔ: Semaya nun Xatusi nun Yigali nun Bariya nun Neyaraya nun Safati. <verse eid="1CH 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 3:23"/>Neyaraya dii saxanni itoe nan sɔtɔ: Eliyowenayi nun Xisikiya nun Asirikami. <verse eid="1CH 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 3:24"/>Eliyowenayi dii solofereni itoe nan sɔtɔ: Hodafiya nun Eliyasibi nun Pɛlaya nun Akubu nun Yoxanan nun Dɛlaya nun Anani.<verse eid="1CH 3:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CH 4"/>
  <para style="s">Yuda xabila gbɛtɛye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 4:1"/>Yuda yixɛtɛne ni i ra: Peresi nun Xesirɔn nun Karimi nun Xuru nun Sobali. <verse eid="1CH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 4:2"/>Sobali a diin Reyaya yi Yaxati sɔtɔ. Yaxati yi Axumayi nun Lahadi sɔtɔ. Sorane xabilane fataxi ne nan na. <verse eid="1CH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 4:3"/>Yɛsɛreli nun Yisema nun Yidibasi nan Etami taan masɛgɛ. E magilɛn yi xili Haseleliponi. <verse eid="1CH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 4:4"/>Penuyɛli nan Gedori taan masɛgɛ. Xuru a diina Eseri nan Xusa taan masɛgɛ. Efarataa dii singen Xuru nan Bɛtɛlɛmi taan masɛgɛ. <verse eid="1CH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 4:5"/>Asexuri yi Tekowa taan masɛgɛ, ɲaxalan firin yi naxan yii, Xela nun Nara. <verse eid="1CH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 4:6"/>Nara yi Axusami nun Xeferi nun Temeni nun Axasetari bari a xa. <verse eid="1CH 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 4:7"/>Xela yi Sɛrɛti nun Soxara nun Etenani <verse eid="1CH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 4:8"/>nun Kosi bari a xa. Kosi yi Anubi nun Sobeba sɔtɔ, e nun Harumi a dii Axaraxeli xabilane.<verse eid="1CH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 4:9"/>Yabɛsa yi binyen sɔtɔ dangu a ngaxakedenne ra. A nga a xili sa nɛn Yabɛsa bayo a naxa, “N bata a xali tɔrɔni.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.9</char> <char style="fk">Yabɛsa </char>maso xuina nde ra Heburu xuini naxan bunna nɛɛn fa fala “Xɔlɛna.”</note> <verse eid="1CH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 4:10"/>Yabɛsa yi Isirayilaa Ala maxandi, a naxa, “Yandi, n baraka! I yi n ma bɔxɔn fari sa. I sɛnbɛn xa lu n xɔn, i n natanga tɔrɔn ma alogo fe xɔlɛn nama n sɔtɔ.” Ala yi a duban yabi.<verse eid="1CH 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 4:11"/>Suxa ngaxakedenna Kelubu yi Mexiri sɔtɔ. Mexiri yi Eseton sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 4:12"/>Eseton yi Beti-Rafa nun Paseya nun Texinna sɔtɔ. Texinna nan Naxasa taan masɛgɛ. Ne findixi Reka kaane nan na.<verse eid="1CH 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 4:13"/>Kenasi yi Otiniyɛli nun Seraya sɔtɔ. Otiniyɛli yi Xatati nun Meyonotayi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 4:14"/>Meyonotayi yi Ofara sɔtɔ. Seraya yi Yowaba sɔtɔ, yiirawanle benbana, naxanye yi dɔxi Yiirawanle Lanbanni. <verse eid="1CH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 4:15"/>Yefune a diin Kalebi yi Iru nun Ela nun Nami sɔtɔ. Ela yi Kenasi sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 4:16"/>Yehaleleli a diine ni i ra: Sifi nun Sifa nun Tiriya nun Asarɛli.<verse eid="1CH 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 4:17"/>Esiraa diine ni i ra: Yeteri nun Meredi nun Efere nun Yalon. Meredi a ɲaxanla nde yi Mariyama nun Samayi nun Yiseba bari. Yiseba nan Esitemowa taan masɛgɛ. <verse eid="1CH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 4:18"/>Misiran mangana dii tɛmɛn Biti naxan yi dɔxi Meredi xɔn ma, na nan na diine bari. Meredi mɔn yi Yahudiya ɲaxanla nde dɔxɔ, na diine ni i ra: Yarɛdi naxan Gedori taan masɛgɛ e nun Xeberi naxan Soko taan masɛgɛ e nun Yekutiyeli naxan Sanowa taan masɛgɛ. <verse eid="1CH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 4:19"/>Hodiyaa ɲaxanla naxan findixi Naxami magilɛn na, na yixɛtɛne yi findi Garimi kaane ra naxanye yi dɔxi Keyila taani e nun Maka kaan naxanye yi dɔxi Esitemowa taani.<verse eid="1CH 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 4:20"/>Simon ma diine ni i ra: Aminon nun Rinna nun Ben-Xanan nun Tilon.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 4:20">Yisi a diine ni i ra: Soxeti nun Ben-Soxeti.<verse eid="1CH 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 4:21"/>Yudaa diin Selaxa yixɛtɛne ni i ra: Eri naxan Leka taan masɛgɛ, e nun Laada naxan Maresa taan masɛgɛ, e nun xabilan naxanye yi dugi sɔxɔnne ra Beti-Asibeya yi, e nun <verse eid="1CH 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 4:22"/>Yokimi nun Koseba kaane nun Yowasa nun Sarafa naxan yi Moyaba nun Yasubi-Lɛxɛmi xun na. Fe fonne nan ne ra. <verse eid="1CH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 4:23"/>Ne yixɛtɛne yi findi fɛɲɛ rafalane ra mangan xa Netayimi nun Gedera taane yi.<verse eid="1CH 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Simeyɔn yixɛtɛne</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JOS 19:2-10">Yosuwe 19.2-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 4:24"/>Simeyɔn yixɛtɛne ni i ra: Nemuweli nun Yamin nun Yaribi nun Sera nun Sayuli. <verse eid="1CH 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 4:25"/>Sayuli yi Salun sɔtɔ. Salun yi Mibisan sɔtɔ. Mibisan yi Misema sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 4:26"/>Misema yi Xamuwɛli sɔtɔ. Xamuwɛli yi Sakuru sɔtɔ. Sakuru yi Simeyi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 4:27"/>Simeyi yi dii xɛmɛ fu nun sennin sɔtɔ e nun dii tɛmɛ sennin. A ngaxakedenne mi dii wuyaxi sɔtɔ. E xabilan muxune mi wuya ayi alo Yuda bɔnsɔnna muxune. <verse eid="1CH 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 4:28"/>E yi dɔxi taani itoe nin: Bɛriseba nun Molada nun Xasari-Suwali nun <verse eid="1CH 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 4:29"/>Bila nun Esemi nun Toladi nun <verse eid="1CH 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 4:30"/>Betuyeli nun Xoroma nun Sikilaga nun <verse eid="1CH 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 4:31"/>Beti-Marakaboti nun Xasari-Susimi nun Beti-Biri nun Saarayimi. E yi lu na taane yi han Dawudaa mangayaan waxatini. <verse eid="1CH 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 4:32"/>E mɔn dɔxɔ nɛn taa suulun gbɛtɛye yi: Etami nun Ayin nun Rimɔn nun Token nun Asan <verse eid="1CH 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 4:33"/>e nun e rabilinne siga han Baalati taani. E dɔxɔdene nun e benbane nan ne ra naxanye sɛbɛxi e bɔnsɔn kɛdin kui.<verse eid="1CH 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 4:34"/>Simeyɔn bɔnsɔnna xabilane kuntigine xinle ni itoe ra: Mesobabo nun Yameleki nun Amasiyaa diin Yosahi nun <verse eid="1CH 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 4:35"/>Yowɛli nun Yosibiya a diin Yehu, Seraya mamandenna, Asiyeli tolobitana, e nun <verse eid="1CH 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 4:36"/>Eliyowenayi nun Yaakoba nun Yesohaya nun Asaya nun Adiyeli nun Yesimiyeli nun Bɛnaya nun <verse eid="1CH 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 4:37"/>Sifeyi a diin Sisa. Alon nan Sifeyi sɔtɔ. Yɛdaya nan Alon sɔtɔ. Simiri nan Yɛdaya sɔtɔ. Semaya nan Simiri sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 4:38"/>Xabilane kuntigine nan ne ra. E denbayane gbo ayi nɛn han! <verse eid="1CH 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 4:39"/>E yi siga han Gedori taan lanbanna sogeteden binna balo yire fendeni e xuruseene xa. <verse eid="1CH 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 4:40"/>E sa sɛxɛ yire faɲine to mɛnni xuruseene xa. Na bɔxɔne yi gbo, bɔɲɛ xunbenla na. Xami bɔnsɔnna muxuna ndee yi na nun. <verse eid="1CH 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 4:41"/>Muxun naxanye xinle sɛbɛ itoe ra, ne nan siga Yuda Manga Xesekiyaa waxatini, e sa Xami bɔnsɔnna muxune nun Meyunin bɔnsɔnna muxune banxine birin kala, e yi e raxɔri alogo e xa dɔxɔ na, balo faɲin yi dɛnaxan yi e xuruseene xa. <verse eid="1CH 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 4:42"/>Simeyɔn bɔnsɔnna muxu kɛmɛ suulun yi siga Seyiri geya yireni. E yɛɛratine yi findixi Yisi a diine nan na: Pɛlati nun Neyaraya nun Rɛfaya nun Yusiyɛli. <verse eid="1CH 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 4:43"/>E yi sa Amalɛki dɔnxɛne faxa, naxanye e gi yɛngɛn bun. E dɔxi mɛnni han to.<verse eid="1CH 4:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CH 5"/>
  <para style="s">Rubɛn yixɛtɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 5:1"/>Rubɛn nan findi Isirayila dii singen na, koni e nun a fafe a ɲaxanla nde bata yi kafu, nanara dii singe tiden yi ba a yii, a so Isirayilaa diin Yusufu a diine yii. Na nan a liga, e a foriya tiden ba a yii bɔnsɔn kɛdin ma. <verse eid="1CH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 5:2"/>Yuda sɛnbɛn sɔtɔ nɛn a ngaxakedenne tagi, a yixɛtɛna nde yi findi mangan na, koni dii singe tiden lu nɛn Yusufu yii.<verse eid="1CH 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 5:3"/>Isirayilaa dii singen Rubɛn yi Xanɔki nun Palu nun Xesirɔn nun Karimi sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 5:4"/>Yowɛli yi Semaya sɔtɔ. Semaya yi Gogo sɔtɔ. Gogo yi Simeyi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 5:5"/>Simeyi yi Mike sɔtɔ. Mike yi Reyaya sɔtɔ. Reyaya yi Baali sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 5:6"/>Baali yi Bɛɛra sɔtɔ. Asiriya Mangan Tigilati-Pilesere yi Rubɛn bɔnsɔn xunna Bɛɛra suxu konyiyani.<verse eid="1CH 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 5:7"/>Bera ngaxakedenne ni i ra xabila yɛɛn ma alo e xinle sɛbɛxi e bɔnsɔn kɛdin kui kii naxan yi: e kuntigin Yeyiyɛli nun Sakari nun <verse eid="1CH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 5:8"/>Asasi a diin Bela, Sema mamandenna, Yowɛli tolobitana. E yi dɔxi Aroyeri nin siga han Nebo geyaan na sa dɔxɔ Baali-Meyɔn na. <verse eid="1CH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 5:9"/>Sogeteden binni, e yi siga, e sa dɔxɔ tonbonna dɛxɔn han Efirati xuden na. Bayo e xuruseene bata yi wuya ayi e yii Galadi yamanani. <verse eid="1CH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 5:10"/>Rubɛn bɔnsɔnna yi Hagarine yɛngɛ Manga Sɔli waxatini, e yi e nɔ, e yi dɔxɔ e banxine yi Galadi yamanan sogeteden binni.<verse eid="1CH 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gadi yixɛtɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 5:11"/>Gadi bɔnsɔnna muxune yi dɔxi Rubɛn bɔnsɔnna muxune nan dɛxɔn ma Basan yamanani siga han Salaka taana. <verse eid="1CH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 5:12"/>Yowɛli nan yi e kuntigi singen na Basan yamanani, a firindena, Safami. Na xanbi ra, Yanayi nun Safati. <verse eid="1CH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 5:13"/>E ngaxakedenne muxu solofere ni i ra denbaya yɛɛn ma: Mikeli nun Mesulan nun Seeba nun Yorayi nun Yakan nun Siya nun Eberi. <verse eid="1CH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 5:14"/>Abixali a diine nan ne ra. Xuri nan Abixali sɔtɔ. Yarowa nan Xuri sɔtɔ. Galadi nan Yarowa sɔtɔ. Mikeli nan Galadi sɔtɔ. Yesisayi nan Mikeli sɔtɔ. Yado nan Yesisayi sɔtɔ. Busi nan Yado sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 5:15"/>Abidiyeli a diina Axi, Guni mamandenna yi findi e xabilane xunna ra. <verse eid="1CH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 5:16"/>Gadi bɔnsɔnna muxune yi dɔxi Galadi yamanan nun Basan yamanan nun e rabilinne nin siga han Sarɔn danna. <verse eid="1CH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 5:17"/>Muxuni itoe xinle yi sɛbɛxi e bɔnsɔn kɛdin kui Yuda Manga Yotami nun Isirayila Manga Yerobowan waxatini.<verse eid="1CH 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 5:18"/>Rubɛn bɔnsɔnna muxune nun Gadi bɔnsɔnna muxune nun Manase bɔnsɔnna muxune fɔxɔ kedenna, ne sofane xasabin lan muxu wuli tonge naanin wuli naanin kɛmɛ solofere tongo sennin nan ma. E birin yi fatan yɛngɛ sodeni. Yɛɛ masansan wure lefaan nun silanfanna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">5.18</char> <char style="fk">Silanfanna:</char> Sofane yɛngɛso dɛgɛmana.</note> nun xanla yi e birin yii. <verse eid="1CH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 5:19"/>E yi Hagarine nun Yeturine nun Nafisine nun Nodabone yɛngɛ. <verse eid="1CH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 5:20"/>E yi Ala maxandi yɛngɛni, a yi e mali, e yi Hagarine nun e xɔyine birin nɔ. Ala yi e xuiin namɛ bayo e yi e yigi saxi a tan nin. <verse eid="1CH 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 5:21"/>E yi e yaxune xuruseene suxu, ɲɔgɔmɛ wuli tonge suulun nun yɛxɛɛn nun sii wuli kɛmɛ firin wuli tonge suulun, e nun sofali wuli firin. E yi muxu wuli kɛmɛ fan suxu. <verse eid="1CH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 5:22"/>E yi e yaxu wuyaxi faxa bayo na yɛngɛn yi kelixi Ala nan ma. E yi lu dɔxi na han Isirayila yamaan suxu konyiyani waxatin naxan yi.<verse eid="1CH 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Manase bɔnsɔnna yixɛtɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 5:23"/>Manase bɔnsɔnna fɔxɔ kedenna yi dɔxi yamanani keli Basan yamanan ma siga han Baali-Xerimon taana, Seniri geyaan san bun, dɛnaxan mɔn xili Xerimon geyana. E yi wuya han! <verse eid="1CH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 5:24"/>E denbayane xunne ni i ra: Efere nun Yisi nun Eliyeli nun Asiriyɛli nun Yeremi nun Hodafiya nun Yaxadiyeli. Sofa kɛndɛne nan yi na denbaya xunne ra e nun xili kanne. <verse eid="1CH 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 5:25"/>Koni, e yi tinxintareyaan liga e benbane Ala ra, e yi Ala yanfa mɛn kaane alane xɔn Ala bata yi muxun naxanye raxɔri e yɛɛ ra, feen naxan yi luxi alo yalunyana Ala yɛtagi. <verse eid="1CH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 5:26"/>Nayi, Isirayilaa Ala yi Asiriya Manga Puli radin e ma naxan mɔn xili Tigilati-Pilesere. E yi fa Rubɛn bɔnsɔnna nun Gadi bɔnsɔnna nun Manase bɔnsɔnna fɔxɔ kedenna suxu konyiyani. A yi siga e ra Xala nun Xabori nun Hara yi Gosan baan dɛ, e mɔn dɛnaxanye yi han to.<verse eid="1CH 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lewi yixɛtɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 5:27"/>Lewi yi Gɛrisɔn nun Kehati nun Merari sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 5:28"/>Kehati yi Amirama nun Yisehari nun Xebiron nun Yusiyɛli sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 5:29"/>Amirama yi dii xɛmɛ firin sɔtɔ, Haruna nun Musa e nun dii tɛmɛ keden, Mariyama. Haruna yi Nadaba nun Abihu nun Eleyasari nun Itamara sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 5:30"/>Eleyasari yi Finexasi sɔtɔ. Finexasi yi Abisuwa sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 5:31"/>Abisuwa yi Buki sɔtɔ. Buki yi Yusi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 5:32"/>Yusi yi Sɛraxaya sɔtɔ. Sɛraxaya yi Merayoti sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 5:33"/>Merayoti yi Amari sɔtɔ. Amari yi Axituba sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 5:34"/>Axituba yi Sadɔki sɔtɔ. Sadɔki yi Aximaasi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 5:35"/>Aximaasi yi Asari sɔtɔ. Asari yi Yoxanan sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 5:36"/>Yoxanan yi Asari sɔtɔ, naxan findi saraxaraliin na Ala Batu Banxini Yerusalɛn yi Sulemani naxan ti. <verse eid="1CH 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 5:37"/>Asari yi Amari sɔtɔ. Amari yi Axituba sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 5:38"/>Axituba yi Sadɔki sɔtɔ. Sadɔki yi Salun sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 5:39"/>Salun yi Xiliki sɔtɔ. Xiliki yi Asari sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 5:40"/>Asari yi Seraya sɔtɔ. Seraya yi Yehosadaki sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 5:41"/>Alatala to Yuda nun Yerusalɛn kaane rasiga konyiyani Nebukadanesari xɔn, Yehosadaki fan yi suxu.<verse eid="1CH 5:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CH 6"/>
  <para style="s">Lewi yixɛtɛ gbɛtɛye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 6:1"/>Lewi yi Gɛrisɔn nun Kehati nun Merari sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 6:2"/>Gɛrisɔn yi Libini nun Simeyi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 6:3"/>Kehati yi Amirama nun Yisehari nun Xebiron nun Yusiyɛli sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 6:4"/>Merari yi Maxali nun Musi sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 6:4">Lewi xabilane benbane ni i ra:<verse eid="1CH 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 6:5"/>Gɛrisɔn xabilani: Gɛrisɔn yi Libini sɔtɔ. Libini yi Yaxati sɔtɔ. Yaxati yi Sima sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 6:6"/>Sima yi Yowa sɔtɔ. Yowa yi Yido sɔtɔ. Yido yi Sera sɔtɔ. Sera yi Yeyaterayi sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 6:7"/>Kehati xabilani: Kehati yi Aminadabo sɔtɔ. Aminadabo yi Kora sɔtɔ. Kora yi Asiri sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 6:8"/>Asiri yi Elikana sɔtɔ. Elikana yi Ebiyasafi sɔtɔ. Ebiyasafi yi Asiri sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 6:9"/>Asiri yi Taxati sɔtɔ. Taxati yi Yuriyeli sɔtɔ. Yuriyeli yi Yusiya sɔtɔ. Yusiya yi Sayuli sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 6:10"/>Elikana xabilani: Elikana yi Amasayi nun Aximoti <verse eid="1CH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 6:11"/>nun Elikana sɔtɔ. Elikana yi Sofayi sɔtɔ. Sofayi yi Naxati sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 6:12"/>Naxati yi Eliyabi sɔtɔ. Eliyabi yi Yeroxama sɔtɔ. Yeroxama yi Elikana sɔtɔ. Elikana yi Samuyɛli sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 6:13"/>Samuyɛli a diine ni i ra: a dii singena Yowɛli e nun Abiya.<verse eid="1CH 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 6:14"/>Merari xabilani: Merari yi Maxali sɔtɔ. Maxali yi Libini sɔtɔ. Libini yi Simeyi sɔtɔ. Simeyi yi Wusa sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 6:15"/>Wusaha yi Simeya sɔtɔ. Simeya yi Xagiya sɔtɔ. Xagiya yi Asaya sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bɛti baane Ala Batu Banxini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 6:16"/>Dawuda yi Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxuna ndee dɔxɔ bɛti ba kuntigine ra Alatala Batu Banxini Layiri Kankiraan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fk">6.16</char> <char style="fk">Layiri Kankirana</char> fe mɔn sɛbɛxi Xɔrɔyaan 25.10-22 kui.</note> fa mɛnni waxatin naxan yi. <verse eid="1CH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 6:17"/>Ne nan yi bɛtine bama Ala Batu Bubun yɛtagi, Naralan Bubuna han Manga Sulemani Alatala Batu Banxin ti Yerusalɛn yi waxatin naxan yi. E yi e wanla kɛma alo e yi yamarixi e ma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="1CH 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 6:18"/>Na bɛti baane nun e diine xinle ni itoe ra:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 6:18">Kehati xabilani: Yowɛli nan bɛti baan Heman sɔtɔ. Samuyɛli nan Yowɛli sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 6:19"/>Elikana nan Samuyɛli sɔtɔ. Yeroxama nan Elikana sɔtɔ. Eliyeli nan Yeroxama sɔtɔ. Towa nan Eliyeli sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 6:20"/>Sufi nan Towa sɔtɔ. Elikana nan Sufi sɔtɔ. Maxati nan Elikana sɔtɔ. Amasayi nan Maxati sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 6:21"/>Elikana nan Amasayi sɔtɔ. Yowɛli nan Elikana sɔtɔ. Asari nan Yowɛli sɔtɔ. Sofoni nan Asari sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 6:22"/>Taxati nan Sofoni sɔtɔ. Asiri nan Taxati sɔtɔ. Ebiyasafi nan Asiri sɔtɔ. Kora nan Ebiyasafi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 6:23"/>Yisehari nan Kora sɔtɔ. Kehati nan Yisehari sɔtɔ. Lewi nan Kehati sɔtɔ. Isirayila nan Lewi sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 6:24"/>Heman mali muxun naxan yi tixi a yiifanna ma, na yi findixi Asafi nan na. Bereki nan Asafi sɔtɔ. Simeya nan Bereki sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 6:25"/>Mikeli nan Simeya sɔtɔ. Baaseya nan Mikeli sɔtɔ. Malakiya nan Baaseya sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 6:26"/>Etini nan Malakiya sɔtɔ. Sera nan Etini sɔtɔ. Adaya nan Sera sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 6:27"/>Etani nan Adaya sɔtɔ. Sima nan Etani sɔtɔ. Simeyi nan Sima sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 6:28"/>Yaxati nan Simeyi sɔtɔ. Gɛrisɔn nan Yaxati sɔtɔ. Lewi nan Gɛrisɔn sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 6:29"/>Naxan kelixi Merari xabilan nin, na yi tixi a kɔmɛnna nan ma. A yi xili Etani. Kisi nan Etani sɔtɔ. Abidi nan Kisi sɔtɔ. Maluku nan Abidi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 6:30"/>Hasabi nan Maluku sɔtɔ. Amasiya nan Hasabi sɔtɔ. Xiliki nan Amasiya sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 6:31"/>Amasi nan Xiliki sɔtɔ. Bani nan Amasi sɔtɔ. Semeri nan Bani sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 6:32"/>Maxali nan Semeri sɔtɔ. Musi nan Maxali sɔtɔ. Merari nan Musi sɔtɔ. Lewi nan Merari sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 6:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 6:33"/>E ngaxakedenne Lewi bɔnsɔnni, ne yi Ala Batu Bubun wanla bonne nan kɛma Alaa banxini. <verse eid="1CH 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 6:34"/>Haruna nun a diine nan yi saraxa gan daxine bama saraxa ganden fari, e mɔn yi wusulanna fan ganma saraxan na wusulan saraxa ganden fari. E yi na wanle birin kɛma yire sariɲanxi fisamantenna nin Ala solona feen na Isirayila kaane xa, alo Alaa walikɛɛn Musa a yamari kii naxan yi.<verse eid="1CH 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 6:35"/>Haruna yixɛtɛne ni i ra: Haruna yi Eleyasari sɔtɔ. Eleyasari yi Finexasi sɔtɔ. Finexasi yi Abisuwa sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 6:36"/>Abisuwa yi Buki sɔtɔ. Buki yi Yusi sɔtɔ. Yusi yi Sɛraxaya sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 6:37"/>Sɛraxaya yi Merayoti sɔtɔ. Merayoti yi Amari sɔtɔ. Amari yi Axituba sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 6:38"/>Axituba yi Sadɔki sɔtɔ. Sadɔki yi Aximaasi sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lewi bɔnsɔnna taane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JOS 21:4-39">Yosuwe 21.4-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 6:39"/>E taane xinle ni itoe ra Haruna yixɛtɛn naxanye yi Kehati xabilani, ne dɔxɔ dɛnaxanye yi. E singe nan bɔxɔn sɔtɔ bayo masɛnsɛnna e tan nan singe suxu. <verse eid="1CH 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 6:40"/>Xebiron nun a xuruse rabadene yi findi e gbeen na Yuda bɔxɔn ma, <verse eid="1CH 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 6:41"/>koni Xebiron xɛɛne nun a banxidɛne yi findi Yefune a diin Kalebi gbeen na. <verse eid="1CH 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 6:42"/>Harunaa diine yi Xebiron sɔtɔ, naxan findi marakisi taana nde ra, e nun Libina nun a rabilinne nun Yatiri nun Esitemowa nun a rabilinne, e nun <verse eid="1CH 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 6:43"/>Xilen nun Debiri nun e rabilinne nun <verse eid="1CH 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 6:44"/>Asan nun Beti-Semɛsi nun e rabilinne. <verse eid="1CH 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 6:45"/>Lewi bɔnsɔnna taan naxanye sɔtɔ Bunyamin bɔnsɔnna bɔxɔni, ne ni i ra: Gabayon nun Geba nun Alemeti nun Anatɔti nun e rabilinne. E yi taa fu nun saxanni itoe yitaxun e xabilane ra.<verse eid="1CH 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JOS 21:5-8">Yosuwe 21.5-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 6:46"/>Kehati yixɛtɛn bonne yi taa fu sɔtɔ masɛnsɛnna xɔn Efirami bɔnsɔnna bɔxɔn nun Dan bɔnsɔnna bɔxɔn nun Manase bɔnsɔnna fɔxɔ kedenna bɔxɔni. <verse eid="1CH 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 6:47"/>Gɛrisɔn yixɛtɛne yi taa fu nun saxan sɔtɔ e xabila yɛɛn ma Isakari bɔnsɔnna bɔxɔn nun Aseri bɔnsɔnna bɔxɔn nun Nafatali bɔnsɔnna bɔxɔn nun Manase bɔnsɔnna fɔxɔ kedenna bɔxɔni naxan yi Basan yamanani. <verse eid="1CH 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 6:48"/>Merari yixɛtɛne yi taa fu nun firin sɔtɔ masɛnsɛnna xɔn Rubɛn bɔnsɔnna bɔxɔn nun Gadi bɔnsɔnna bɔxɔn nun Sabulon bɔnsɔnna bɔxɔni.<verse eid="1CH 6:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 6:49"/>Isirayila kaane taane nun e rabilinne fi Lewi bɔnsɔnna ma na kii nin. <verse eid="1CH 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 6:50"/>E na taane fi e ma masɛnsɛnna nan xɔn naxanye yi Yuda nun Simeyɔn nun Bunyamin bɔnsɔnne bɔxɔne yi.<verse eid="1CH 6:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 6:51"/>Kehati xabilan bonne yi taane sɔtɔ Efirami bɔnsɔnna bɔxɔni. <verse eid="1CH 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 6:52"/>E yi marakisi taan Siken fi e ma Efirami geya yireni, e nun Geseri nun <verse eid="1CH 6:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 6:53"/>Yokemen nun Beti-Xoron nun e rabilinne, e nun <verse eid="1CH 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 6:54"/>Ayalɔn nun Gati-Rimɔn nun e rabilinne. <verse eid="1CH 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 6:55"/>E yi Aneri nun Bileyami nun e rabilinne sɔtɔ Manase bɔnsɔnna fɔxɔ kedenna bɔxɔni. Kehati xabilan bonne taane nan ne ra.<verse eid="1CH 6:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CH 6:56"/>Gɛrisɔn yixɛtɛne taane ni i ra: Golan nun a rabilinna Basan yamanani, e nun Asatarɔti nun a rabilinna Manase bɔnsɔnna fɔxɔ kedenna bɔxɔni. <verse eid="1CH 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CH 6:57"/>E taan naxanye sɔtɔ Isakari bɔnsɔnna bɔxɔni, ne ni i ra: Kedesi nun Dabɛrati nun <verse eid="1CH 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CH 6:58"/>Ramoti nun Anemi nun e rabilinne. <verse eid="1CH 6:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1CH 6:59"/>E taan naxanye sɔtɔ Aseri bɔnsɔnna bɔxɔni, ne ni i ra: Masala nun Abadon nun <verse eid="1CH 6:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1CH 6:60"/>Xukɔku nun Rexobo nun e rabilinne. <verse eid="1CH 6:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="1CH 6:61"/>E taan naxanye sɔtɔ Nafatali bɔnsɔnna bɔxɔni, ne ni i ra: Kedesi taan Galile bɔxɔni, e nun Xamɔn nun Kiriyatayimi nun e rabilinne.<verse eid="1CH 6:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1CH 6:62"/>Lewi bɔnsɔn dɔnxɛne, Merari yixɛtɛne taane ni i ra: Rimono nun Taboro nun e rabilinne Sabulon bɔnsɔnna bɔxɔni. <verse eid="1CH 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1CH 6:63"/>E taan naxanye sɔtɔ Rubɛn bɔnsɔnna bɔxɔni Yurudɛn kidi ma Yeriko sogeteden binni, ne ni i ra: Bɛsɛri tonbonni e nun a rabilinne nun Yahasi nun <verse eid="1CH 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="1CH 6:64"/>Kedemoti nun Mefaati nun e rabilinne. <verse eid="1CH 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="1CH 6:65"/>E taan naxanye sɔtɔ Gadi bɔnsɔnna bɔxɔni, ne ni i ra: Ramoti nun a rabilinne Galadi bɔxɔni e nun Maxanayin nun <verse eid="1CH 6:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="1CH 6:66"/>Xɛsibɔn nun Yaasɛri nun e rabilinne.<verse eid="1CH 6:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CH 7"/>
  <para style="s">Isakari yixɛtɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 7:1"/>Isakari dii naanin nan sɔtɔ: Tola nun Puwa nun Yasubu nun Simiron. <verse eid="1CH 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 7:2"/>Tolaa diine ni i ra: Yusi nun Rɛfaya nun Yeriyeli nun Yamayi nun Yibisami nun Samuyɛli. Muxuni itoe nan findi e xabila xunne ra. Sofa kɛndɛn muxu wuli mɔxɔɲɛn nun firin kɛmɛ sennin nan xili yi sɛbɛxi e bɔnsɔn kɛdin ma Manga Dawudaa waxatini.<verse eid="1CH 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 7:3"/>Yusi yi Yisiraxiya sɔtɔ. Yisiraxiyaa diine ni i ra: Mikeli nun Abadi nun Yowɛli nun Yisiya. Muxu suulunni itoe findi xabila xunne nan na. <verse eid="1CH 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 7:4"/>Sofa kɛndɛn muxu wuli tonge saxan muxu wuli sennin nan yi e xabilani e bɔnsɔn kɛdin kui, bayo e ɲaxanle nun e diine yi wuya han! <verse eid="1CH 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 7:5"/>Isakari xabilane birin yi, sofa wuli tonge solomasɛxɛ wuli solofere nan xili yi sɛbɛxi e bɔnsɔn kɛdin ma.<verse eid="1CH 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bunyamin yixɛtɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 7:6"/>Bunyamin yi Bela nun Bekeri nun Yediyayeli sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 7:7"/>Belaa dii suulunne ni i ra: Ɛsibon nun Yusi nun Yusiyɛli nun Yerimoti nun Yiri. Xabila xunne nan yi e ra. Sofaan muxu wuli mɔxɔɲɛn nun firin tonge saxan e nun naanin nan xili yi sɛbɛxi e bɔnsɔn kɛdin ma. <verse eid="1CH 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 7:8"/>Bekeri a diine ni i ra: Semira nun Yowasa nun Eliyeseri nun Eliyowenayi nun Omiri nun Yeremoti nun Abiya nun Anatɔti nun Alemeti. Bekeri a diine nan yi ne ra, <verse eid="1CH 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 7:9"/>e denbayane xunne nan yi e birin na. Sofaan muxu wuli mɔxɔɲɛ muxu kɛmɛ firin nan xili yi sɛbɛxi e bɔnsɔn kɛdin ma.<verse eid="1CH 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 7:10"/>Yediyayeli yi Bilihan sɔtɔ. Bilihan ma diine ni i ra: Yewusi nun Bunyamin nun Ehudu nun Kenan nun Satan nun Tarasisi nun Axisaxari. <verse eid="1CH 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 7:11"/>Yediyayeli a diine birin findi e denbayane xunne nan na. Sofaan muxu wuli fu nun solofere muxu kɛmɛ firin nan xili yi sɛbɛxi e bɔnsɔn kɛdin ma.<verse eid="1CH 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 7:12"/>Yiri yi Supimi nun Xupimi sɔtɔ. Axeri yi Xusimi sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nafatali yixɛtɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 7:13"/>Nafatali yi Yaxaseeli nun Guni nun Yeseri nun Salun sɔtɔ. Nafatali nga yi xili nɛn Bila.<verse eid="1CH 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Manase yixɛtɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 7:14"/>Manase a diine ni i ra: Asirɛli nun Makiri. Manase a konyi ɲaxanla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">7.14</char> <char style="fk">Konyi ɲaxanle</char> sariyan sɛbɛxi Xɔrɔyaan 21.7-11 kui. Konyin na a ra, a naxan sɔtɔ a ɲaxanla ra.</note> Arami kaan nan ne bari a xa. Makiri yi Galadi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 7:15"/>Makiri yi ɲaxanla fen Xupimi nun Supimi muxune yɛ. Makiri magilɛn yi xili nɛn Maka. Manase a diin boden yi xili nɛn Selofexadi, a dii tɛmɛne nan tun sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 7:16"/>Makiri a ɲaxanla Maka yi diin bari, a yi a xili sa Peresa. A xunyɛn yi xili Seresi. Peresa yi Yulami nun Rekemi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 7:17"/>Yulami yi Bedani sɔtɔ. Galadi a diine nan ne ra, Makiri a diina, Manase mamandenna. <verse eid="1CH 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 7:18"/>Galadi magilɛn Hamoleketi yi Isihodi nun Abiyeseri nun Maxala bari. <verse eid="1CH 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 7:19"/>Sɛmida yi Axiyani nun Siken nun Likixi nun Aniyama sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Efirami yixɛtɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 7:20"/>Efirami yixɛtɛne ni i ra: Efirami yi Sutela sɔtɔ. Sutela yi Bereda sɔtɔ. Bereda yi Taxati sɔtɔ. Taxati yi Eleyada sɔtɔ. Eleyada yi Taxati sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 7:21"/>Taxati yi Sabadi sɔtɔ. Sabadi yi Sutela sɔtɔ. Gati kaane yi Efirami a dii firin gbɛtɛye faxa, Eseri nun Eleyadi, e to siga Gati kaane xuruseene muɲadeni. <verse eid="1CH 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 7:22"/>E fafe Efirami yi sunu e faxa feen na waxati xunkuye. A kon kaane yi fa a madɛndɛn. <verse eid="1CH 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 7:23"/>Na xanbi ra, a yi a ɲaxanla kolon ɲaxanla ra, a ɲaxanla yi fudikan. A to diin bari, a yi a xili sa Beriya bayo a denbayaan yi tɔrɔxi. <verse eid="1CH 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 7:24"/>Efirami yi dii tɛmɛn sɔtɔ, a yi a xili sa Seera. Beti-Xoron taan naxan geyaan fari e nun naxan lanbanni, Seera yi ne ti e nun Yuseni-Seera taana. <verse eid="1CH 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 7:25"/>Beriya yi Refa sɔtɔ. Refa yi Resefa sɔtɔ. Resefa yi Tela sɔtɔ. Tela yi Taxani sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 7:26"/>Taxani yi Ladana sɔtɔ. Ladana yi Amixudi sɔtɔ. Amixudi yi Elisama sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 7:27"/>Elisama yi Nunu sɔtɔ. Nunu yi Yosuwe sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 7:28"/>E yi dɔxɔ Betɛli yi e nun a banxidɛɛn naxanye yi a rabilinxi, e nun Naran taan sogeteden binni nun Geseri nun a banxidɛne sogegododen binni, e nun Siken nun a banxidɛne siga han Aya nun a banxidɛne. <verse eid="1CH 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 7:29"/>Manase bɔnsɔnna taane ni i ra: Beti-Seyan nun Taanaki nun Megido nun Dɔrɔ nun e banxidɛne. Isirayilaa diin Yusufu yixɛtɛne dɔxi na taane nin.<verse eid="1CH 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aseri yixɛtɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 7:30"/>Aseri yi Yimina nun Yisiwa nun Yisiwi nun Beriya sɔtɔ. E magilɛn yi xili Sera. <verse eid="1CH 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 7:31"/>Beriya yi Xeberi nun Malikili sɔtɔ. Malikili nan Birisayiti taan masɛgɛ. <verse eid="1CH 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 7:32"/>Xeberi yi Yefeleti nun Someri nun Xotami sɔtɔ. E magilɛn yi xili Suya. <verse eid="1CH 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 7:33"/>Yefeleti yi Pasaki nun Bimali nun Asefati sɔtɔ. Yefeleti a diine nan ne ra. <verse eid="1CH 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 7:34"/>Semeri yi Axi nun Roga nun Xuba nun Arami sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 7:35"/>Semeri xunyɛn Helemi a diine ni i ra: Sofaxa nun Yimena nun Selesi nun Amali. <verse eid="1CH 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 7:36"/>Sofaxaa diine ni i ra: Suwa nun Xaraneferi nun Suwali nun Beri nun Yimira nun <verse eid="1CH 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 7:37"/>Bɛsɛri nun Hodo nun Samima nun Silesa nun Itiran nun Beera. <verse eid="1CH 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 7:38"/>Yeteri yi Yefune nun Pisepa nun Ara sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 7:39"/>Yula yi Ara nun Xaniyeli nun Risiya sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 7:40"/>Aseri a diine nan ne birin na, denbaya xunne, muxu gbeene, sofa kɛndɛne, kuntigi faɲine. Sofaan muxu wuli mɔxɔɲɛn nun sennin nan xili yi sɛbɛxi e bɔnsɔn kɛdin kui.<verse eid="1CH 7:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CH 8"/>
  <para style="s">Bunyamin yixɛtɛ gbɛtɛye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 8:1"/>Bunyamin ma diine ni i ra: a dii singena Bela, a firindena Asibeli, a saxandena Axara, <verse eid="1CH 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 8:2"/>a naanindena Noxa, a suulundena Rafa. <verse eid="1CH 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 8:3"/>Bela a diine ni i ra: Adari nun Gera nun Abihudi nun <verse eid="1CH 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 8:4"/>Abisuwa nun Naman nun Axowa nun <verse eid="1CH 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 8:5"/>Gera nun Sefufani e nun Xurami. <verse eid="1CH 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 8:6"/>Denbaya xunne Ehudu yixɛtɛne yɛ Geba taani naxanye kedi, e siga Manaxati yi, ne xinle ni itoe ra: <verse eid="1CH 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 8:7"/>Naman nun Axiya nun Gera. Gera nan ti e yɛɛ ra, a yi Yusa nun Axixudi sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 8:8"/>Saxarayin yi a mɛ a ɲaxalan firinne ra, Xusimi nun Baara. Na xanbi ra, a yi diine sɔtɔ Moyaba yamanani. <verse eid="1CH 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 8:9"/>A ɲaxanla Xodesi a diine ni i ra: Yobabo nun Sibiya nun Mesa nun Malakama <verse eid="1CH 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 8:10"/>nun Yewusi nun Sakiya nun Mirima. A diine nan ne ra naxanye findi denbaya xunne ra.<verse eid="1CH 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 8:11"/>A ɲaxanla Xusimi yi Abitubu nun Elipaali bari a xa. <verse eid="1CH 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 8:12"/>Elipaali a diine ni i ra: Eberi nun Misami nun Semedi, naxan Ono nun Lodi nun e banxidɛne ti, e nun <verse eid="1CH 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 8:13"/>Beriya nun Sema naxanye findi denbaya xunne ra Ayalɔn taani, e yi Gati kaane kedi.<verse eid="1CH 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 8:14"/>Beriya a diine ni i ra: Axiyo nun Sasaki nun Yeremoti nun <verse eid="1CH 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 8:15"/>Sebadiya nun Aradi nun Ederi nun <verse eid="1CH 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 8:16"/>Mikeli nun Yisepa nun Yoxa.<verse eid="1CH 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 8:17"/>Elipaali a diine ni i ra: Sebadiya nun Mesulan nun Xisiki nun Xeberi nun <verse eid="1CH 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 8:18"/>Yisemerayi nun Yisiliya nun Yobabo.<verse eid="1CH 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 8:19"/>Simeyi a diine ni i ra: Yakimi nun Sikiri nun Sabidi nun <verse eid="1CH 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 8:20"/>Eliyenayi nun Siletayi nun Eliyeli nun <verse eid="1CH 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 8:21"/>Adaya nun Bɛraya nun Simirati.<verse eid="1CH 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 8:22"/>Sasaki a diine ni i ra: Yisepan nun Eberi nun Eliyeli nun <verse eid="1CH 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 8:23"/>Abadon nun Sikiri nun Xanan nun <verse eid="1CH 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 8:24"/>Xananiya nun Elan nun Anatotiya nun <verse eid="1CH 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 8:25"/>Yifideya nun Penuyɛli.<verse eid="1CH 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 8:26"/>Yeroxamaa diine ni i ra: Sameserayi nun Sexaraya nun Atali nun <verse eid="1CH 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 8:27"/>Yaaresiya nun Eli nun Sikiri.<verse eid="1CH 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 8:28"/>Denbaya xunne nan yi ne birin na naxanye xili yi sɛbɛxi e bɔnsɔn kɛdin kui. Ne yi dɔxi Yerusalɛn taan nin.<verse eid="1CH 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="r">Taruxune Singen 9.34-44</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 8:29"/>Yeyiyɛli yi dɔxi Gabayon taan nin a dɛnaxan masɛgɛ. A ɲaxanla yi xili nɛn Maka. <verse eid="1CH 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 8:30"/>A diine ni i ra: a dii singena Abadon nun Suru nun Kisu nun Baali nun Neri nun Nadaba nun <verse eid="1CH 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 8:31"/>Gedori nun Axiyo nun Sekeri nun <verse eid="1CH 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 8:32"/>Mikiloti, naxan findi Simeya fafe ra. E fan yi dɔxi Yerusalɛn taan nin e kon kaane tagi.<verse eid="1CH 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 8:33"/>Neri yi Kisu sɔtɔ. Kisu yi Sɔli sɔtɔ. Sɔli yi Yonatan nun Maliki-Suwa nun Abinadabo nun Esibaali sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 8:34"/>Yonatan yi Meribaali sɔtɔ. Meribaali yi Mike sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 8:35"/>Mike yi Piton nun Meleki nun Tareya nun Axasi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 8:36"/>Axasi yi Yehowada sɔtɔ. Yehowada yi Alemeti nun Asamawɛti nun Simiri sɔtɔ. Simiri yi Mosa sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 8:37"/>Mosa yi Bineya sɔtɔ. Bineya yi Rafaha sɔtɔ. Rafaha yi Eleyasa sɔtɔ. Eleyasa yi Aseli sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 8:38"/>Aseli a dii senninne xinle ni itoe ra: Asirikami nun Bokeru nun Yisimayɛli nun Seyari nun Abadi nun Xanan. Aseli a dii xɛmɛne nan ne birin na. <verse eid="1CH 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 8:39"/>Aseli xunyɛna Esekaa diine ni i ra: a dii singena Yulami, a firindena Yewusi e nun a saxandena Elifeleti. <verse eid="1CH 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 8:40"/>Sofa kɛndɛn nan yi Yulami a diine ra. E yi fatan xalimakunla wolɛ. E diine nun mamandenne yi wuya han muxu kɛmɛ tonge suulun.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 8:40">Bunyamin bɔnsɔnna muxune nan yi ne birin na.<verse eid="1CH 8:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CH 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 9:1"/>Isirayila kaane birin xinle yi sɛbɛxi e bɔnsɔn kɛdine ma Isirayila Mangane Kɛdin kui.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1CH 9:1">Yerusalɛn kaane</para>
  <para style="r" vid="1CH 9:1">
    <ref loc="NEH 11:3-19">Neyemi 11.3-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 9:1">Yuda bɔnsɔnna muxune bata yi xali konyiyani Babilɔn yamanani fata e tinxintareyaan na. <verse eid="1CH 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 9:2"/>Naxanye singe xɛtɛ e dɔxɔdeni e konne yi, Isirayila kaana ndee nan yi ne ra, e nun saraxaraline nun Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune nun Ala Batu Banxin walikɛne.<verse eid="1CH 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 9:3"/>Muxuna ndee Yuda nun Bunyamin nun Efirami nun Manase bɔnsɔnne yi, ne yi fa dɔxɔ Yerusalɛn taani. <verse eid="1CH 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 9:4"/>Amixudi nan Yutayi sɔtɔ. Omiri nan Amixudi sɔtɔ. Yimiri nan Omiri sɔtɔ. Bani nan Yimiri sɔtɔ Peresi xabilani Yuda bɔnsɔnni. <verse eid="1CH 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 9:5"/>Silo kaan naxanye yi dɔxi Yerusalɛn yi, ne ni i ra: Asaya, dii singena, e nun a diine. <verse eid="1CH 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 9:6"/>Sera xabilan muxun naxan dɔxɔ na, na ni i ra: Yɛwɛli. Yuda bɔnsɔnna muxu kɛmɛ sennin tonge solomanaanin nan yi dɔxi Yerusalɛn yi.<verse eid="1CH 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 9:7"/>Bunyamin bɔnsɔnna muxun naxanye yi dɔxi na, ne ni i ra: a singena Salu. Mesulan nan Salu sɔtɔ. Hodafiya nan Mesulan sɔtɔ. Hasɛnuwa nan Hodafiya sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 9:8"/>E nun Yibineya, Yeroxamaa diina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 9:8">E nun Ela, Yusi a diina. Mikiri nan Yusi sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 9:8">E nun Mesulan. Sɛfati nan Mesulan sɔtɔ. Reyuli nan Sɛfati sɔtɔ. Yibiniya nan Reyuli sɔtɔ.<verse eid="1CH 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 9:9"/>Bunyamin bɔnsɔnna muxune lan muxu kɛmɛ solomanaanin tonge suulun e nun sennin nan ma naxanye yi sɛbɛxi e bɔnsɔn kɛdin kui. Denbaya xunne nan yi xɛmɛni itoe birin na.<verse eid="1CH 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 9:10"/>Saraxaraliin naxanye yi dɔxi Yerusalɛn yi, ne ni i ra: Yɛdaya nun Yehoyaribu nun Yakin nun <verse eid="1CH 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 9:11"/>Asari. Xiliki nan Asari sɔtɔ. Mesulan nan Xiliki sɔtɔ. Sadɔki nan Mesulan sɔtɔ. Merayoti nan Sadɔki sɔtɔ. Axituba nan Merayoti sɔtɔ. Axituba nan yi Alaa banxin wanla xun na. <verse eid="1CH 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 9:12"/>Adaya fan yi na. Yeroxama nan Adaya sɔtɔ. Pasaxuri nan Yeroxama sɔtɔ. Malakiya nan Pasaxuri sɔtɔ. Masayi nan Malakiya sɔtɔ. Adiyeli nan Masayi sɔtɔ. Yasera nan Adiyeli sɔtɔ. Mesulan nan Yasera sɔtɔ. Mesilemiti nan Mesulan sɔtɔ. Imeri nan Mesilemiti sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 9:13"/>Saraxaraliin naxanye yi dɔxi Yerusalɛn yi, ne denbaya xunne lanxi muxu wuli keden kɛmɛ solofere tonge sennin nan ma. Alaa banxin walikɛ kɛndɛn nan yi e birin na.<verse eid="1CH 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 9:14"/>Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxun naxanye yi dɔxi Yerusalɛn yi, ne ni i ra: Xasubu a diin Semaya, Asirikami mamandenna, Merari kaan Hasabi tolobitana, <verse eid="1CH 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 9:15"/>e nun Bakibakari nun Xeresi nun Galali nun Mikaa diin Matani, Sikiri mamandenna, Asafi tolobitana, <verse eid="1CH 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 9:16"/>e nun Semayaa diin Abadi, Galali mamandenna, Yedutun tolobitana, e nun Asaa diin Bereki, Elikana mamandenna, naxan yi Netofa banxidɛne yi.<verse eid="1CH 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 9:17"/>Ala Batu Banxin so dɛɛn kantan muxune ni i ra: Salun, naxan yi e xun na e nun Akubu nun Talamɔn nun Aximan nun e ngaxakedenne. <verse eid="1CH 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 9:18"/>Salun yi Mangan So Dɛɛn kantanma Ala Batu Banxini sogeteden mabinni han to. Lewi bɔnsɔnna daaxaden kantan muxune nan yi e benbane ra nun. <verse eid="1CH 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 9:19"/>Kore a diin nan yi Salun na. Ebiyasafi nan Kore sɔtɔ. Kora nan Ebiyasafi sɔtɔ. Salun nun a ngaxakedenne nan yi Ala batu bubun dɛɛne kantanma alo e benbane yi Alatalaa yamaan daaxaden kantanma kii naxan yi. <verse eid="1CH 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 9:20"/>Eleyasari a diin Finexasi nan yi so dɛɛn kantan tiine xunna ra a singeni nun. Alatala yi a xɔn. <verse eid="1CH 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 9:21"/>Naralan Bubun so dɛɛn kantan muxun nan yi Meselemiyaa diin Sakari ra nun.<verse eid="1CH 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 9:22"/>Muxu kɛmɛ firin muxu fu nun firin nan sugandi kantan tiine ra. Ne nan xili sɛbɛxi e bɔnsɔn kɛdin ma e taane yi. Dawuda nun fe toon Samuyɛli nan na lannaya wanla so e benbane yii. <verse eid="1CH 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 9:23"/>E tan nun e diine nan yi Alatala batuden so dɛɛne kantanma naxan mɔn yi xili Ala Batu Bubuna. <verse eid="1CH 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 9:24"/>A so dɛɛn kantan muxuna ndee yi tixi a sogeteden nun a sogegododen nun a kɔmɛnna nun a yiifanna ma. <verse eid="1CH 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 9:25"/>E ngaxakedenna naxanye yi e taane yi, ne yi fama e malideni yɛyɛ xii solofere. <verse eid="1CH 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 9:26"/>Anu, Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxu naaninna naxanye yi so dɛɛn kantan ti kuntigine ra, ne yi Alaa banxin nafunla ramaradene nan kantanma. <verse eid="1CH 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 9:27"/>E yi xima Alaa banxin nabilinna nin alogo e xa mɛnna makantan, e yi a so dɛɛne rabi xɔtɔnni.<verse eid="1CH 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 9:28"/>Saraxa raba seene kantan tiine nan yi ndee ra e yɛ Ala Batu Banxini, e tan nan yi e yatɛma e nɛma rasoɛ e nun e nɛma e raminɛ. <verse eid="1CH 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 9:29"/>Ndee yi se dɔnxɛne marama yire sariɲanxini, e nun murutu fuɲin nun manpaan nun turen nun wusulanna nun latikɔnɔnna. <verse eid="1CH 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 9:30"/>Saraxaraline nan yi latikɔnɔnne basanma. <verse eid="1CH 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 9:31"/>Salun ma dii singen Matitiya, Lewin naxan keli Kora xabilani, na nan yi burun ganma naxan yi bama saraxan na. <verse eid="1CH 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 9:32"/>E ngaxakedenna ndee Kehati xabilani, ne nan yi burun dɔxɔma tabanla fari Matabu Lɔxɔne birin yi.<verse eid="1CH 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 9:33"/>Lewi denbaya xunna naxanye yi bɛtin bama, ne yi dɔxɔ Ala Batu Banxin kui. Wali gbɛtɛ yo mi yi e ma, bayo e yi walima waxatin birin kɔɛɛn nun yanyina. <verse eid="1CH 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 9:34"/>Lewi denbaya xunne nan yi ne ra, naxanye xinle yi sɛbɛxi e bɔnsɔn kɛdin kui. E yi dɔxi Yerusalɛn nin.<verse eid="1CH 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sɔli xabilana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 9:35"/>Yeyiyɛli yi dɔxi Gabayon taan nin a dɛnaxan masɛgɛ. A ɲaxanla yi xili nɛn Maka. <verse eid="1CH 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 9:36"/>A diine ni i ra: a dii singena Abadon nun Suru nun Kisu nun Baali nun Neri nun Nadaba nun <verse eid="1CH 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 9:37"/>Gedori nun Axiyo nun Sakari nun Mikiloti. <verse eid="1CH 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 9:38"/>Mikiloti yi Simeyami sɔtɔ. E yi dɔxi e kon kaane nan dɛxɔn ma Yerusalɛn yi. <verse eid="1CH 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 9:39"/>Neri yi Kisu sɔtɔ. Kisu yi Sɔli sɔtɔ. Sɔli yi Yonatan nun Maliki-Suwa nun Abinadabo nun Esibaali sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 9:40"/>Yonatan yi Meribaali sɔtɔ. Meribaali yi Mike sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 9:41"/>Mike yi Piton nun Meleki nun Tareya nun Axasi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 9:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 9:42"/>Axasi yi Yara sɔtɔ. Yara yi Alemeti nun Asamawɛti nun Simiri sɔtɔ. Simiri yi Mosa sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 9:43"/>Mosa yi Bineya sɔtɔ. Bineya yi Rɛfaya sɔtɔ. Rɛfaya yi Eleyasa sɔtɔ. Eleyasa yi Aseli sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 9:44"/>Aseli a dii senninne ni i ra: Asirikami nun Bokeru nun Yisimayɛli nun Seyari nun Abadi nun Xanan. Aseli a diine nan yi ne ra.<verse eid="1CH 9:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CH 10"/>
  <para style="s">Manga Sɔli a sayana</para>
  <para style="r">Samuyɛli Singen 31.1-13 nun Samuyɛli Firinden 1.4-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 10:1"/>Filisitine yi Isirayila yɛngɛ. Isirayila kaane yi e gi, e wuyaxi yi faxa Gilibowa geyaan fari. <verse eid="1CH 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 10:2"/>Filisitine yi xaɲɛ ayi Sɔli nun a diine xili ma. E yi Sɔli a dii xɛmɛne faxa, Yonatan nun Abinadabo nun Maliki-Suwa. <verse eid="1CH 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 10:3"/>Yɛngɛn yi wolon Sɔli rabilinni, xali wonle yi a li, a yi gaxu e yɛɛ ra han! <verse eid="1CH 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 10:4"/>Sɔli yi a fala a yɛngɛ so se maxanla xa, a naxa, “I ya silanfanna tongo, i yi n faxa, bayo n mi waxi Ala kolontareni itoe xa n tɔrɔ, e yi n faxa.” Koni a yɛngɛ so se maxanla yi tondi, bayo a yi gaxuxi han! Nayi, Sɔli yi a silanfanna tongo a sɔnsɔn a dɛ. <verse eid="1CH 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 10:5"/>Sɔli a yɛngɛ so se maxanla to a to faxaxi, a fan yi sɔnsɔn a silanfanna dɛ, e birin yi faxa. <verse eid="1CH 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 10:6"/>Sɔli nun a dii xɛmɛ saxanne nun a denbayaan birin faxa e bode xɔn ma na kii nin. <verse eid="1CH 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 10:7"/>Isirayila kaan naxanye yi lanbanni, ne yi a to a Isirayila ganla yi a gima e nun Sɔli nun a diine bata yi faxa. E yi e taane rabeɲin, e yi e gi. Filisitine yi fa dɔxɔ na.<verse eid="1CH 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 10:8"/>Na xɔtɔn bode, Filisitine yi fa binbine yii seene tongodeni, e yi Sɔli nun a diine binbine to biraxi Gilibowa geyaan fari. <verse eid="1CH 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 10:9"/>E yi a yii seene birin tongo, e yi Sɔli xunna nun a yɛngɛ so seene xali. E yi na xibarun nasiga Filisitine yamanan birin yi, e suxure batudene nun e yamani. <verse eid="1CH 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 10:10"/>E yi Sɔli a yɛngɛ so seene sa e alane batu banxin kui. E yi a xunna singan e ala Dagɔn batu banxin kui. <verse eid="1CH 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 10:11"/>Yabɛsi-Galadi kaane to a mɛ Filisitine feen naxanye birin ligaxi Sɔli ra, <verse eid="1CH 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 10:12"/>e xɛmɛ sɛnbɛmane birin yi keli, e Sɔli nun a diine binbine tongo. E yi xɛtɛ e ra, e sa e xɔnne maluxun konden bun Yabɛsi yi. Yabɛsi kaane yi sunna suxu xii solofere. <verse eid="1CH 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 10:13"/>Sɔli faxa a tinxintareyaan nan ma Alatala mabinni. A mi Alatalaa falan suxu, a sa muxuna nde maxɔdin naxan falan tima barinne ra. <verse eid="1CH 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 10:14"/>A mi Alatala maxɔdin. Na ma, Alatala yi a faxa, a yi Sɔli a mangayaan fi Yese a diin Dawuda ma.<verse eid="1CH 10:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CH 11"/>
  <para style="s">Dawuda yi findi mangan na Isirayila xun na</para>
  <para style="r">Samuyɛli Firinden 5.1-3</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 11:1"/>Isirayila kaane birin yi fa Dawuda fɛma Xebiron taani, e yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “En wuli keden fasa keden. <verse eid="1CH 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 11:2"/>Waxati danguxine yi, hali Manga Sɔli a waxatini, i tan nan yi Isirayila sofa gali xunna ra. Alatala, i ya Ala yi a fala i xa, a naxa, ‘I tan nan findima n ma yamana Isirayila kantan muxun na, i findi e yɛɛratiin na.’ ”<verse eid="1CH 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 11:3"/>Isirayila fonne birin yi fa mangan fɛma Xebiron yi. Dawuda yi layirin tongo e xa Alatala yɛtagi. E yi turen sa a xunni a dɔxɔ feen na Isirayila mangan na, alo Alatala a fala Nabi Samuyɛli xa kii naxan yi.<verse eid="1CH 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="r">Samuyɛli Firinden 5.6-10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 11:4"/>Manga Dawuda nun Isirayila kaane yi siga Yerusalɛn taani, naxan mɔn yi xili Yebusu. Yebusune yi dɔxi na nin. <verse eid="1CH 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 11:5"/>E yi a fala Dawuda xa, e naxa, “I mi soɛ be.” Koni, Dawuda yi Siyon taa makantanxin masɔtɔ, a naxan xili sa Dawudaa Taana. <verse eid="1CH 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 11:6"/>Dawuda bata yi a fala, a naxa, “Naxan singen na Yebusune yɛngɛ, n na kanna findima nɛn sofa mangan na.” Seruyaa diin Yowaba nan singe yɛngɛn so, a yi findi sofa mangan na. <verse eid="1CH 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 11:7"/>Dawuda yi dɔxɔ taa makantanxini, nanara e yi mɛn xili sa a Dawudaa Taana. <verse eid="1CH 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 11:8"/>Dawuda yi mɛnna nun na rabilinna ti keli Milo gbingbinna ma han sa dɔxɔ yinna ra. Yowaba fan yi taan dɔnxɛni tɔn. <verse eid="1CH 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 11:9"/>Dawuda sɛnbɛn yi gbo, bayo Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna yi a xɔn.<verse eid="1CH 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dawudaa sofa wɛkilɛxine</para>
  <para style="r">Samuyɛli Firinden 23.8-39 nun Taruxune Singen 27.2-15</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 11:10"/>Dawudaa sofa wɛkilɛxine kuntigine ni i ra, naxanye yi a malima Isirayila birin mangayaan fendeni, alo Alatala bata yi a fala kii naxan yi. <verse eid="1CH 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 11:11"/>Dawudaa sofa wɛkilɛxine ni i ra: Xakimoni xabilan muxuna nde Yasobeyami, naxan findi e xunna ra. A bata yi muxu kɛmɛ saxan faxa tanban na yɛngɛ kedenni. <verse eid="1CH 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 11:12"/>A firinden findi Axoxi xabilan muxuna nde Dodo a diina Eleyasari nan na. A yi sofa wɛkilɛxi saxanne yɛ. <verse eid="1CH 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 11:13"/>A tan nan Dawuda mali Filisitine yɛngɛdeni Pasi-Damimi yi. Sofane bata yi e gi Filisitine bun nun. Funde xɛɛna nde yi na, <verse eid="1CH 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 11:14"/>Eleyasari nun a sofane Filisitine yɛngɛ mɛnni. Alatala yi nɔ gbeen fi Isirayila yamaan ma.<verse eid="1CH 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 11:15"/>Sofa wɛkilɛxi tonge saxanne muxu saxan yi siga Dawuda fɛma Adulan faran yireni. Anu, Filisitine yi tixi Refa lanbanni. <verse eid="1CH 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 11:16"/>Na waxatini, Dawuda yi dɔxi yire makantanxini, Filisiti ganla nde fan yi dɔxi Bɛtɛlɛmi yi. <verse eid="1CH 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 11:17"/>Dawuda yi a waxɔn fena nde fala, a naxa, “Ige ramara yinla naxan Bɛtɛlɛmi so dɛɛn na, nde nɔɛ fɛ na igen na, a fa a so n yii, n yi n min?” <verse eid="1CH 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 11:18"/>Na sofa wɛkilɛxi saxanne yi dangu Filisitine naninna ra. E sa igen ba ige ramara yinla ra Bɛtɛlɛmi so dɛɛn na. E to fa na ra Dawuda xɔn, a yi tondi a minɲɛ. A yi a bɔxɔn saraxan na Alatala xa. <verse eid="1CH 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 11:19"/>A yi a fala, a naxa, “Ala xa n natanga igeni ito minna ma. A luxi nɛn alo muxune wunla, naxanye sigaxi igeni ito badeni, e lu sayaan dɛ.” Na ma, a yi tondi ige minɲɛ. A sofa wɛkilɛxi saxanne na nan liga.<verse eid="1CH 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 11:20"/>Yowaba tada Abisayi nan yi na sɛnbɛma saxanne xunna ra. Na nan xɛmɛ kɛmɛ saxan faxa a tanban na yɛngɛni. Xili kanna nan yi a ra alo na sofa sɛnbɛma saxanne. <verse eid="1CH 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 11:21"/>A binyen sɔtɔ nɛn dangu ne ra, koni a mi e yɛ hali a to yi findixi e mangan na.<verse eid="1CH 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 11:22"/>Bɛnaya, Kabaseeli kaana, Yehoyadaa dii xɛmɛna, sofa wɛkilɛxi gbeen nan yi na ra, naxan kabanako fe wali wuyaxi kɛ. A tan nan Moyaba sofa wɛkilɛxi firinne faxa. Lɔxɔna nde, xunbeli gbeen yi godon waxatin naxan yi, a tan nan mɔn godo ige ramara yinla ra, a yi yatan faxa. <verse eid="1CH 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 11:23"/>Lɔxɔna nde, a yi Misiran kaa sɛnbɛmana nde faxa naxan kuyan yi sigɛ han kanke yɛ firin e nun nde. Tanban yi na Misiran kaan yii naxan yi gbo alo gbindonna. Bɛnaya yi godo a fɔxɔ ra gbengbetenna ra a yii, a yi a tanban ba a yii, a yi a faxa a ra. <verse eid="1CH 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 11:24"/>Yehoyadaa diin Bɛnaya na fe gbeene nan liga. A fan xili gbeen sɔtɔ na kii nin alo na sofa wɛkilɛxi saxanne. <verse eid="1CH 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 11:25"/>A yi binyen sɔtɔ dangu sofa wɛkilɛxi tonge saxanne ra, koni a mi yi na sofa sɛnbɛma saxanne yɛ. Dawuda yi a findi a kantan sofane xunna ra.<verse eid="1CH 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 11:26"/>Sofa wɛkilɛxi gbɛtɛye ni i ra: Yowaba xunyɛna Asahɛli nun Dodo a diina Elexanan, Bɛtɛlɛmi kaan nun <verse eid="1CH 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 11:27"/>Harori kaan Samoti nun Pelon kaan Xɛlɛsi nun <verse eid="1CH 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 11:28"/>Ikɛsi a diina Ira, Tekowa kaan nun Anatɔti kaana Abiyeseri nun <verse eid="1CH 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 11:29"/>Xusa kaan Sibekayi nun Axoxi xabilan muxuna nde Ilayi nun <verse eid="1CH 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 11:30"/>Netofa kaan Maharayi nun Banahaa diin Xeleda Netofa kaan nun <verse eid="1CH 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 11:31"/>Ribayi a diina Itayi, naxan keli Gibeya Bunyamin bɔnsɔn bɔxɔni nun Piraton kaan Bɛnaya nun <verse eid="1CH 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 11:32"/>Xurayi naxan keli Gaasa folo yireni e nun Aruba kaana Abiyɛli nun <verse eid="1CH 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 11:33"/>Baxurin kaana Asamawɛti nun Saalabon kaana Eliyaba nun <verse eid="1CH 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 11:34"/>Gison kaan Hasemi a diine nun Harara kaan Sage a diin Yonatan nun <verse eid="1CH 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 11:35"/>Harara kaan Sakaraa diina Axiyama nun Yuru a diina Elifala nun <verse eid="1CH 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 11:36"/>Mekera kaan Xeferi nun Pelon kaana Axiya nun <verse eid="1CH 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 11:37"/>Karemele kaan Xesero nun Esibayi a diin Narayi nun <verse eid="1CH 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 11:38"/>Natan ngaxakedenna Yowɛli nun Hagari a diin Mibixari nun <verse eid="1CH 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 11:39"/>Amonin Sɛlɛki nun Beroti kaan Naxarayi, Seruyaa diin Yowabaa yɛngɛ so se maxanla nun <verse eid="1CH 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 11:40"/>Ira nun Garɛbi, Yitiri xabilan muxune nun <verse eid="1CH 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 11:41"/>Xiti kaan Yuriya nun Axalayi a diin Sabadi nun <verse eid="1CH 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 11:42"/>Siisaa diina Adina, Rubɛn bɔnsɔnna mangana, sofa tonge saxan yi naxan fɔxɔ ra e nun <verse eid="1CH 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 11:43"/>Makaa diin Xanan nun Mitini kaan Yosafati nun <verse eid="1CH 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 11:44"/>Asatarɔti kaan Wusiya nun Xotami a diine Saama nun Yeyiyɛli, Aroyeri kaane nun <verse eid="1CH 11:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 11:45"/>Simiri a diine Yediyayeli nun a xunyɛn Yoxa Tisi kaana e nun <verse eid="1CH 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 11:46"/>Maxawi kaana Eliyeli nun Elinama a diine Yeribayi nun Yosawiya e nun Moyaba kaan Yitima nun <verse eid="1CH 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 11:47"/>Eliyeli nun Obedi nun Mesoba kaan Yaasiyɛli.<verse eid="1CH 11:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CH 12"/>
  <para style="s">Sofaan naxanye Dawuda fɔxɔ ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 12:1"/>Dawuda yi luxunxi Kisu a diin Sɔli ma Sikilaga yi waxatin naxan yi, sofa kɛndɛne yi fa a fɔxɔ ra a malideni yɛngɛsodeni. <verse eid="1CH 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 12:2"/>Bunyamin bɔnsɔnna muxune nan yi ne ra, Sɔli ngaxakedenne. Ndee yi fatan xalimakunle wolɛ, ndee yi fatan lantanne wolɛ, e yiifanne nun e kɔmɛnne ra. <verse eid="1CH 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 12:3"/>E kuntigin Axiyeseri nun a xunyɛn Yowasa Gibeya kaan Semaa diine nan yi ne ra. Yesiyeli nun Peleti, Asamawɛti a diine, e nun Beraka nun Anatɔti kaan Yehu yi sofani itoe yɛ e nun <verse eid="1CH 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 12:4"/>Gabayon kaan Yisemaya naxan findi sofa gbeen na sofa wɛkilɛxi tonge saxanne yɛ, a fan yi findi kuntigin na e tagi. <verse eid="1CH 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 12:5"/>Yeremi nun Yaxasiyeli nun Yoxanan nun Gedera kaan Yosabadi nun <verse eid="1CH 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 12:6"/>Elusayi nun Yerimoti nun Beyalaya nun Sɛmaraya nun Xarufu kaan Sɛfati fan yi ne yɛ. <verse eid="1CH 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 12:7"/>Kora xabilan muxune, Elikana nun Yisiya nun Asarɛli nun Yoweseri nun Yasobeyami fan yi e yɛ, <verse eid="1CH 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 12:8"/>e nun Yeroxamaa diine Yowela nun Sebadiya keli Gedori yi.<verse eid="1CH 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 12:9"/>Gadi bɔnsɔnna sofana ndee fan yi siga Dawuda fɛma tonbonni a yire makantanxini. Sofa wɛkilɛxin nan yi ne ra, e fatan yɛngɛn soɛ, yɛ masansan wure lefane nun tanbane yi e yii. E sɛnbɛn yi gbo alo yatane, e yi xulun alo xɛnla naxanye e gima geyane fari. <verse eid="1CH 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 12:10"/>E xinle ni itoe ra: e kuntigina Eseri, a firindena Abadi, a saxandena Eliyabi, <verse eid="1CH 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 12:11"/>a naanindena Misemanna, a suulundena Yeremi, <verse eid="1CH 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 12:12"/>a sennindena Atayi, a soloferedena Eliyeli, <verse eid="1CH 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 12:13"/>a solomasɛxɛdena Yoxanan, a solomanaanindena Elesabada, <verse eid="1CH 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 12:14"/>a fudena Yeremi, e nun a fu nun kedendena Makabanayi. <verse eid="1CH 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 12:15"/>Gadi kaani itoe yi findixi sofa xunne nan na. Naxan yi xurun e yɛ, na sɛnbɛn yi gbo muxu kɛmɛ xa. Naxan yi gbo e yɛ, na sɛnbɛn yi gbo muxu wuli keden xa. <verse eid="1CH 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 12:16"/>Ne yi Yurudɛn xuden gidi a yi fexi waxatin naxan yi, kike singeni, e fa lanbanna muxune kedi sogeteden nun sogegododen mabinni.<verse eid="1CH 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 12:17"/>Bunyamin kaana ndee nun Yuda kaana ndee yi siga Dawuda fɛma a yire makantanxini. <verse eid="1CH 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 12:18"/>Dawuda yi e ralan, a yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Xa ɛ faxi bɔɲɛ xunbenla nin alogo ɛ xa fa n mali, en luma nɛn xaxili kedenni. Koni, xa ɛ faxi n yanfaden nin n yaxune xa, n tan naxan mi fe ɲaxi yo ligaxi, en benbane Ala xa na to, a yi a kitin sa.” <verse eid="1CH 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 12:19"/>Na waxatini, Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin yi godo Amasayi ma, naxan yi findixi sofa tonge saxanne xunna ra. A yi a fala, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:19">“Nxu i sagoni, Dawuda!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:19">Nxu i sagoni, Yese a diina!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:19">Ala xa bɔɲɛ xunbenla fi Dawuda ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:19">Ala xa bɔɲɛ xunbenla fi i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:19">e nun naxanye i malima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:19">Bayo, i ya Ala nan i malima.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 12:19">Nayi, Dawuda yi e rasɛnɛ, a yi tidene so e yii a sofa kuntigine yɛ.<verse eid="1CH 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 12:20"/>Manase bɔnsɔnna sofana ndee yi fa Dawuda fɛma, e nun Filisitine yi sigama Sɔli yɛngɛdeni waxatin naxan yi. Koni, Dawuda nun a muxune mi fa Filisitine mali yɛngɛsodeni na waxatini bayo Filisiti kuntigine e raxɛtɛ nɛn, e yi a fala, e naxa, “Xa Dawuda mɔn kafu a kari fonna Sɔli ma, en birin faxama nɛn.” <verse eid="1CH 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 12:21"/>E to na fala, Dawuda yi xɛtɛ Sikilaga yi. Manase muxun naxanye bata yi bira a fɔxɔ ra, ne xinle ni itoe ra: Adena nun Yosabadi nun Yediyayeli nun Mikeli nun Yosabadi nun Elihu nun Siletayi. Kuntigin nan yi ne birin na sofa wuli keden xun na Manase bɔnsɔnna muxune yɛ. <verse eid="1CH 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 12:22"/>Sofa kɛndɛne nan yi ne birin na, naxanye yi Dawuda malima yɛngɛ sodeni. E yi findixi sofa kuntigine nan na a ganli. <verse eid="1CH 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 12:23"/>Muxune yi fama nɛn Dawuda malideni lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ. A sofa ganla gbo ayi na kii nin alo maleka ganla.<verse eid="1CH 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sofaan naxanye fa Dawuda fɔxɔ ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 12:24"/>Sofaan yatɛni ito nan fa Dawuda fɛma Xebiron yi alogo e xa fa Dawuda mali, a yi findi mangan na Sɔli ɲɔxɔni alo Alatala bata yi a fala kii naxan yi:<verse eid="1CH 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 12:25"/>Yuda bɔnsɔnni, sofa wuli sennin kɛmɛ solomasɛxɛ. Yɛ masansan wure lefaan nun tanban yi e birin yii.<verse eid="1CH 12:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 12:26"/>Simeyɔn bɔnsɔnni, sofa wuli solofere kɛmɛ. E birin sofa kɛndɛ.<verse eid="1CH 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 12:27"/>Lewi bɔnsɔnni, sofa wuli naanin kɛmɛ sennin, <verse eid="1CH 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 12:28"/>e nun Yehoyada naxan findi yɛɛratiin na Haruna ɲɔxɔni, na nun a sofa wuli saxan kɛmɛ soloferene. <verse eid="1CH 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 12:29"/>Sadɔki, banxulan sofa kɛndɛn nun a xabila kuntigine, muxu mɔxɔɲɛn nun firin.<verse eid="1CH 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 12:30"/>Bunyamin bɔnsɔnni, Sɔli ngaxakedenne, sofa wuli saxan, naxanye bata yi lu Sɔli fɔxɔ ra han na waxatina.<verse eid="1CH 12:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 12:31"/>Efirami bɔnsɔnni, sofa wuli mɔxɔɲɛ kɛmɛ solomasɛxɛ. Sofa kɛndɛ xili kanne nan yi e birin na.<verse eid="1CH 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 12:32"/>Manase bɔnsɔnni, sofa wuli fu nun solomasɛxɛ naxanye yi sugandixi alogo e xa Dawuda dɔxɔ mangan na.<verse eid="1CH 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 12:33"/>Isakari bɔnsɔnni, kuntigi kɛmɛ firin e nun e ngaxakedenne birin e yamarin bun ma. E bata yi a kolon Isirayila yi lan a xa naxan liga na waxatini.<verse eid="1CH 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 12:34"/>Sabulon bɔnsɔnni, sofa wuli tonge suulun naxanye yi fatan yɛngɛ sodeni yɛngɛ so seene birin na. E yi Dawuda malima e bɔɲɛn birin na.<verse eid="1CH 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 12:35"/>Nafatali bɔnsɔnni, sofa kuntigin wuli keden, e nun sofa wuli tonge saxan e nun solofere. Yɛ masansan wure lefaan nun tanban yi ne birin yii.<verse eid="1CH 12:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 12:36"/>Dan bɔnsɔnni, sofa wuli mɔxɔɲɛn nun solomasɛxɛ kɛmɛ sennin. E yɛngɛ so seene yi e yii.<verse eid="1CH 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 12:37"/>Aseri bɔnsɔnni, sofa wuli tonge naanin. Sofa kɛndɛn nan yi e ra, yɛngɛ so seene yi e yii.<verse eid="1CH 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 12:38"/>Sofaan naxanye keli Yurudɛn kidima sogeteden binni, Rubɛn nun Gadi nun Manase bɔnsɔnne yi, ne lan muxu wuli kɛmɛ wuli mɔxɔɲɛ nan ma. Yɛngɛ so seen sifan birin yi e yii.<verse eid="1CH 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 12:39"/>Sofani itoe naxanye birin tin sigɛ yɛngɛni, ne bata yi fa Xebiron yi alogo e xa fa Dawuda dɔxɔ mangan na Isirayila xun na. Sikɛ yo mi yi e yi. Isirayila kaane birin bata yi na ragidi. <verse eid="1CH 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 12:40"/>E yi lu mɛnni Dawuda fɛma xi saxan, e yi e dɛge, e yi e min. E ngaxakedenne bata yi donseen nafala e xa. <verse eid="1CH 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 12:41"/>E dɔxɔ bodene fan yi fa donseen na keli Isakari nun Sabulon nun Nafatali bɔxɔne yi sofanle nun ɲɔgɔmɛne nun gbaxalone<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.41</char> <char style="fk">Gbaxaloni</char> itoe sɔtɔma soon nun sofanla na diin sɔtɔ waxatin naxan yi.</note> nun ɲingene fari. E yi fa goronna sifan birin na, donseen nun murutu faɲin nun xɔdɛ xaraxine nun manpa bogin xaraxine nun manpaan nun turen nun xuruse xunxurin nun a xungbene. E yi fa a gbegbe ra bayo Isirayila kaane birin yi sɛwaxi.<verse eid="1CH 12:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CH 13"/>
  <para style="s">Layiri Kankiraan yi xali</para>
  <para style="r">Samuyɛli Firinden 6.1-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 13:1"/>Dawuda yi falan ti sofa kuntigine xa naxanye yi sofa wuli nun sofa kɛmɛ xun na e nun a kuntigine birin. <verse eid="1CH 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 13:2"/>Na xanbi ra, Dawuda yi a fala Isirayila yamaan birin xa, a naxa, “Xa na lan ɛ ma, xa na fataxi Alatala nan na, en ma Ala, en xɛrane rasiga en ngaxakedenne ma Isirayila bɔxɔn birin yi. En yi saraxaraline nun Lewine fan xili, naxanye Isirayila taane nun a rabilinne yi alogo en birin xa lu yire kedenni. <verse eid="1CH 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 13:3"/>En mɔn xa fa en ma Alaa Kankiraan na en dɛxɔn, bayo Sɔli a mangayaan waxatini, en mi siga a fɔxɔ ra.” <verse eid="1CH 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 13:4"/>Na yi yamaan birin kɛnɛn bayo e birin yi laxi a ra fe faɲin nan na ra.<verse eid="1CH 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 13:5"/>Dawuda yi Isirayila kaane birin malan, keli Sixori xuden ma Misiran yamanani sa dɔxɔ Lebo-Xamata ra alogo e xa sa Alaa Kankiraan tongo Kiriyati-Yeyarin yi. <verse eid="1CH 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 13:6"/>Dawuda nun Isirayila yamaan birin yi siga Baala taani Yuda yi, dɛnaxan mɔn xili Kiriyati-Yeyarin alogo e xa sa Alaa Kankiraan tongo. Alatala gbeen nan yi na ra, Alatala naxan dɔxi maleka gubugubu kan sawurane tagi. A xinla nan na kankiraan ma. <verse eid="1CH 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 13:7"/>E yi Alaa Kankiraan tongo Abinadabo konni, e yi a dɔxɔ goron maxali wontoro nɛnɛn kui. Wusa nun Axiyo nan yi na wontoron nagima. <verse eid="1CH 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 13:8"/>Dawuda nun Isirayila kaane yi sɛwa ki faɲi Ala yɛtagi, e yi bɛtin ba bɔlɔnne nun kondenne nun tanbanne nun kariɲanne nun xɔtane ra.<verse eid="1CH 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 13:9"/>E to lonna li Kidon yi, Wusa yi kankiraan suxu a yiin na alogo a nama bira, bayo ɲingen naxanye yi wontoron bandunma, ne salaxun nɛn. <verse eid="1CH 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 13:10"/>Alatala yi xɔlɔ Wusa ma, a yi a faxa keden na, bayo a mi yi lan a xa a yiin din na kankiraan na. Wusa faxa na kii nin Ala yɛtagi.<verse eid="1CH 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 13:11"/>Dawuda yi xɔlɔ bayo Alatala bata Wusa faxa. Nanara, a yi mɛn xili sa “Wusa halagidena” han to. <verse eid="1CH 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 13:12"/>Na lɔxɔni, Dawuda yi gaxu Ala yɛɛ ra, a yi a yɛtɛ maxɔdin, a naxa, “N na Alaa Kankiraan nasoma n konni di?” <verse eid="1CH 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 13:13"/>Nayi, Dawuda mi fa kankiraan xali a konni Dawudaa Taani. A yi sa a raso Gati kaana Obedi-Edɔn ma banxini. <verse eid="1CH 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 13:14"/>Alaa Kankiraan yi lu Obedi-Edɔn konni kike saxan. Na ma, Alatala yi barakan sa a seene birin yi.<verse eid="1CH 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CH 14"/>
  <para style="s">Dawudaa denbayana</para>
  <para style="r">Samuyɛli Firinden 5.11-16 nun Taruxune Singen 3.5-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 14:1"/>Tire taan mangan Xurami yi xɛrane rasiga Dawuda ma, e nun suman wudin nun kamudɛrɛne nun gɛmɛ masonle manga banxin tideni Dawuda xa. <verse eid="1CH 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 14:2"/>Dawuda yi a kolon a Alatala yatin nan a findixi mangan na Isirayila xun na. A a kolon, Ala luma a mangayaan yitɛ a yamana Isirayila nan ma fe ra. <verse eid="1CH 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 14:3"/>Dawuda yi ɲaxalan gbɛtɛye dɔxɔ Yerusalɛn yi. A mɔn yi dii xɛmɛne nun dii tɛmɛne sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 14:4"/>Naxanye sɔtɔ a xa Yerusalɛn yi, ne xinle ni itoe ra: Samuwa nun Sobaba nun Natan nun Sulemani <verse eid="1CH 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 14:5"/>nun Yibixari nun Elisuwa nun Elipeleti nun <verse eid="1CH 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 14:6"/>Noga nun Nefegi nun Yafiya nun <verse eid="1CH 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 14:7"/>Elisama nun Beeliyada e nun Elifeleti.<verse eid="1CH 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dawuda yi Filisitine nɔ</para>
  <para style="r">Samuyɛli Firinden 5.17-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 14:8"/>Filisitine yi a mɛ a Dawuda bata yi findi mangan na Isirayila birin xun na, e birin yi siga a fendeni. Dawuda yi na mɛ, a yi mini e yɛɛ ra. <verse eid="1CH 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 14:9"/>Filisitine yi fa yɛngɛni Refa lanbanni. <verse eid="1CH 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 14:10"/>Dawuda yi Ala maxɔdin, a naxa, “N xa siga Filisitine xili ma ba? I e soɛ n yii ba?” Alatala yi a yabi, a naxa, “Siga, n ne soma nɛn i yii.”<verse eid="1CH 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 14:11"/>Nayi, Dawuda nun a sofane yi siga Baali-Perasimi yi, e sa Filisitine nɔ yɛngɛni. Dawuda yi a fala, a naxa, “Ala bata n yaxune raxuya ayi n yɛɛ ra, alo fufaan gbiligbinla kalan kii naxan yi.” Nanara, e mɛnna xili sa Baali-Perasimi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fk">14.11</char> <char style="fk">Baali-Perasimi</char> bunna nɛn fa fala, “Halagin Kanna.” </note> <verse eid="1CH 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 14:12"/>Filisitine yi e suxurene rabeɲin mɛnni, Dawuda yi yamarin fi a e xa gan.<verse eid="1CH 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 14:13"/>Filisitine mɔn yi fa yɛngɛ sodeni Refa lanbanni. <verse eid="1CH 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 14:14"/>Dawuda mɔn yi Ala maxɔdin. Ala yi a yabi, a naxa, “I nama siga e yɛtagi, koni e mabilin, i siga han xɛɲɛxɛɲɛnne sa dɛnaxan yi. I sa dɔxɔ e yɛɛ ra mɛnni. <verse eid="1CH 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 14:15"/>I na sigati xuiin mɛ wudine kondenne yi, i keli e yɛngɛdeni, bayo Ala nan tima i yɛɛ ra, a Filisiti ganla nɔ i xa.” <verse eid="1CH 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 14:16"/>Dawuda yi a liga alo Ala a yamari kii naxan yi. E yi Filisitine yɛngɛ keli Gabayon yi sa dɔxɔ Geseri ra. <verse eid="1CH 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 14:17"/>Nayi, Dawuda yi xinla sɔtɔ yamanane birin yi. Alatala yi a liga siyane birin yi gaxu Dawuda yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="1CH 14:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CH 15"/>
  <para style="s">Alaa Layiri Kankiraan siga fena Yerusalɛn yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 15:1"/>Dawuda yi banxine ti a yɛtɛ xa Dawudaa Taani. A yi yirena nde yitɔn Alaa Kankiraan xa, a yi bubun ti a xa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fk">15.1</char> <char style="fk">Alaa Layiri Kankirana</char> fe mɔn sɛbɛxi Xɔrɔyaan 25.10-22 kui.</note> <verse eid="1CH 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 15:2"/>Dawuda yi yamarin fi a muxu yo nama Alaa Kankiraan maxali fɔ Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune, bayo Alatala e tan nan sugandixi na ma. E tan nan yi lan e wali a yɛtagi habadan. <verse eid="1CH 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 15:3"/>Dawuda yi Isirayila birin malan Yerusalɛn yi Alatalaa Kankiraan naso feen na a yireni a dɛnaxan yitɔnxi a xa.<verse eid="1CH 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 15:4"/>Dawuda yi Haruna yixɛtɛne nun Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune malan:<verse eid="1CH 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 15:5"/>Kehati yixɛtɛne yɛ, muxu kɛmɛ muxu mɔxɔɲɛ. Yuriyeli nan yi e xunna ra.<verse eid="1CH 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 15:6"/>Merari yixɛtɛne yɛ, muxu kɛmɛ firin muxu mɔxɔɲɛ. Asaya nan yi e xunna ra.<verse eid="1CH 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 15:7"/>Gɛrisɔn yixɛtɛne yɛ, muxu kɛmɛ muxu tonge saxan. Yowɛli nan yi e xunna ra.<verse eid="1CH 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 15:8"/>Elisafan yixɛtɛne yɛ, muxu kɛmɛ firin. Semaya nan yi e xunna ra.<verse eid="1CH 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 15:9"/>Xebiron yixɛtɛne yɛ, muxu tonge solomasɛxɛ. Eliyeli nan yi e xunna ra.<verse eid="1CH 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 15:10"/>Yusiyɛli yixɛtɛne yɛ, muxu kɛmɛ muxu fu nun firin. Aminadabo nan yi e xunna ra.<verse eid="1CH 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 15:11"/>Dawuda yi saraxaraline Sadɔki nun Abiyatari xili, e nun Lewine Yuriyeli nun Asaya nun Yowɛli nun Semaya nun Eliyeli nun Aminadabo. <verse eid="1CH 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 15:12"/>A yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ tan nan Lewi bɔnsɔn muxune denbaya xunne ra. Ɛ yɛtɛ rasariɲan, ɛ tan nun ɛ muxune. Ɛ siga Alatalaa Kankiraan na, Isirayilaa Ala. N dɛnaxan yitɔnxi a xa, ɛ a xali mɛnni. <verse eid="1CH 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 15:13"/>Bayo ɛ mi yi na a singeni, na ma, Alatala, en ma Ala halagin nagodo nɛn en ma, amasɔtɔ en mi bira a sariyan fɔxɔ ra.” <verse eid="1CH 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 15:14"/>Nayi, Saraxaraline nun Lewine yi e yɛtɛ rasariɲan benun e xa siga Alatalaa Kankiraan na, Isirayilaa Ala. <verse eid="1CH 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 15:15"/>Lewine yi Alaa Kankiraan suxu a tongo tamine ma, e a dɔxɔ e tungunne fari alo Musa a yamari kii naxan yi fata Alatalaa falan na.<verse eid="1CH 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 15:16"/>Dawuda yi a fala Lewi kuntigine xa, a e xa bɛti baana ndee sugandi e muxune yɛ naxanye bɛtin bama maxaseene ra sɛwani, e kondenne nun bɔlɔnne nun kariɲanne maxa. <verse eid="1CH 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 15:17"/>Lewine yi Yowɛli a diin Heman sugandi, e nun a ngaxakedenne Bereki a diina Asafi nun Kusayaa diina Etani, naxan yi Merari yixɛtɛne yɛ. <verse eid="1CH 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 15:18"/>Lewi gbɛtɛye nan yi dɛ kantanne ra e tan ma yamarin bun: Sakari nun Ben nun Yasiyeli nun Semiramoti nun Yɛxiyɛli nun Yunni nun Eliyabi nun Bɛnaya nun Maaseya nun Matitiya nun Elifelehu nun Mikineyahu nun Obedi-Edɔn e nun Yeyiyɛli. <verse eid="1CH 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 15:19"/>Heman nun Asafi nun Etani nan yi bɛtin bama, e kariɲan sula daxine maxa. <verse eid="1CH 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 15:20"/>Sakari nun Asiyɛli nun Semiramoti nun Yɛxiyɛli nun Yunni nun Eliyabi nun Maaseya nun Bɛnaya nan yi kondenne maxama e xuini texin na. <verse eid="1CH 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 15:21"/>Matitiya nun Elifelehu nun Mikineyahu nun Obedi-Edɔn nun Yeyiyɛli nun Asasiya yi kondenna luti solomasɛxɛ daxine nan maxama. <verse eid="1CH 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 15:22"/>Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxun Kenaniya yi findixi bɛti baane yɛɛratiin nan na Alaa Kankiraan maxalideni. A yi na wanla kolon ki faɲi. <verse eid="1CH 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 15:23"/>Bereki nun Elikana nan yi kantan tiine ra Alaa Kankiraan dɛxɔn, <verse eid="1CH 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 15:24"/>e nun Obedi-Edɔn nun Yexiya. Saraxaraline Sɛbaniha nun Yosafati nun Natanɛli nun Amasayi nun Sakari nun Bɛnaya nun Eliyeseri nan yi xɔtane fema Alaa Kankiraan yɛtagi.<verse eid="1CH 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Layiri Kankiraan so fena taani</para>
  <para style="r">Samuyɛli Firinden 6.12-23</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 15:25"/>Nayi, Dawuda nun Isirayilaa fonne nun sofa kuntigin naxanye yi dɔxi sofa wuli xun na, ne birin yi ti kiraan xɔn alogo e xa sa Alatalaa Layiri Kankiraan mati sɛwani keli Obedi-Edɔn konni. <verse eid="1CH 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 15:26"/>Ala yi Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune mali Alatalaa Layiri Kankiraan xalideni. E tura solofere nun yɛxɛɛ kontonna solofere ba saraxan na. <verse eid="1CH 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 15:27"/>Dawuda yi maxidixi taa dugi doma faɲine nin, e nun Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxun naxanye yi Layiri Kankiraan maxalima e nun bɛti baane nun bɛti ba kuntigin Kenaniya. Dawuda mɔn yi saraxarali domana nde fan nagodo a ma. <verse eid="1CH 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 15:28"/>Isirayila kaane birin yi siga Alatalaa Layiri Kankiraan na sɛwani. Ndee yi fenne nun xɔtane fema, ndee yi kariɲanne maxama, ndee yi kondenne nun bɔlɔnne maxama.<verse eid="1CH 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 15:29"/>Sɔli a dii tɛmɛn Mikali yi tixi banxin foye soden na, a Isirayila kaane to fɛ Alatalaa Layiri Kankiraan na Dawudaa Taani. A to Manga Dawuda to a bodonɲɛ sɛwani, a yi a raɲaxu a bɔɲɛni.<verse eid="1CH 15:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CH 16"/>
  <para style="s">Dawuda Ala tantun fena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 16:1"/>Na xanbi ra, e yi fa Alaa Kankiraan na, e fa a dɔxɔ bubun kui, Dawuda naxan nafalaxi a dɔxɔden na. E yi saraxa gan daxine nun bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxane ba Ala xa. <verse eid="1CH 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 16:2"/>Dawuda to yelin na saraxane bɛ, a yi duba Isirayila yamaan xa Alatala xinli. <verse eid="1CH 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 16:3"/>Na xanbi ra, a yi burun nun tamaro bogi xare rafalaxin nun ɲaxun danna rafalaxin xundi keden keden so Isirayila kaane birin yii, xɛmɛn nun ɲaxanla.<verse eid="1CH 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 16:4"/>A yi Lewina ndee sugandi alogo e xa wali Alatalaa Kankiraan yɛtagi, e Alatala maxandi, e barikan bira Isirayilaa Ala xa, e a tantun. Ne xinle ni itoe ra: <verse eid="1CH 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 16:5"/>Asafi, naxan findi e kuntigin na e nun Sakari, naxan findi kuntigi firinden na e nun Yeyiyɛli nun Semiramoti nun Yɛxiyɛli nun Matitiya nun Eliyabi nun Bɛnaya nun Obedi-Edɔn nun Yeyiyɛli. Kondenne nun bɔlɔnne yi e yii. Kariɲanne yi Asafi yii. <verse eid="1CH 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 16:6"/>Saraxaraline, Bɛnaya nun Yaxasiyeli yi xɔtane fema Alaa Layiri Kankiraan yɛtagi.<verse eid="1CH 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 16:7"/>Dawuda bɛtini ito so Asafi nun a muxune yii na lɔxɔn nin a singeni alogo e xa Alatala tantun.<verse eid="1CH 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="r">Yaburin 105.1-15</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 16:8"/>Ɛ Alatala tantun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:8">Ɛ yi a maxandi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:8">A bata naxan liga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:8">ɛ na fala siyane xa.<verse eid="1CH 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 16:9"/>Ɛ bɛtin ba a xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:9">ɛ yi a tantun bɛtine yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:9">ɛ yi a kabanako feene birin fala.<verse eid="1CH 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 16:10"/>Ɛ ɛ kanba a xili sariɲanxini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:10">Naxanye birin Alatala fenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:10">ne xa sɛwa.<verse eid="1CH 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 16:11"/>Ɛ ɛ yɛɛ rafindi Alatala nun a sɛnbɛn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:11">ɛ lu a fenɲɛ waxatin birin.<verse eid="1CH 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 16:12"/>A wali faɲin naxanye ligaxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:12">e nun a kabanako feene</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:12">nun a kitin naxanye saxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:12">ne fe xa rabira ɛ ma,<verse eid="1CH 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 16:13"/>ɛ tan Isirayila bɔnsɔnna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:13">a walikɛne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:13">ɛ tan Yaxubaa diine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:13">Ala naxanye sugandixi.<verse eid="1CH 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 16:14"/>A tan nan Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:14">en ma Ala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:14">A tan nan bɔxɔn birin kitisaan na.<verse eid="1CH 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 16:15"/>A ɲɔxɔ luma a layirin xɔn ma nɛn han habadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:15">e nun a falane fe han mayixɛtɛ wuli keden,<verse eid="1CH 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 16:16"/>e nun a layirin naxan xidi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:16">e nun Iburahima tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:16">a yi a kɔlɔ Isiyaga xa.<verse eid="1CH 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 16:17"/>A mɔn yi a ragidi Yaxuba ma sariyan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:17">a findi habadan layirin na Isirayila kaane xa.<verse eid="1CH 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 16:18"/>A yi a fala, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:18">“N Kanan yamanan soma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:18">ɛ nun i yixɛtɛne yii ɛ kɛɛn na.”<verse eid="1CH 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 16:19"/>E mi yi wuya nun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:19">Xɔɲɛ dando nan tun yi e ra na yamanani.<verse eid="1CH 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 16:20"/>E yi kelima nɛn siyana nde yɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:20">e siga nde gbɛtɛ yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:20">e keli yamanana nde yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:20">e siga nde gbɛtɛ yi.<verse eid="1CH 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 16:21"/>Koni, a mi tinɲɛ muxu yo xa e ɲaxankata.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:21">A mangane rakolon nɛn e fe yi, a naxa,<verse eid="1CH 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 16:22"/>“Ɛ nama fefe liga n ma muxu sugandixine ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:22">Ɛ nama fefe ɲaxi liga n ma nabine ra.”<verse eid="1CH 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="r">Yaburin 96</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 16:23"/>Dunuɲa muxune birin xa bɛtin ba Alatala xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:23">Ɛ yi lu a raliyɛ waxatin birin yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:23">fa fala a bata en nakisi.<verse eid="1CH 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 16:24"/>Ɛ a binyena fe fala siyane birin xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:24">ɛ yi a kabanako feene rali muxune birin ma.<verse eid="1CH 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 16:25"/>Alatala gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:25">a lan a xa matɔxɔ han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:25">A lan a xa binya dangu alane birin na.<verse eid="1CH 16:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 16:26"/>Siyane alane birin findixi ala fuune nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:26">koni Alatala tan bata koren da.<verse eid="1CH 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 16:27"/>A rabilinxi nɔrɔn nun gboon nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:27">A konna rafexi sɛnbɛn nun sɛwan nan na.<verse eid="1CH 16:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 16:28"/>Ɛ tan dunuɲa siyane birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:28">ɛ fa Alatala tantun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:28">ɛ yi a tantun a binyen nun a sɛnbɛna fe ra.<verse eid="1CH 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 16:29"/>Ɛ fa Alatala tantun a xili binyena fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:29">Ɛ fa kiseene ra a yɛtagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:29">Ɛ Alatala batu a nɔrɔ sariɲanxini.<verse eid="1CH 16:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 16:30"/>Dunuɲa muxune,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:30">ɛ xuruxurun a yɛtagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:30">Dunuɲa a kiini, a mi yigisanma.<verse eid="1CH 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 16:31"/>Kore xɔnna nun bɔxɔ xɔnna xa sɛwa han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:31">Ɛ yi a fala siyane xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:31">a Alatala nan mangan na.<verse eid="1CH 16:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 16:32"/>Fɔxɔ igen xa a xuini te</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:32">e nun seen naxanye a xɔrɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:32">Burunna xa sɛwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:32">e nun a yi seene birin.<verse eid="1CH 16:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 16:33"/>Fɔtɔnna wudine xa sɔnxɔ sɛwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:33">e sɔnxɔ Alatala yɛtagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:33">amasɔtɔ a fama nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:33">A fama nɛn a kitin sa dunuɲa yi.<verse eid="1CH 16:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="r">Yaburin 106.1, 47-48</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 16:34"/>Ɛ Alatala tantun amasɔtɔ a fan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:34">A hinanna luma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="1CH 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 16:35"/>Ɛ a fala Ala xa, ɛ naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:35">“Ala, nxu rakisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:35">nxu ratanga siya gbɛtɛne ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:35">alogo nxu xa i xili sariɲanxin tantun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:35">na yi findi nxu kanba xunna ra.”<verse eid="1CH 16:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 16:36"/>Barikan xa bira Alatala xa, Isirayilaa Ala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:36">habadan han habadan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:36">Nayi, yamaan yi a fala, e naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:36">“Amina! Tantunna Alatala xa.”<verse eid="1CH 16:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 16:37"/>Dawuda yi Asafi nun a ngaxakedenne yamari a e xa wali Alatalaa Layiri Kankiraan yɛtagi waxatin birin. <verse eid="1CH 16:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 16:38"/>A yi Yedutun ma diina Obedi-Edɔn nun Xosa nun a muxu tonge sennin muxu solomasɛxɛ yamari a e xa so dɛɛn kantan. <verse eid="1CH 16:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 16:39"/>Saraxaraliin Sadɔki nun a ngaxakedenne yi lu Alatalaa Batu Bubuni naxan yi tixi taan kideni Gabayon yi. <verse eid="1CH 16:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 16:40"/>E yi lu saraxa gan daxine bɛ Alatala xa xɔtɔnna nun ɲinbanna alo a sɛbɛxi Alatalaa sariyani kii naxan yi, a naxan soxi Isirayila kaane yii. <verse eid="1CH 16:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 16:41"/>Heman nun Yedutun nun muxun naxanye yi sugandixi, ne fan yi na alogo e xa Alatala tantun, bayo a hinanna luma nɛn habadan! <verse eid="1CH 16:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 16:42"/>Heman nun Yedutun yi xɔtane fema, e yi kariɲanne maxama alogo e xa bɛtin ba Ala xa. Yedutun ma diine nan yi na dɛ kantanne ra.<verse eid="1CH 16:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 16:43"/>Na xanbi ra, yamaan birin yi siga e konni. Dawuda fan yi xɛtɛ a konni dubadeni a denbayaan xa.<verse eid="1CH 16:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1CH 17"/>
  <para style="s">Alaa layirina Dawuda xa</para>
  <para style="r">Samuyɛli Firinden 7.1-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 17:1"/>Dawuda to yelin soɛ a manga banxin kui, a yi a fala Nabi Natan xa, a naxa, “Banxin naxan nafalaxi suman wudin na, n na nan kui, koni Alatalaa Layiri Kankiraan mɔn bubun nan kui.” <verse eid="1CH 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 17:2"/>Natan yi Dawuda yabi, a naxa, “I rafan feene birin liga, bayo Ala i xɔn.”<verse eid="1CH 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 17:3"/>Na kɔɛɛn na, Ala yi a fala Natan xa, a naxa, <verse eid="1CH 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 17:4"/>“Siga, a fala n ma walikɛɛn Dawuda xa fa fala Alatala ito nan falaxi, a naxa, ‘I tan mi batuden tima n xa n luma dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="1CH 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 17:5"/>N yɛtɛɛn munma lu n batu banxi kui singen, xabu n na Isirayila kaane ramini lɔxɔni Misiran fari ma han to, koni n yi bubun nan kui yiren birin yi. <verse eid="1CH 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 17:6"/>N siga dɛnaxan birin yi nxu nun Isirayila kaane, n yɛɛrati wuyaxi dɔxɔ nɛn n ma yamana Isirayila xun na alogo e xa n ma yamaan masuxu. Koni, na waxatin birin yi, n mi a fala muxu yo xa, n naxa: Nanfera, i mi suman wudi banxin tixi n xa?’ ”<verse eid="1CH 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 17:7"/>“Nanara, i mɔn xa a fala n ma walikɛɛn Dawuda xa, i naxa, ‘Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna ito nan falaxi, a naxa: N tan nan i baxi xuruseene fɔxɔ ra kantan tideni alogo i xa findi n ma yamana Isirayila yɛɛratiin na. <verse eid="1CH 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 17:8"/>I siga yiren naxan birin yi n lu nɛn i xɔn, n yi i yaxune birin faxa i yɛtagi, n yi i findi xili gbee kanna ra alo muxu gbeen naxanye bɔxɔ xɔnna fari. <verse eid="1CH 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 17:9"/>N yiren soma nɛn n ma yamana Isirayila yii e dɔxɔma dɛnaxan yi. E luma nɛn na, gaxu yo mi e suxɛ. Muxu ɲaxi yo mɔn mi fa e ɲaxankatama alo bodeni, <verse eid="1CH 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 17:10"/>n kitisane dɔxɔ n ma yamana Isirayila xun na waxatin naxan yi. N ni i yaxune birin sa i sanna bun. N naxan falama i xa, Alatala nan banxin tima i xa naxan findima i yixɛtɛne ra mangayani. <verse eid="1CH 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 17:11"/>I na faxa waxatin naxan yi, i siga i benbane fɛma, n yi i yɛtɛna diina nde sugandi a ti i ɲɔxɔni mangayani, n yi a sɛnbɛn xun masa. <verse eid="1CH 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 17:12"/>Na nan n batu banxin tima n xa, n yi a mangayaan nasabati habadan. <verse eid="1CH 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 17:13"/>N findi a fafe ra, a fan yi findi n ma diin na. N mi n ma hinanna masigama a ra alo n naxan liga manga singen na. <verse eid="1CH 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 17:14"/>N na a findima nɛn n ma yamana mangan na, a mangayaan mi kalɛ habadan.’ ”<verse eid="1CH 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 17:15"/>Ala naxan birin fala Natan xa fetoni alo xiyena, a na birin yɛba Dawuda xa.<verse eid="1CH 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dawudaa Ala maxandina</para>
  <para style="r">Samuyɛli Firinden 7.18-29</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 17:16"/>Na xanbi ra, Manga Dawuda yi siga, a sa dɔxɔ Alatala yɛtagi, a yi a fala, a naxa, “Marigina Alatala, n na a kolon a n tan nun n ma denbayaan mi lan nxu na birin sɔtɔ i naxan fixi nxu ma. <verse eid="1CH 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 17:17"/>Koni, Ala, i tan yɛɛ ra yi, sese mi na ra! I bata dɛ xuine tongo lan i ya walikɛna denbayana tila ma. Marigina Alatala, i bata n yatɛ alo muxu fisamantenna. <verse eid="1CH 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 17:18"/>N tan Dawuda, n nɔɛ nanse falɛ i xa xunna kenli ito a fe ra i naxan fixi i ya walikɛɛn ma? I tan yɛtɛna i ya walikɛɛn kolon. <verse eid="1CH 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 17:19"/>Alatala, i bata fe gbeeni ito ragidi i ya walikɛna fe ra fata i sagoon na alogo i xa i sɛnbɛ gbeen mayita. <verse eid="1CH 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 17:20"/>Alatala, i ɲɔxɔn mi na, ala gbɛtɛ mi na ba i tan na. Nxu bata na kolon. <verse eid="1CH 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 17:21"/>Siya gbɛtɛn mundun dunuɲa yi naxan luxi alo i ya yamana Isirayila, Ala naxanye raminixi konyiyani? I e xunba nɛn Misiran kaane nun e alane sɛnbɛn bun, i yi e findi i ya yamaan na, i siya gbɛtɛne kedi i ya yamaan yɛɛ ra, i kabanako fe magaxuxine raba e yɛtagi alogo i xa i xinla makɛnɛn. <verse eid="1CH 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 17:22"/>I yi Isirayila findi i ya yamaan na habadan. Alatala, i yi findi nxɔ Ala ra.”<verse eid="1CH 17:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 17:23"/>“Iki, Alatala, i dɛ xuiin naxan tongoxi n tan, i ya walikɛɛn nun n ma denbayaan xa, na xa rakamali habadan. Na liga alo i a falaxi kii naxan yi. <verse eid="1CH 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 17:24"/>Na rakamali alogo i xinla xa binya han habadan. Muxune a falama nɛn nayi, e naxa, ‘Alatala Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna, Ala naxan Isirayila xun na, a findixi Isirayilaa Ala nan na.’ Sɛnbɛn xa lu i ya walikɛɛn Dawudaa denbayaan xa i yɛtagi. <verse eid="1CH 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 17:25"/>N ma Ala, i bata i miriyaan yita n na a i n yixɛtɛne findima nɛn mangane ra n ɲɔxɔni. Nanara, i ya walikɛɛn bata susu fɛ i yɛtagi i maxandideni. <verse eid="1CH 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 17:26"/>Alatala, i tan nan Ala ra. Iki, i bata fala faɲini ito ti i ya walikɛɛn xa. <verse eid="1CH 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 17:27"/>I bata a ragidi a i xa barakan sa n ma denbayani alogo n bɔnsɔnna xa lu mangayani i yɛtagi habadan. Bayo, i tan, Alatala nan barakan nagidixi n ma denbayaan ma, barakan luma nɛn a fɔxɔ ra habadan.”<verse eid="1CH 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1CH 18"/>
  <para style="s">Dawuda nɔ sɔtɔna yɛngɛni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 8:1-14">Samuyɛli Firindena 8.1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 18:1"/>Na waxatin danguxina, Dawuda yi Filisitine nɔ yɛngɛni, a yi e rayarabi, a yi Gati taan nun a rabilinne ba e yii.<verse eid="1CH 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 18:2"/>A yi Moyaba kaane fan nɔ yɛngɛni, e yi lu a yamarin bun ma, e lu mudun soɛ a yii.<verse eid="1CH 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 18:3"/>Dawuda mɔn yi Soba mangan Hadadeseri fan nɔ yɛngɛni Xamata mabinni, Hadadeseri yi waxi Efirati baan tongo feni waxatin naxan yi. <verse eid="1CH 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 18:4"/>Dawuda yi yɛngɛ so wontoro wuli keden nun soo ragi wuli solofere nun sofa wuli mɔxɔɲɛ ba a yii. A yi soone birin san xanbi ra fasane bolon fɔ soo kɛmɛ ɲɔxɔndɔn a naxanye ramara.<verse eid="1CH 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 18:5"/>Arami kaane yi keli Damasi taani, e yi fa Soba mangan Hadadeseri malideni, koni Dawuda yi e sofa wuli mɔxɔɲɛn nun firin faxa. <verse eid="1CH 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 18:6"/>Dawuda yi a yamana kanne dɔxɔ Damasi taani Arami yamanani. Arami kaane yi lu Dawudaa yamarin bun, e lu mudun soɛ a yii. Dawuda na yi siga dɛdɛ, Alatala yi xunna kenla fima nɛn a ma. <verse eid="1CH 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 18:7"/>Dawuda yi Hadadeseri a sofane yɛ masansan wure lefa xɛma daxine xali Yerusalɛn yi. <verse eid="1CH 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 18:8"/>A yi sula gbegbe tongo keli Hadadeseri a taane yi, Tibati nun Kun. Sulemani yi na rawali a findi ige ramara se gbeen na e nun sɛnbɛtɛnne nun saraxa ganden waliseene.<verse eid="1CH 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 18:9"/>Xamata mangan Tohu yi a mɛ a Dawuda bata Soba mangan Hadadeseri a sofane birin nɔ yɛngɛni, <verse eid="1CH 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 18:10"/>a yi a dii xɛmɛn Hadoran nasiga Manga Dawuda ma, alogo a xa sa a xɔntɔn a nɔ sɔtɔna fe ra Hadadeseri yɛngɛni, bayo Manga Tohu nun Manga Hadadeseri yi yɛngɛni. A mɔn yi siga xɛma seene ra e nun gbetin nun sulana. <verse eid="1CH 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 18:11"/>Manga Dawuda yi na birin fi Alatala ma, e nun gbeti fixɛn nun xɛmana a naxan tongo siyani itoe birin yii: Edɔn kaane nun Moyaba kaane nun Amonine nun Filisitine nun Amalɛkine.<verse eid="1CH 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 18:12"/>Seruyaa diina Abisayi yi Edɔn kaa wuli fu nun solomasɛxɛ faxa Fɔxɔ Lanbanni. <verse eid="1CH 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 18:13"/>A yi yamana kanne lu Edɔn yi alogo na birin xa lu Dawudaa yamarin bun ma. Dawuda na yi siga dɛdɛ, Alatala yi xunna kenla fima nɛn a ma.<verse eid="1CH 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dawudaa kuntigine</para>
  <para style="r">Samuyɛli Firinden 8.15-18</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 18:14"/>Dawuda yi lu Isirayila birin xun na. A yi kiti kɛndɛn sama tinxinna nin a yamaan birin yi. <verse eid="1CH 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 18:15"/>Seruyaa dii xɛmɛn Yowaba nan yi sofane kuntigin na. Axiludu a dii xɛmɛn Yosafati nan yi mangana yenla ra. <verse eid="1CH 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 18:16"/>Axitubaa dii xɛmɛn Sadɔki nun Abiyatari a dii xɛmɛna Abimeleki nan yi saraxaraline ra. Sawesa nan yi sɛbɛli tiin na. <verse eid="1CH 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 18:17"/>Yehoyadaa dii xɛmɛn Bɛnaya nan yi Keretine nun Pɛlɛti kaane xun na. Manga Dawudaa diine nan yi mangan bundɔxɔne ra.<verse eid="1CH 18:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1CH 19"/>
  <para style="s">Dawuda nun Amonine yɛngɛna</para>
  <para style="r">Samuyɛli Firinden 10.1-5</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 19:1"/>Na dangu xanbini, Amonine mangan Naxasi yi faxa, a diin yi dɔxɔ a ɲɔxɔni. <verse eid="1CH 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 19:2"/>Dawuda yi a miri, a naxa, “N hinanma nɛn Naxasi a dii xɛmɛn Xanun na, bayo a fafe hinan nɛn n na.” Dawuda yi xɛrane rasiga Xanun ma a fafe sayaan xɔntɔn tideni. Dawudaa xɛrane yi sa so Amonine yamanani Xanun fɛma saya xɔntɔndeni. <verse eid="1CH 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 19:3"/>Koni, Amonine kuntigine yi a fala Xanun xa, e naxa, “I laxi a ra a Dawuda a muxune rafaxi i fafe saya xɔntɔnden nan tun yi ba? E mi faxi kɔtɛn xan na ba alogo e xa taan nakɔrɔsi, lɔxɔna nde e yi nɔ a suxɛ?” <verse eid="1CH 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 19:4"/>Nayi, Xanun yi Dawudaa xɛrane suxu, a yi e dɛ xabene bi, a yi e domane raxaba e xɔrɛne yilanni, a fa e raxɛtɛ Dawuda ma. <verse eid="1CH 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 19:5"/>E fa xɛrane fe dɛntɛgɛn sa Dawuda xa, a yi muxune xɛ a xɛrane fɔxɔ ra, bayo e yi yagixi han, a yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ lu Yeriko yi han ɛ dɛ xabene yi mini. Na xanbi ra, ɛ fa so be.”<verse eid="1CH 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="r">Samuyɛli Firinden 10.6-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 19:6"/>Amonine to a kolon a e bata raɲaxu Dawuda ma alo se kunxin xirina, Xanun yi gbeti fixɛn kilo wuli tonge saxan e nun naanin fi Arami kaane ma, naxanye yi Mesopotamiya yamanani, e nun Maka nun Soba yamanani alogo e xa fa e yɛngɛ so wontorone nun e soo ragine ra. <verse eid="1CH 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 19:7"/>Na ma, e yi fa yɛngɛ so wontoron wuli tonge saxan nun firin na. Maka mangan nun a yamaan fan yi fa, e fa e malan Medeba taan yɛtagi. Amonine fan yi mini e taane yi alogo e xa Dawuda yɛngɛ. <verse eid="1CH 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 19:8"/>Dawuda yi na mɛ, a yi sofa kuntigin Yowaba nun a sofa kɛndɛne birin nasiga e yɛngɛdeni. <verse eid="1CH 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 19:9"/>Amonine yi mini, e ti yɛngɛ so xinla ma e taan so dɛɛn na. Mangan naxanye fa e malideni, ne yi tixi e danna burunna ra.<verse eid="1CH 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 19:10"/>Yowaba to a kolon a yɛngɛn yi a yɛɛ ra e nun a xanbi ra, a yi Isirayila sofa kɛndɛna ndee sugandi Arami kaane yɛngɛ xinla ma. <verse eid="1CH 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 19:11"/>A yi sofa dɔnxɛne lu a tada Abisayi a yamarin bun ma Amonine yɛngɛ xinla ma. <verse eid="1CH 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 19:12"/>Yowaba yi a fala a tada xa, a naxa, “Xa Arami kaane sɛnbɛn gbo n xa, i fa n mali. Xa Amonine fan sɛnbɛn gbo i xa, n fan yi sa i mali. <verse eid="1CH 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 19:13"/>I tunnafan, en na en wɛkilɛ, en yi en ma yamaan xun mayɛngɛ e nun en ma Alaa taane. Alatala xa a rafan feen liga.”<verse eid="1CH 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 19:14"/>Yowaba nun a ganla yi e maso Arami kaane yɛngɛdeni, koni ne yi e gi a yɛɛ ra. <verse eid="1CH 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 19:15"/>Amonine to a to, a Arami kaane bata e gi, e fan yi e gi Yowaba tada Abisayi bun. E yi sa so e taani. Yowaba fan yi xɛtɛ Yerusalɛn yi.<verse eid="1CH 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 19:16"/>Arami kaane to a kolon a Isirayila bata e nɔ yɛngɛni, e yi xɛrane rasiga Arami kaane ma naxanye yi Efirati baan kidi ma. Hadadeseri a sofa kuntigin Sofaki nan yi e xun na. <verse eid="1CH 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 19:17"/>Dawuda to na mɛ, a yi Isirayila kaane birin malan, e yi fa Yurudɛn baan gidi, e siga Arami kaane yɛngɛdeni. <verse eid="1CH 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 19:18"/>Arami kaane mɔn yi e gi Isirayila kaane bun. Dawuda yi e yɛngɛ so wontoro sofaan muxu wuli solofere faxa, e nun e sofaan muxu wuli tonge naanin naxanye yi sigama e sanni. A yi sofa kuntigin Sofaki fan faxa. <verse eid="1CH 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 19:19"/>Hadadeseri a walikɛne to a kolon a Isirayila kaane bata e nɔ yɛngɛni, e yi layirin xidi e nun Dawuda tagi, e yi lu a yamarin bun. Xabu na, Arami kaane mi fa tin Amonine maliyɛ sɔnɔn.<verse eid="1CH 19:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1CH 20"/>
  <para style="s">Dawuda Amonine nun Filisitine yɛngɛ fena</para>
  <para style="r">Samuyɛli Firinden 11.1 nun 12.26-31</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 20:1"/>Ɲɛɛ nɛnɛn fɔlɔn na, mangane yi darixi minɛ yɛngɛ sodeni waxatin naxan yi, Yowaba nun a sofa wɛkilɛxine yi sa Amonine yɛngɛ. Koni, Dawuda tan yi lu Yerusalɛn yi. Yowaba yi Rabaha taan suxu, a mɛnna kala. <verse eid="1CH 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 20:2"/>Nayi, Dawuda yi fa mangaya taxamaseri kɔmɔtin ba Amonine mangan xun na, naxan xɛmaan binyen yi danguɛ kilo tonge saxan na. Gɛmɛ faɲi kɛndɛn fan yi a ma. Na mangaya taxamaseri kɔmɔtin yi so Dawuda xun na, a yi funma se wuyaxi tongo taani.<verse eid="1CH 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 20:3"/>Yamaan naxan yi na, Dawuda yi ne xali, a yi sa e ti karahan wanle ra, wudi masonla nun gɛmɛ bɔɔn nun wudi sɛgɛna. A Amonine taane birin ma fe liga na kii nin. Na xanbi ra, Dawuda nun a sofane yi xɛtɛ Yerusalɛn yi.<verse eid="1CH 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 20:4"/>Na danguxina, Isirayila kaane nun Filisitine yi sa yɛngɛ Geseri yi. Na yɛngɛni, Xusa kaan Sibekayi yi Sipayi faxa. Refa yixɛtɛna nde nan yi Sipayi ra. Na yi Filisitine yagi.<verse eid="1CH 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 20:5"/>Isirayila kaane nun Filisitine mɔn yi yɛngɛ. Yayiri a diina Elexanan yi Gati kaan Goliyati xunyɛn Laxami faxa na waxatin nin. A sɛnbɛn yi gbo han, a tanban yi gbo alo gbindonna.<verse eid="1CH 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 20:6"/>Yɛngɛ gbɛtɛ yi keli Gati taani. Xɛmɛ kuyena nde yi na, naxan yii soli sennin sennin yi a ra e nun san soli sennin sennin, e birin malanxina, mɔxɔɲɛn nun naanin. Refa yixɛtɛna nde nan yi na fan na. <verse eid="1CH 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 20:7"/>A to Isirayila makonbi, Dawuda tada Simeyaa dii xɛmɛn Yonatan yi a faxa. <verse eid="1CH 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 20:8"/>Xɛmɛni itoe birin yi fataxi Refa yixɛtɛne nan na Gati taani. Dawuda nun a sofane yi ne birin faxa.<verse eid="1CH 20:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1CH 21"/>
  <para style="s">Isirayila yamaan yatɛn sɛbɛ fena</para>
  <para style="r">Samuyɛli Firinden 24.1-9</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 21:1"/>Setana yi keli Isirayila xili ma, a yi Dawuda radin a xa Isirayila kaane tɛngɛ. <verse eid="1CH 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 21:2"/>Dawuda yi a fala Yowaba nun a sofa kuntigine xa, a naxa, “Ɛ siga, ɛ sa Isirayila kaane tɛngɛ, keli Bɛriseba ma, sa dɔxɔ Dan yamanan na. Ɛ fa na yatɛn dɛntɛgɛ n xa.” <verse eid="1CH 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 21:3"/>Yowaba yi a yabi, a naxa, “Alatala xa Isirayila yamaan nawuya ayi dɔxɔ kɛmɛ. Mangana, n kanna, i ya walikɛne xa mi ne birin na ba? Nanfera i fe sifani ito maxɔdinxi? Nanfera i waxi a xɔn ma Isirayila yamaan xa yulubin tongo?” <verse eid="1CH 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 21:4"/>Koni, mangan xuiin mi yi matandɛ. Nanara, Yowaba yi mini, a yi Isirayila bɔxɔn birin yisiga, a fa xɛtɛ Yerusalɛn yi. <verse eid="1CH 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 21:5"/>A yi yamaan yatɛn fala Dawuda xa. Isirayila kaane yatɛn ni i ra: xɛmɛ silanfan kanna miliyɔn keden wuli kɛmɛ. Yuda kaane yatɛn ni i ra: xɛmɛ silanfan kanna wuli kɛmɛ naanin muxu wuli tonge solofere. <verse eid="1CH 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 21:6"/>Koni, Yowaba mi Lewi nun Bunyamin bɔnsɔnna muxune tɛngɛ, bayo mangana yamarin mi yi rafanxi a ma. <verse eid="1CH 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 21:7"/>Yamarini ito yi raɲaxu Ala ma. A yi Isirayila ɲaxankata.<verse eid="1CH 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ala yi Dawuda yulubin saran a ra</para>
  <para style="r">Samuyɛli Firinden 24.10-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 21:8"/>Dawuda yi a fala Ala xa, a naxa, “N yulubi gbeen nan ligaxi ito ra. Iki, n bata i mayandi, i xa diɲa n tan, i ya walikɛɛn yulubin ma. N bata xaxilitareyaan liga.”<verse eid="1CH 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 21:9"/>Alatala yi a fala Manga Dawudaa fetoon Gadi xa, a naxa, <verse eid="1CH 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 21:10"/>“A fala Dawuda xa, i naxa, ‘Alatala ito nan falaxi, a naxa: Fe saxan ni i ra. Keden sugandi, n xa na liga i ra.’ ” <verse eid="1CH 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 21:11"/>Gadi yi siga Dawuda fɛma, a yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Alatala ito nan falaxi i xa, a naxa, <verse eid="1CH 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 21:12"/>‘Ɲaxankatan mundun lan a xa sa i ma: ɲɛɛ saxan fitina kamɛna, hanma yaxune yi ɛ halagi silanfanna ra kike saxan, hanma Alatala xa a halagi ti malekan nafa ɛ ma, naxan Isirayila yamaan naxɔrima Alaa silanfanna nun fure ɲaxin na xii saxan.’ Iki, a fala n xa n lan n xa sa naxan fala n kanna xa naxan n xɛxi.” <verse eid="1CH 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 21:13"/>Dawuda yi Gadi yabi, a naxa, “N bɔɲɛn sunuxi han! A lan n xa n yɛtɛ lu Alatala yii bayo a kininkininna gbo, na fisa benun n xa lu adamadiine sagoni.” <verse eid="1CH 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 21:14"/>Alatala yi fure ɲaxin nadin Isirayila yamaan ma han muxu wuli tonge solofere yi faxa Isirayila yamanani.<verse eid="1CH 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 21:15"/>Ala yi malekan xɛ Yerusalɛn yi, a xa sa na kala. A yi na kalama waxatin naxan yi, Alatala yi a to, a yi nimisa na halagina fe ra. A yi a fala na malekan xa naxan yi a kalama, a naxa, “Na bata lan. E lu na fa.” Alatalaa malekan yi tixi Oronan, Yebusu kaana lonna nan ma. <verse eid="1CH 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 21:16"/>Dawuda yi a yɛɛ rakeli, a Alatalaa malekan to tixi kuyen nun bɔxɔn lan tagini, a silanfanna baxi a tɛɛni, a yɛɛ rafindixi Yerusalɛn ma. Dawuda nun fonne yi kasa bɛnbɛli dugin nagodo e ma sununi, e yi bira, e yi e yɛtagin lan bɔxɔn ma. <verse eid="1CH 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 21:17"/>Dawuda yi a fala Ala xa, a naxa, “N tan xa mi yamarin fixi ba a Isirayila yamaan xa tɛngɛ? N tan nan yulubin ligaxi, n tan nan fe kobini ito ligaxi. Yamaan tan nanse ligaxi? Alatala, n ma Ala, n tan nun n ma denbayaan halagi, i ya yamaan lu na.”<verse eid="1CH 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dawuda yi Oronan ma lonna sara</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2SA 24:18-25">Samuyɛli Firindena 24.18-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 21:18"/>Alatalaa malekan yi a fala Gadi xa, a a xa a fala Dawuda xa, fa fala a xa sa saraxa gandena nde rafala Alatala xa Oronan Yebusu kaana lonna ma. <verse eid="1CH 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 21:19"/>Dawuda yi siga mɛnni alo Gadi a fala a xa kii naxan yi Alatala xinla ra. <verse eid="1CH 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 21:20"/>Oronan yi murutu bɔnbɔni lonna ma, a yi a firifiri, a yi malekan to. A dii naaninne yi e luxun. <verse eid="1CH 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 21:21"/>Na waxatini, Dawuda fan yi a maso. Oronan to a to, a yi keli lonna ma, a sa a xinbi sin Dawuda bun ma, a yɛtagin yi lan bɔxɔn ma. <verse eid="1CH 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 21:22"/>Dawuda yi a fala Oronan xa, a naxa, “Lonni ito so n yii alogo n xa saraxa ganden nafala Alatala xa. N na a saren dɛfexin soɛ i yii alogo fure ɲaxin xa ba yamaan ma.” <verse eid="1CH 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 21:23"/>Oronan yi Dawuda yabi, a naxa, “Mangana, a tongo. N kanna xa a rafan feen liga a ra. N bata ɲingeni itoe fan so i yii, e xa findi saraxa gan daxin na. Ɲingena xɛɛ ra bɔnbɔ seene yi findi saraxan gan yegen na, murutuni ito fan xa findi bogise saraxan na. N bata ito birin fi i ma.” <verse eid="1CH 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 21:24"/>Koni, Manga Dawuda yi a fala Oronan xa, a naxa, “Ɛn-ɛn, n waxi a sara feni a saren dɛfexin nan na. N mi seen bama saraxan na Alatala xa n mi naxan saraxi. N mi nɔɛ saraxa gan daxin bɛ n mi naxan sare fixi.” <verse eid="1CH 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 21:25"/>Nayi, Dawuda yi xɛmaan kilo solofere so Oronan yii na lonna fe ra. <verse eid="1CH 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 21:26"/>Dawuda yi saraxa ganden nafala mɛnni Alatala xa, a fa saraxa gan daxine nun bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxane ba. A yi Alatala maxandi, Alatala yi a yabi tɛɛn na naxan godo saraxa ganden ma keli kore.<verse eid="1CH 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 21:27"/>Nayi, Alatala yi falan ti malekan xa, a yi silanfanna raso a tɛɛni. <verse eid="1CH 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 21:28"/>Na waxatini, Dawuda yi saraxane bama Oronan Yebusu kaana lonna nan ma, bayo a bata yi a kolon a Alatala a yabima mɛnna nin. <verse eid="1CH 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 21:29"/>Na waxatini, Musa Alatala Batu Bubun naxan nafala tonbonni, na yi na taan kideni Gabayon yi, e nun saraxa gandena, saraxa gan daxine yi bama dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="1CH 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 21:30"/>Koni, Dawuda mi yi sigɛ mɛnni Ala maxɔdindeni, bayo a yi gaxuxi Alatalaa malekana silanfanna yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="1CH 21:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1CH 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 22:1"/>Dawuda yi a fala, a naxa, “En Marigina Alatalaa banxin ti be, e nun saraxa gandena, Isirayila saraxa gan daxine bama a xa dɛnaxan yi.”<verse eid="1CH 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dawuda yi Ala Batu Banxin ti feni tɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 22:2"/>Dawuda yi yamarin fi a xɔɲɛn naxanye dɔxi Isirayila yamanani, a ne xa malan. A yi ne findi gɛmɛ masonle ra Ala Batu Banxin ti feen na. <verse eid="1CH 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 22:3"/>Dawuda yi wure gbegbe fen, naxanye findima banxin gbangban seene nun dɛɛn singan seene ra. A yi sula gbegbe fan fen naxan yatɛ mi yi nɔɛ kolonɲɛ. <verse eid="1CH 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 22:4"/>Sidɔn kaane nun Tire kaane yi Dawuda mali suman wudi faɲin gbegbe fendeni. <verse eid="1CH 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 22:5"/>Dawuda yi a fala, a naxa, “N ma diin Sulemani munma kɔxɔ singen, a mɔn mi wanla kolon. Banxin naxan tima Alatala xa, na lanma a xa tofanɲɛ ayi, a rayabu siyane birin yɛtagi.” Na ma, Dawuda se gbegbe malan nɛn na banxin ti feen na benun a xa faxa.<verse eid="1CH 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 22:6"/>Dawuda yi a diin Sulemani xili, a yi a fala a xa fa fala a xa banxin ti Alatala xa, Isirayilaa Ala. <verse eid="1CH 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 22:7"/>Dawuda yi a fala Sulemani xa, a naxa, “N ma diina, n bata yi a miri n bɔɲɛni, n xa banxin ti Alatala xa, n ma Ala, <verse eid="1CH 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 22:8"/>koni Alatala a fala nɛn n xa, a naxa, ‘I bata muxu wuyaxi faxa yɛngɛ wuyaxi yi, i nama banxin ti n xa. Yɛngɛ soon nan i ra, i bata faxa gbegbe ti n yɛtagi. <verse eid="1CH 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 22:9"/>Koni, i diina nde sɔtɔma nɛn, naxan findima bɔɲɛ xunbeli muxun na, n matabun fima naxan ma a yaxune fe ra. A xili bama nɛn Sulemani. Isirayila yamaan luma nɛn bɔɲɛ xunbenli tun a siimayaan birin yi. <verse eid="1CH 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 22:10"/>A tan nan banxin tima n xa n xinla binyama dɛnaxan yi, a yi findi n ma diin na, n fan yi findi a fafe ra. A mangayaan sabatima nɛn Isirayila xun na habadan.’ ”<verse eid="1CH 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 22:11"/>“Iki, n ma diina, Alatala xa lu i xɔn alogo i xa nɔ Alatalaa banxin tiyɛ, i ya Ala, alo a a fala kii naxan yi lan i tan ma. <verse eid="1CH 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 22:12"/>Alatala xa fekolonna nun xaxili faɲin fi i ma a na i findi mangan na waxatin naxan yi Isirayila yamanani alogo i xa Alatalaa sariyan suxu, i ya Ala. <verse eid="1CH 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 22:13"/>Feen birin sɔnɔyama i xa nɛn, xa i Alatalaa sariyan nun a yamarine suxu, a naxanye soxi Musa yii Isirayila xa. I wɛkilɛ, i sɛnbɛ so! I nama kuisan, i nama gaxu fefe yɛɛ ra! <verse eid="1CH 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 22:14"/>N bata wɛkilɛ n yi xɛmaan kilo miliyɔn saxan e nun kilo wuli kɛmɛ naanin malan Alatala Batu Banxin ti feen na. N mɔn bata wure gbeti fixɛn kilo miliyɔn tonge saxan e nun naanin malan. Sulan nun wuren bata gbo ayi han a yatɛn mi nɔɛ kolonɲɛ. N bata wudin nun gɛmɛn fan fen. I mɔn xa nde sa e fari. <verse eid="1CH 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 22:15"/>Walikɛ wuyaxi i yii naxanye fatan gɛmɛn masolɛ, e nun naxanye fatan sawurane rafalɛ gɛmɛn nun wudine ma, e nun yiirawanla naxanye wanla sifan birin kolon. <verse eid="1CH 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 22:16"/>Xɛmaan nun wure gbeti fixɛn nun sulan nun wurena i yii han a dangu ayi. Keli i ya wanla fɔlɔ keden na. Alatala xa i mali.”<verse eid="1CH 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 22:17"/>Dawuda yi a fala Isirayila kuntigine birin xa, a e xa fa a diin Sulemani mali. A yi a fala e xa, a naxa, <verse eid="1CH 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 22:18"/>“Alatala, ɛ Ala mi luxi ɛ xɔn ba? A mi bɔɲɛ xunbenla fixi ɛ ma yamanan birin yi ba? A bata be kaane sa n sagoni. Yamanan bata lu Alatala nun a yamaan bun ma. <verse eid="1CH 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 22:19"/>Ɛ Alatala, ɛ Ala fen ɛ bɔɲɛn nun ɛ niin birin na. Ɛ siga, ɛ sa yire sariɲanxin ti Marigina Alatala xa, ɛ Ala, alogo ɛ xa fa Alatalaa Layiri Kankiraan nun a se sariɲanxine raso Ala Batu Banxini, Alatala xinla binyama dɛnaxan yi.”<verse eid="1CH 22:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1CH 23"/>
  <para style="s">Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 23:1"/>Dawuda to yelin forɛ, a yi a diin Sulemani dɔxɔ Isirayila mangan na. <verse eid="1CH 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 23:2"/>A yi Isirayila kuntigine nun saraxaraline nun Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune malan. <verse eid="1CH 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 23:3"/>E yi Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune tɛngɛ, naxanye bata yi ɲɛɛ tonge saxan sɔtɔ. E yatɛn yi siga han muxu wuli tonge saxan e nun solomasɛxɛ. <verse eid="1CH 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 23:4"/>Dawuda yi a fala, a naxa, “N bata muxu wuli mɔxɔɲɛn nun naanin sugandi alogo e xa e yengi lu Alatala Batu Banxin wanle xɔn. Muxu wuli sennin xa findi kitisane ra. Muxu wuli naanin yi findi dɛ kantan muxune ra. <verse eid="1CH 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 23:5"/>Muxu wuli naanin yi findi Alatala tantun muxune ra maxaseene ra, n naxanye rafalaxi a tantun seen na.”<verse eid="1CH 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 23:6"/>Dawuda yi Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune yitaxun Lewi a diine denbaya yɛɛn ma. Lewi a diine nan itoe ra: Gɛrisɔn nun Kehati nun Merari.<verse eid="1CH 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 23:7"/>Gɛrisɔn ma diine nan itoe ra: Ladana nun Simeyi.<verse eid="1CH 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 23:8"/>Ladanaa diine nan itoe ra: Yɛxiyɛli, a dii singen nun Setama nun Yowɛli. E birin malanxina muxu saxan.<verse eid="1CH 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 23:9"/>Simeyi a diine nan itoe ra: Selomiti nun Xasiyɛli nun Haran. E birin malanxina muxu saxan. Ladanaa denbaya xunne nan ne ra.<verse eid="1CH 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 23:10"/>Simeyi a diine nan itoe ra: Yaxati nun Sisa nun Yewusi nun Beriya. Simeyi a dii naaninne nan ne ra. <verse eid="1CH 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 23:11"/>Yaxati nan dii singen na. Sisa nan dii firinden na. Koni, Yewusi nun Beriya mi dii wuyaxi sɔtɔ. Na ma, e yi e diine yatɛ denbaya kedenna ra e bɔnsɔn kɛdin ma.<verse eid="1CH 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 23:12"/>Kehati a diine nan itoe ra: Amirama nun Yisehari nun Xebiron nun Yusiyɛli. E birin malanxina muxu naanin.<verse eid="1CH 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 23:13"/>Amirama a diine nan itoe ra: Haruna nun Musa. Haruna yi rasariɲan Ala xa alogo a xa lu walɛ yire sariɲanxi fisamantenni, e nun a bɔnsɔnna muxune han habadan, alogo e xa wusulanna gan saraxan na Alatala xa, e yi wali a yɛtagi, e mɔn yi lu dubɛ muxune xa Ala xinli han habadan. <verse eid="1CH 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 23:14"/>Musa tan findi Alaa muxun nan na. A diine yi lu Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune yɛ.<verse eid="1CH 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 23:15"/>Musaa diine nan itoe ra: Gɛrisɔmi nun Eliyeseri.<verse eid="1CH 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 23:16"/>Gɛrisɔmi a diin nan ito ra: Sebuweli nan yi a dii singen na.<verse eid="1CH 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 23:17"/>Eliyeseri a diine nan itoe ra: Rexabiya nan yi a dii singen na. Eliyeseri mi dii xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ sɔtɔ, koni Rexabiya dii wuyaxi sɔtɔ nɛn.<verse eid="1CH 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 23:18"/>Yisehari a diine nan itoe ra: Selomiti nan yi a dii singen na.<verse eid="1CH 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 23:19"/>Xebiron ma diine nan itoe ra: Yeriya nan yi a dii singen na, Amari a firindena, Yaxasiyeli a saxandena, e nun Yekameyami a naanindena.<verse eid="1CH 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 23:20"/>Yusiyɛli a diine nan itoe ra: Mike nan yi a dii singen na, Yisiya a firindena.<verse eid="1CH 23:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 23:21"/>Merari a diine nan itoe ra: Maxali nun Musi. Maxali a diine nan itoe ra: Eleyasari nun Kisu. <verse eid="1CH 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 23:22"/>Eleyasari faxa nɛn, a mi dii xɛmɛ yo lu, koni a dii tɛmɛne tan lu nɛn. Kisu a diine yi e dɔxɔ e ɲaxanle ra. <verse eid="1CH 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 23:23"/>Musi a diine nan itoe ra: Maxali nun Ederi nun Yeremoti. E birin malanxina muxu saxan.<verse eid="1CH 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 23:24"/>Ne nan findi Lewi yixɛtɛne ra naxanye findi bɔnsɔnna denbaya xunne ra, e keden kedenna birin xinle sɛbɛxi e bɔnsɔn kɛdin kui. E yi walima nɛn Alatala Batu Banxin kui e barin na yi ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛn sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 23:25"/>Dawuda bata yi a fala, a naxa, “Alatala, Isirayilaa Ala bata bɔɲɛ xunbenla fi a yamaan ma. A bata fa dɔxɔ Yerusalɛn yi habadan. <verse eid="1CH 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 23:26"/>Lewine mi fa Alaa Batu Bubun nun a muranne xalima yire gbɛtɛ yi sɔnɔn.” <verse eid="1CH 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 23:27"/>Fata Dawudaa yamari dɔnxɛne ra, Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune tɛngɛ nɛn naxanye barin bata yi ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛn sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 23:28"/>Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune nan yi Haruna yixɛtɛne malima Alatala Batu Banxin wanle ra. E tan nan yi a sansanna kuiin nun a banxin kuiin masuxuma, e mɔn yi seene rasariɲanma, e yi wali xunxurine kɛ Ala Batu Banxini. <verse eid="1CH 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 23:29"/>E yi burune rafalama naxanye ralima Ala ma, e murutu fuɲin din naxan findima bogise saraxane ra, e buru ratetaren nafala, e nun donseen sifan birin. E tan nan mɔn yengi yi dɔxi ligaseene birin xɔn, sikenle nun ligaseen naxanye seen kuyen maligama. <verse eid="1CH 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 23:30"/>E yi lanma e xa siga Alatala tantundeni xɔtɔnna nun ɲinbanna lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ. <verse eid="1CH 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 23:31"/>E mɔn yi saraxa gan daxine bama Alatala xa Matabu Lɔxɔne ma e nun Kike Nɛnɛn sanle yi, e nun sali gbɛtɛye ma. E yi lanma e xa wali Alatala xa a sariyan xɔn. <verse eid="1CH 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 23:32"/>E tan nan yi Naralan Bubun nun yire sariɲanxin masuxuma. E yi Alatala batuden wanle birin kɛma e ngaxakedenna Haruna yixɛtɛne yamarin nan bun.<verse eid="1CH 23:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1CH 24"/>
  <para style="s">Saraxaraline yitaxun fena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 24:1"/>Haruna yixɛtɛne yi yitaxunxi a dii naaninne nan na. A diine nan itoe ra: Nadaba nun Abihu nun Eleyasari nun Itamara. <verse eid="1CH 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 24:2"/>Nadaba nun Abihu singen nan faxa benun e fafe xa faxa. E mi dii yo sɔtɔ. Eleyasari nun Itamara nan yi saraxaraline ra. <verse eid="1CH 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 24:3"/>Eleyasari yixɛtɛna nde Sadɔki e nun Itamara yixɛtɛna nde Aximeleki yi Dawuda mali Harunaa diine yitaxundeni alogo e xa ti wanle ra.<verse eid="1CH 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 24:4"/>Kuntigi wuyaxi yi to Eleyasari yixɛtɛne yɛ dangu Itamara yixɛtɛne ra. Nanara, e yitaxun ikiini: Denbaya xunna muxu fu nun sennin Eleyasari yixɛtɛne yɛ. Denbaya xunna muxu solomasɛxɛ Itamara yixɛtɛne yɛ. <verse eid="1CH 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 24:5"/>E yi masɛnsɛnna ti alogo e xa e yitaxun, e yi e ti e wanle ra. Na ma, Eleyasari yixɛtɛna ndee nun Itamara yixɛtɛna ndee birin yi findi yire sariɲanxin kuntigine ra e nun kuntigine Ala xa. <verse eid="1CH 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 24:6"/>Natanɛli a diin Semaya, Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxun nan yi e xinle sɛbɛma mangan nun kuntigine nun saraxaraliin Sadɔki nun Abiyatari a diina Aximeleki nun saraxaraline denbaya xunne yɛtagi e nun Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune birin. E yi denbaya keden sugandi Eleyasari yixɛtɛne yɛ, e mɔn yi keden sugandi Itamara yixɛtɛne yɛ.<verse eid="1CH 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 24:7"/>Denbayane sugandi masɛnsɛnna xɔn ikiini: A singen Yehoyaribu nan suxu, a firindena Yɛdaya, <verse eid="1CH 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 24:8"/>a saxandena Xarimi, a naanindena Seyorimi, <verse eid="1CH 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 24:9"/>a suulundena Malakiya, a sennindena Miyamin, <verse eid="1CH 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 24:10"/>a soloferedena Hakɔsi, a solomasɛxɛdena Abiya, <verse eid="1CH 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 24:11"/>a solomanaanindena Yosuwe, a fudena Sɛkani, <verse eid="1CH 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 24:12"/>a fu nun kedendena Eliyasibi, a fu nun firindena Yakimi, <verse eid="1CH 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 24:13"/>a fu nun saxandena Xupa, a fu nun naanindena Yesebeyabi, <verse eid="1CH 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 24:14"/>a fu nun suulundena Biliga, a fu nun sennindena Imeri, <verse eid="1CH 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 24:15"/>a fu nun soloferedena Xesiri, a fu nun solomasɛxɛdena Hapisɛsi, <verse eid="1CH 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 24:16"/>a fu nun solomanaanindena Petaxi, a mɔxɔɲɛdena Esekiyɛli, <verse eid="1CH 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 24:17"/>a mɔxɔɲɛn nun kedendena Yakin, a mɔxɔɲɛn nun firindena Gamulu, <verse eid="1CH 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 24:18"/>a mɔxɔɲɛn nun saxandena Dɛlaya, a mɔxɔɲɛn nun naanindena Maasiya.<verse eid="1CH 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 24:19"/>A yi lan e xa Alatala Batu Banxin wanle suxu na kii nin alo e benba Haruna a yamari e ma kii naxan yi alo Alatala, Isirayilaa Ala bata yi a yamari a ma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="1CH 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxu gbɛtɛye fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 24:20"/>Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxu gbɛtɛn naxanye sugandi, ne nan itoe ra: Amiramaa diine yɛ: Subayeli. Subayeli a diine yɛ: Yexedeya. <verse eid="1CH 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 24:21"/>Rexabiya a diine yɛ: Yisiya, a dii singena. <verse eid="1CH 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 24:22"/>Yisehari a diine yɛ: Selomiti. Selomiti a diine yɛ: Yaxati. <verse eid="1CH 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 24:23"/>Xebiron ma diine: a dii singen Yeriya nun a dii firindena Amari nun a dii saxanden Yaxasiyeli nun a dii naaninden Yekameyami. <verse eid="1CH 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 24:24"/>Yusiyɛli a diin Mike. Mike a diine yɛ: Samiri. <verse eid="1CH 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 24:25"/>Mike xunyɛn Yisiya. Yisiyaa diine yɛ: Sakari. <verse eid="1CH 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 24:26"/>Merari a diine yɛ: Maxali nun Musi e nun a diin Yaasiyaa diine. <verse eid="1CH 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 24:27"/>Merari mamandenne, Yaasiyaa diine: Sohami nun Sakuru nun Ibiri. <verse eid="1CH 24:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 24:28"/>Maxali a diina Eleyasari. Eleyasari mi dii yo sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 24:29"/>Kisu a diine yɛ: Yerameeli. <verse eid="1CH 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 24:30"/>Musi a diine yɛ: Maxali nun Ederi nun Yerimoti. Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune nan yi ne ra denbaya yɛɛn ma.<verse eid="1CH 24:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 24:31"/>E fan sugandi masɛnsɛnna nan xɔn alo e ngaxakedenne, Haruna yixɛtɛne. Na liga Manga Dawuda nun Sadɔki nun Aximeleki nun saraxaraline denbaya xunne nun Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune nan yɛtagi. Na ma, denbayaan muxune birin yi suxi ki kedenna nin keli dii singen ma han a raɲanna.<verse eid="1CH 24:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1CH 25"/>
  <para style="s">Bɛti baane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 25:1"/>Dawuda nun sofa kuntigine yi muxuna ndee sugandi Asafi nun Heman nun Yedutun ma diine yɛ alogo e xa nabiya falane ti bɛtini bɔlɔnna nun kondenna nun kariɲanne ra. Na muxune xinle ni itoe ra naxanye yi na wanla kɛma. <verse eid="1CH 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 25:2"/>Asafi a diine yɛ: Sakuru nun Yusufu nun Netaniya nun Asarɛla. Ne yi Asafi a yamarin nan bun. Asafi fan yi nabiya falane tima bɛtini mangana yamarin bun. <verse eid="1CH 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 25:3"/>Yedutun ma diine yɛ: Gedali nun Seri nun Esayi nun Simeyi nun Hasabi nun Matitiya. E birin malanxina muxu sennin. E yi lu e fafe Yedutun ma yamarin bun. Yedutun yi nabiya falane tima, a bɔlɔnna maxa, a Alatala matɔxɔ, a yi a tantun.<verse eid="1CH 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 25:4"/>Heman a diine yɛ: Bukiya nun Matani nun Yusiyɛli nun Sebuweli nun Yerimoti nun Xananiya nun Xanani nun Eliyata nun Gidaliti nun Romanti-Eseri nun Yosobekasa nun Maloti nun Hotiri e nun Maxasiyoti. <verse eid="1CH 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 25:5"/>Muxuni itoe birin yi findixi Heman ma diine nan na naxan yi fetoon tima mangan xa fata Ala ra alo xiyena. Ala yi Heman sɛnbɛn gbo ayi, a yi dii xɛmɛ fu nun naanin nun dii tɛmɛ saxan fi a ma. <verse eid="1CH 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 25:6"/>Ne birin yi e fafe a yamarin bun ma, e bɛtine ba kariɲanne nun kondenne nun bɔlɔnne ra Alatala Batu Banxin wanla ra. Asafi nun Yedutun nun Heman yi mangana yamarin nan bun ma. <verse eid="1CH 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 25:7"/>Muxuni itoe nun e kon kaan naxanye xaranxi bɛti ba feene ma Alatala xa naxanye yi fatan, ne birin malanxina, muxu kɛmɛ firin muxu tonge solomasɛxɛ e nun solomasɛxɛ. <verse eid="1CH 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 25:8"/>E birin yi masɛnsɛnna tima alogo e xa ti wanle ra, dii ɲɔrɛn nun fonna, karamɔxɔn nun xarandiina.<verse eid="1CH 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 25:9"/>Masɛnsɛnna naxan ti, na yi Yusufu singe suxu Asafi xabilani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 25:9">A firindena, Gedali nun a ngaxakedenne nun a diine, e birin malanxina muxu fu nun firin.<verse eid="1CH 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 25:10"/>A saxandena, Sakuru nun a diine nun a ngaxakedenne, e birin malanxina muxu fu nun firin.<verse eid="1CH 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 25:11"/>A naanindena, Yisiri nun a diine nun a ngaxakedenne, e birin malanxina muxu fu nun firin.<verse eid="1CH 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 25:12"/>A suulundena, Netaniya nun a diine nun a ngaxakedenne, e birin malanxina muxu fu nun firin.<verse eid="1CH 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 25:13"/>A sennindena, Bukiya nun a diine nun a ngaxakedenne, e birin malanxina muxu fu nun firin.<verse eid="1CH 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 25:14"/>A soloferedena, Yesarela nun a diine nun a ngaxakedenne, e birin malanxina muxu fu nun firin.<verse eid="1CH 25:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 25:15"/>A solomasɛxɛdena, Yɛsaya nun a diine nun a ngaxakedenne, e birin malanxina muxu fu nun firin.<verse eid="1CH 25:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 25:16"/>A solomanaanindena, Matani nun a diine nun a ngaxakedenne, e birin malanxina muxu fu nun firin.<verse eid="1CH 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 25:17"/>A fudena, Simeyi nun a diine nun a ngaxakedenne, e birin malanxina muxu fu nun firin.<verse eid="1CH 25:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 25:18"/>A fu nun kedendena, Asarɛli nun a diine nun a ngaxakedenne, e birin malanxina muxu fu nun firin.<verse eid="1CH 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 25:19"/>A fu nun firindena, Hasabi nun a diine nun a ngaxakedenne, e birin malanxina muxu fu nun firin.<verse eid="1CH 25:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 25:20"/>A fu nun saxandena, Subayeli nun a diine nun a ngaxakedenne, e birin malanxina muxu fu nun firin.<verse eid="1CH 25:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 25:21"/>A fu nun naanindena, Matitiya nun a diine nun a ngaxakedenne, e birin malanxina muxu fu nun firin.<verse eid="1CH 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 25:22"/>A fu nun suulundena, Yeremoti nun a diine nun a ngaxakedenne, e birin malanxina muxu fu nun firin.<verse eid="1CH 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 25:23"/>A fu nun sennindena, Xananiya nun a diine nun a ngaxakedenne, e birin malanxina muxu fu nun firin.<verse eid="1CH 25:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 25:24"/>A fu nun soloferedena, Yosobekasa nun a diine nun a ngaxakedenne, e birin malanxina muxu fu nun firin.<verse eid="1CH 25:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 25:25"/>A fu nun solomasɛxɛdena, Xanani nun a diine nun a ngaxakedenne, e birin malanxina muxu fu nun firin.<verse eid="1CH 25:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 25:26"/>A fu nun solomanaanindena, Maloti nun a diine nun a ngaxakedenne, e birin malanxina muxu fu nun firin.<verse eid="1CH 25:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 25:27"/>A mɔxɔɲɛdena, Eliyata nun a diine nun a ngaxakedenne, e birin malanxina muxu fu nun firin.<verse eid="1CH 25:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 25:28"/>A mɔxɔɲɛn nun kedendena, Hotiri nun a diine nun a ngaxakedenne, e birin malanxina muxu fu nun firin.<verse eid="1CH 25:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 25:29"/>A mɔxɔɲɛn nun firindena, Gidaliti nun a diine nun a ngaxakedenne, e birin malanxina muxu fu nun firin.<verse eid="1CH 25:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 25:30"/>A mɔxɔɲɛn nun saxandena, Maxasiyoti nun a diine nun a ngaxakedenne, e birin malanxina muxu fu nun firin.<verse eid="1CH 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 25:31"/>A mɔxɔɲɛn nun naanindena, Romanti-Eseri nun a diine nun a ngaxakedenne, e birin malanxina muxu fu nun firin.<verse eid="1CH 25:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1CH 26"/>
  <para style="s">Ala Batu Banxin kantan tiine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 26:1"/>Dɛ kantanne yitaxunxi ikiini: Keli Kore xabilani, Kore a diin Meselemiya Asafi a denbayani. <verse eid="1CH 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 26:2"/>Meselemiya yi dii xɛmɛne sɔtɔ: Sakari nan yi a dii singen na, Yediyayeli a firindena, Sebadiya a saxandena, <verse eid="1CH 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 26:3"/>Yataniyɛli a naanindena, Elan a suulundena, Yehoxanan a sennindena, e nun Eliyehowenayi a soloferedena.<verse eid="1CH 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 26:4"/>Obedi-Edɔn fan yi dii xɛmɛne sɔtɔ: Semaya nan yi a dii singen na, Yehosabadi a firindena, Yowa a saxandena, Sakara a naanindena, Natanɛli a suulundena, <verse eid="1CH 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 26:5"/>Amiyɛli a sennindena, Isakari a soloferedena, e nun Pewuletayi a solomasɛxɛdena. Ala bata yi barakan sa Obedi-Edɔn ma fe yi.<verse eid="1CH 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 26:6"/>A dii singen Semaya yi dii xɛmɛne sɔtɔ naxanye findixi yɛɛratine ra e denbayane xun na bayo e sɛnbɛn yi gbo. <verse eid="1CH 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 26:7"/>Semayaa diine nan itoe ra: Otini nun Refayeli nun Obedi nun Elesabada. Xɛmɛ wɛkilɛxin nan yi e ngaxakedenne Elihu nun Semakiya ra. <verse eid="1CH 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 26:8"/>Obedi-Edɔn yixɛtɛne nan yi na muxune ra. E tan nun e diine nun e ngaxakedenne birin yi findixi muxu kɛndɛne nan na, e sɛnbɛn yi gbo Alaa wanli. Obedi-Edɔn yixɛtɛne birin malanxina muxu tonge sennin e nun firin.<verse eid="1CH 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 26:9"/>Muxu kɛndɛn nan yi Meselemiyaa diine nun a ngaxakedenne fan na. E birin malanxina muxu fu nun solomasɛxɛ. <verse eid="1CH 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 26:10"/>Merari a diin Xosa yi dii xɛmɛni itoe bari: Simiri, naxan fafe a findi a ngaxakedenne xunna ra hali dii singen to mi yi a ra, e nun <verse eid="1CH 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 26:11"/>Xiliki, a firindena e nun Tebaliya, a saxandena e nun Sakari, a naanindena. Xosaa diine nun a ngaxakedenne birin malanxina muxu fu nun saxan.<verse eid="1CH 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 26:12"/>Dɛ kantanne yi yitaxunxi na kii nin. E kuntigine nun e ngaxakedenne birin yi Alatala Batu Banxin wanla ra. <verse eid="1CH 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 26:13"/>E yi masɛnsɛnna tima nɛn alogo e xa a kolon naxan lan a xa dɛɛn naxan kantan. Muxu gbeene nun muxudine birin yi na kii nin denbayane birin yi.<verse eid="1CH 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 26:14"/>Masɛnsɛnna yi Selemiya suxu lan banxin sogeteden binna dɛɛn ma. Kɔmɛn binna dɛɛn masɛnsɛnna yi a diin Sakari suxu, naxan findixi maxadi ti xaxilimaan na. <verse eid="1CH 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 26:15"/>Masɛnsɛnna yi Obedi-Edɔn suxu lan yiifari fɔxɔn dɛɛn ma. Se ramara banxin masɛnsɛnna yi a diine fan suxu. <verse eid="1CH 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 26:16"/>Banxin sogegododen binna dɛɛn masɛnsɛnna yi Supimi nun Xosa suxu, e nun dɛɛn naxan xili Saaleketi naxan yi rabima kiraan binni naxan tema geyaan ma. Kantan muxune yi yɛɛ rafindixi e bode ma. <verse eid="1CH 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 26:17"/>Lewi muxu sennin yi sogeteden binni, muxu naanin kɔmɛnna ma, muxu naanin yiifanna ma, muxu naanin se ramara banxini. <verse eid="1CH 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 26:18"/>Sansanna binni, naxan sogegododen binni, muxu naanin yi ti na kiraan dɛ, muxu firin mɔn yi ti sansanna so dɛɛn yɛtɛɛn na. <verse eid="1CH 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 26:19"/>Dɛ kantanne yi yɛbaxi na kii nin Kora nun Merari yixɛtɛne yɛ.<verse eid="1CH 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 26:20"/>Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxuna nde Axiya nan yi yengi dɔxi nafunla nun se sariɲanxine xɔn ma naxanye yi ramaraxi Ala Batu Banxini. <verse eid="1CH 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 26:21"/>Ladana yixɛtɛne Gɛrisɔn xabilani, ne denbaya xunne nan itoe ra: Yexiyeli nun <verse eid="1CH 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 26:22"/>Yexiyeli a diine Setama nun a xunyɛn Yowɛli. Ne nan yi yengi dɔxi nafunle xɔn naxanye yi ramaraxi Alatala Batu Banxini.<verse eid="1CH 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 26:23"/>Amirama nun Yisehari nun Xebiron nun Yusiyɛli xabilane yi, muxuni itoe nan ti wanle ra: <verse eid="1CH 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 26:24"/>Musaa diin Gɛrisɔmi yixɛtɛna nde Sebuweli nan yi se ramara banxin feene xun na. <verse eid="1CH 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 26:25"/>A benba Gerisɔmi xunyɛna Eliyeseri yi Rexabiya sɔtɔ, Rexabiya yi Esayi sɔtɔ, Esayi yi Yorami sɔtɔ, Yorami yi Sikiri sɔtɔ, Sikiri yi Selomiti sɔtɔ. <verse eid="1CH 26:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 26:26"/>Selomiti nun a ngaxakedenne nan yi yengi dɔxi nafulu sariɲanxin xɔn ma, Manga Dawuda nun xabila xunne nun sofa kuntigin naxanye yi muxu wuli nun muxu kɛmɛ xun na e nun sofa kuntigi gbɛtɛye seen naxanye fixi Ala ma. <verse eid="1CH 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 26:27"/>E seen naxanye birin tongoxi yɛngɛni, e na ndee findi Alatala Batu Banxin masuxu seene ra. <verse eid="1CH 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 26:28"/>Selomiti nun a ngaxakedenne mɔn yi e yengi dɔxɔ nafunla xɔn ma, Nabi Samuyɛli nun Kisu a diin Sɔli nun Neri a diina Abineri nun Seruyaa diin Yowaba naxan fi Ala ma.<verse eid="1CH 26:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 26:29"/>Yisehari xabilan muxuni itoe nan ti wanla ra: Kenaniya nun a diine nan yi yengi dɔxi kiti sa feene xɔn ma Isirayila yamaan xun na. <verse eid="1CH 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 26:30"/>Xebiron xabilan muxun naxanye ti wanla ra: Hasabi nun a ngaxakedenne nan yi yengi dɔxi Isirayila yamanan xɔn ma Yurudɛn sogegododen binni. Xɛmɛ kɛndɛn muxu wuli keden muxu kɛmɛ solofere nan yi e ra, naxanye yi walima Alatala nun mangan xa. <verse eid="1CH 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 26:31"/>Yeriya nan yi Xebiron xabilane xunna ra, fata xinle sɛbɛ kiin na e bɔnsɔn kɛdin ma. Dawudaa mangayaan ɲɛɛ tonge naanindeni, muxune yi bɔnsɔn kɛdine fɛsɛfɛsɛ, e fa a kolon a xɛmɛ kɛndɛ gbeena ndee yi Xebiron xabilane muxune yɛ Yaasɛri taani Galadi yamanani. <verse eid="1CH 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 26:32"/>Yeriya nun a ngaxakedenne, xɛmɛ kɛndɛn muxu wuli firin muxu kɛmɛ solofere nan yi e ra. Denbaya xunne nan yi a birin na. Manga Dawuda yi e findi Rubɛn nun Gadi nun Manase bɔnsɔn xunne ra Ala nun mangana feene birin yi.<verse eid="1CH 26:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1CH 27"/>
  <para style="s">Isirayilaa sofane fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 27:1"/>Isirayila kaan naxanye wali mangana ganli, ne nan itoe ra, xabila xunne nun sofa kuntigin naxanye yi muxu wuli nun muxu kɛmɛ xun na e nun sofa kuntigi gbɛtɛye. E yitaxunxi muxu wuli mɔxɔɲɛn nun naanin yɛɛn nan ma. Ɲɛɛn kike yo kike gali keden yi fama nɛn walideni mangan xa.<verse eid="1CH 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 27:2"/>Sabadiyɛli a diin Yasobeyami nan yi gali singen kuntigin na ɲɛɛn kike singeni. Muxu wuli mɔxɔɲɛn nun naanin nan yi a yamarin bun ma. <verse eid="1CH 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 27:3"/>Sabadiyɛli yi findixi Peresi yixɛtɛna nde nan na. A tan nan findi ganla birin kuntigin na ɲɛɛn kike singeni.<verse eid="1CH 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 27:4"/>Axoxi xabilan muxuna nde Dodayi yi findi gali kuntigin na ɲɛɛn kike firindeni. Mikiloti yi findi a sofa kuntigin na. Muxu wuli mɔxɔɲɛn nun naanin nan yi a yamarin bun ma.<verse eid="1CH 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 27:5"/>Saraxarali Yehoyadaa diin Bɛnaya yi findi gali kuntigin na ɲɛɛn kike saxandeni. Muxu wuli mɔxɔɲɛn nun naanin nan yi a yamarin bun ma. <verse eid="1CH 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 27:6"/>Bɛnaya nan yi Dawudaa sofa wɛkilɛxi tonge saxanne xunna ra. A diina Amisabadi yi a ganla nin.<verse eid="1CH 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 27:7"/>Yowaba xunyɛna Asahɛli yi findi gali kuntigin na ɲɛɛn kike naanindeni. A diin Sebadiya nan ti a ɲɔxɔn na. Muxu wuli mɔxɔɲɛn nun naanin nan yi a yamarin bun ma.<verse eid="1CH 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 27:8"/>Samehuti Yisira kaan yi findi gali kuntigin na ɲɛɛn kike suulundeni. Muxu wuli mɔxɔɲɛn nun naanin nan yi a yamarin bun ma.<verse eid="1CH 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 27:9"/>Ikɛsi a diina Ira Tekowa kaan yi findi gali kuntigin na ɲɛɛn kike sennindeni. Muxu wuli mɔxɔɲɛn nun naanin nan yi a yamarin bun ma.<verse eid="1CH 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 27:10"/>Efirami bɔnsɔnna muxuna nde Xɛlɛsi Pelon kaan nan yi findi gali kuntigin na ɲɛɛn kike soloferedeni. Muxu wuli mɔxɔɲɛn nun naanin nan yi a yamarin bun ma.<verse eid="1CH 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 27:11"/>Sera xabilan muxuna nde Sibekayi Xusa kaan yi findi gali kuntigin na ɲɛɛn kike solomasɛxɛdeni. Muxu wuli mɔxɔɲɛn nun naanin nan yi a yamarin bun ma.<verse eid="1CH 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 27:12"/>Bunyamin bɔnsɔnna muxuna nde Abiyeseri Anatɔti kaan yi findi gali kuntigin na ɲɛɛn kike solomanaanindeni. Muxu wuli mɔxɔɲɛn nun naanin nan yi a yamarin bun ma.<verse eid="1CH 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 27:13"/>Sera xabilan muxuna nde Maharayi Netofa kaan yi findi gali kuntigin na ɲɛɛn kike fudeni. Muxu wuli mɔxɔɲɛn nun naanin nan yi a yamarin bun ma.<verse eid="1CH 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 27:14"/>Efirami bɔnsɔnna muxuna nde Bɛnaya Piraton kaan yi findi gali kuntigin na ɲɛɛn kike fu nun kedendeni. Muxu wuli mɔxɔɲɛn nun naanin nan yi a yamarin bun ma.<verse eid="1CH 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 27:15"/>Otiniyɛli xabilan muxuna nde Xɛlidayi Netofa kaan yi findi gali kuntigin na ɲɛɛn kike fu nun firindeni. Muxu wuli mɔxɔɲɛn nun naanin nan yi a yamarin bun ma.<verse eid="1CH 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 27:16"/>Kuntigin naxanye yi Isirayila bɔnsɔnne xun na, ne ni i ra:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:16">Rubɛn bɔnsɔnna xun na, Sikiri a diina Eliyeseri.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:16">Simeyɔn bɔnsɔnna xun na, Makaa diin Sɛfati.<verse eid="1CH 27:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 27:17"/>Lewi bɔnsɔnna xun na, Kɛmuyɛli a diin Hasabi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:17">Haruna yixɛtɛne xun na, Sadɔki.<verse eid="1CH 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 27:18"/>Yuda bɔnsɔnna xun na, Dawuda tada Elihu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:18">Isakari bɔnsɔnna xun na, Mikeli a diina Omiri.<verse eid="1CH 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 27:19"/>Sabulon bɔnsɔnna xun na, Abadi a diin Yisemaya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:19">Nafatali bɔnsɔnna xun na, Asiriyɛli a diin Yerimoti.<verse eid="1CH 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 27:20"/>Efirami bɔnsɔnna xun na, Asasiyaa diin Hoseya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:20">Manase bɔnsɔnna fɔxɔ kedenna xun na, Pɛdayaa diin Yowɛli.<verse eid="1CH 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 27:21"/>Manase bɔnsɔnna fɔxɔ kedenna fan xun na Galadi yamanani, Sakari a diin Yido.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:21">Bunyamin bɔnsɔnna xun na, Abineri a diin Yaasiyɛli.<verse eid="1CH 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 27:22"/>Dan bɔnsɔnna xun na, Yeroxamaa diina Asarɛli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:22">Isirayila bɔnsɔn kuntigine nan ne ra.<verse eid="1CH 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 27:23"/>Dawuda mi xɛmɛne tɛngɛ, naxanye barin munma yi ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛn ti bayo Alatala bata yi a fala a Isirayila kaane wuyama ayi nɛn alo sarene kore. <verse eid="1CH 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 27:24"/>Seruyaa diin Yowaba bata yi Isirayila kaane yatɛ fɔlɔ, koni a mi a raɲan masɔtɔ Alaa xɔlɔn ma lan Isirayila yamaan ma. Na yatɛn mi sɛbɛ Dawudaa taruxu kɛdine kui.<verse eid="1CH 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mangana kuntigi gbɛtɛye fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 27:25"/>Adiyeli a diina Asamawɛti nan yi mangana nafulu kantanna ra.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CH 27:25">Yusiyaa diin Yonatan nan yi nafulu kantanna ra banxidɛne nun taa gbɛtɛne nun kantan ti banxi matexine yi. <verse eid="1CH 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 27:26"/>Kelubu a diina Esiri nan yi xɛɛ biine xunna ra. <verse eid="1CH 27:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 27:27"/>Ramati kaan Simeyi nan yi manpa bili nakɔ feene xun na.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CH 27:27">Sefami kaan Sabidi nan yi manpa bili bogine nun manpa feene xun na.<verse eid="1CH 27:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 27:28"/>Gederi kaan Baali-Xanan nan yi oliwin nun burunna xɔdɛ binle fe xun na yamanan lanbanni.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CH 27:28">Yowasa nan yi ture feen xunna ra.<verse eid="1CH 27:28"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 27:29"/>Sitirayi Sarɔn kaan nan yi ɲingene fe xunna ra Sarɔn yamanani.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CH 27:29">Adalayi a diin Safati nan yi ɲingene fe xunna ra lanban yirene yi.<verse eid="1CH 27:29"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 27:30"/>Sumayila bɔnsɔnna muxuna nde Obili nan yi ɲɔgɔmɛne fe xunna ra.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CH 27:30">Yexedeya Meronoti kaan nan yi sofanle fe xunna ra.<verse eid="1CH 27:30"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 27:31"/>Yasisi nan yi siine nun yɛxɛɛne fe xunna ra, Hagari bɔnsɔnna muxuna.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CH 27:31">Na muxune nan yi yengi dɔxi Manga Dawuda sɔtɔ seene xɔn ma.<verse eid="1CH 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dawuda bundɔxɔne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 27:32"/>Manga Dawuda sɔxɔ Yonatan findi a kawandi muxun nun a sɛbɛli tiin nan na, a fekolonna yi gbo.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CH 27:32">Xakimoni a diin Yɛxiyɛli nan yi mangana dii xɛmɛne masuxu muxun na.<verse eid="1CH 27:32"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 27:33"/>Mangan kawandi muxun nan yi Axitofeli fan na.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CH 27:33">Mangan xɔyin nan yi Xusayi ra, Araka bɔnsɔnna muxuna nde. <verse eid="1CH 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 27:34"/>Bɛnayaa diin Yehoyada nun Abiyatari nan lu Axitofeli ɲɔxɔni. Yowaba nan yi mangana gali kuntigin na.<verse eid="1CH 27:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1CH 28"/>
  <para style="s">Dawuda yi Ala Batu Banxin ti feni tɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 28:1"/>Dawuda yi Isirayila kuntigine birin malan Yerusalɛn yi. Bɔnsɔn xunne nun gali kuntigin naxanye yi walima mangan xa, ne yi fa, e nun sofa kuntigin naxanye yi muxu wuli nun muxu kɛmɛ xun na. Kuntigine fan yi fa naxanye yi goronne nun xuruseene xun na, mangan nun a diine gbeen yi naxanye ra, e nun manga banxin kuntigine nun sofa wɛkilɛxine nun sofa kɛndɛne birin. <verse eid="1CH 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 28:2"/>Manga Dawuda yi keli, a naxa, “Ngaxakedenne, n ma yamana, ɛ tuli mati n xuiin na! N yi waxi banxina nde ti feni Alatalaa Layiri Kankiraan dɔxɛ dɛnaxan yi, en ma Ala san tidena, n yi n yitɔn a ti feen na. <verse eid="1CH 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 28:3"/>Koni, Ala bata yi a fala n xa, a naxa, ‘I mi banxin tima n xa, bayo sofaan ni i ra, i bata muxune faxa.’ <verse eid="1CH 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 28:4"/>Koni, Alatala, Isirayilaa Ala bata n sugandi n bɔnsɔnna birin tagi alogo n xa findi Isirayila mangan na habadan, bayo a bata Yuda bɔnsɔnna sugandi kuntigin na, a yi n fafe a denbayaan sugandi Yuda bɔnsɔnni, a yi n tan sugandi n fafe a denbayani, a yi n dɔxɔ mangan na Isirayila xun na. <verse eid="1CH 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 28:5"/>Iki, a bata dii wuyaxin naxan fi n ma, a bata Sulemani sugandi ne yɛ alogo a xa a dɔxɔ n ɲɔxɔni mangan na Alatala xa Isirayila xun na. <verse eid="1CH 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 28:6"/>A bata yi a fala n xa, a naxa, ‘I ya dii xɛmɛn Sulemani nan n batu banxin tima e nun n ma yinne, bayo n bata a tan nan sugandi, a findima nɛn n ma diin na, n yi findi a fafe ra. <verse eid="1CH 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 28:7"/>N mangayani tɔnma a xa nɛn naxan luma habadan, xa a n ma yamarine nun n ma sariyane suxu alo to.’ <verse eid="1CH 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 28:8"/>Nayi, iki, Isirayila kaane birin yɛtagi, Alatalaa yamana, e nun en ma Ala yɛtagi naxan tuli tixi en na, ɛ sɔbɛ so Alatala en ma Alaa yamarine xaranna ma, ɛ yi e suxu. Nayi, ɛ luma nɛn yamana faɲini ɛ dɛnaxan yi, ɛ mɔn yi a lu ɛ kɛɛn na ɛ yixɛtɛne xa. <verse eid="1CH 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 28:9"/>I tan, n ma dii xɛmɛn Sulemani, kata Ala kolondeni n walixi naxan xa, a batu i bɔɲɛn ma feu e nun i niin birin na. Alatala i bɔɲɛ yi feene birin fɛsɛfɛsɛma, a muxune miriyane birin kolon. Xa i a fen, a tinma nɛn i yi a to. Koni xa i i mɛ a ra, a mɛma i ra nɛn habadan. <verse eid="1CH 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 28:10"/>Iki, i nɔɛ a kolonɲɛ nɛn a Alatala bata i sugandi alogo i xa a batu banxin ti a xa, dɛnaxan findima a yire sariɲanxin na. Nayi, i sɔbɛ so, i wanla kɛ.”<verse eid="1CH 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dawuda yi Ala Batu Banxin ti kiin kɛdin so Sulemani yii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 28:11"/>Dawuda yi yire sariɲanxin ti kiin kɛdin so Sulemani yii, e nun banxin naxanye tima a rabilinni e nun gbeti ramaraden nun konkon naxan mate e birin xa hanma dɛnaxan a kui, e nun Layiri Kankiraan dɔxɔma dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="1CH 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 28:12"/>A mɔn yi wama dɛnaxanye birin ti feni, a yi ne fan ti kiin kɛdin so a yii, Alatala Batu Banxin yinne nun banxin naxanye tima yinna xɔn a rabilinni, e nun nafulu ramaradene Ala Batu Banxini, e nun se sariɲanxine ramaradene. <verse eid="1CH 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 28:13"/>A yi saraxaraline nun Lewine xinle sɛbɛn fan so a yii, e nun walikɛɛn naxanye yi lanma e yi wanle rakamali Alatala Batu Banxini, e nun seen naxanye yi rawalima na kui. <verse eid="1CH 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 28:14"/>A yi xɛma seene birin binyan xasabin yita a ra, e nun gbeti fixɛ seene binyana, birin nun a rawali kiina, <verse eid="1CH 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 28:15"/>lɛnpu dɔxɔ se xɛma daxine nun lɛnpu xɛma daxine nun lɛnpu dɔxɔ se gbeti fixɛ daxine nun lɛnpu gbeti fixɛ daxine binyane, birin nun a rawali kiina, <verse eid="1CH 28:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 28:16"/>e nun xɛma tabanle birin binya xasabina, burune yi sama naxanye fari Ala Batu Banxini, e nun gbeti fixɛ tabanle, <verse eid="1CH 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 28:17"/>e nun sube tongo se xɛma daxine nun wuli xuya goron xɛma daxine nun igelengen xɛma daxine birin binyana e nun xɛma barama daxine nun barama gbeti fixɛ daxine birin binyana, birin nun a rawali kiina. <verse eid="1CH 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 28:18"/>A mɔn yi wusulan ganden ti kiin kɛdin so a yii, e nun a xɛma faɲin binyan xasabina. A mɔn yi wontoron nafala kiin kɛdin fan so a yii, naxan yi tixi maleka gubugubu kan sawura xɛma daxine bun naxanye gabutɛye yi bandunxi Alatalaa Layiri Kankiraan xun ma. <verse eid="1CH 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 28:19"/>Nayi, Dawuda yi a fala, a naxa, “Itoe birin sɛbɛxi kɛdin kui n naxan sɔtɔxi Alatala ra. Ala nan kolonna fi n ma n banxin ti kiini ito sɛbɛ kɛdini.” <verse eid="1CH 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 28:20"/>A mɔn yi a fala Sulemani xa, a naxa, “N ma dii xɛmɛna, i wɛkilɛ, i sɛnbɛ so, i wanla kɛ. I nama kuisan, i nama gaxu! Amasɔtɔ Marigina Alatala, n ma Ala luma nɛn i xɔn. A mi i rabeɲinɲɛ mumɛ! A i malima nɛn han i yelin wanli ito birin nakamalɛ Alatala Batu Banxina fe yi. <verse eid="1CH 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 28:21"/>Saraxaraline nun Lewine fan mɔn i fɛma Ala Batu Banxin tideni. Muxu ɲɛnige faɲine fama nɛn i malideni wanli ito ra, kuntigine nun yamaan birin luma nɛn i ya yamarin bun.”<verse eid="1CH 28:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1CH 29"/>
  <para style="s">Kiseene Ala Batu Banxin ti feni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 29:1"/>Manga Dawuda yi a fala yamaan birin xa, a naxa, “N ma diin Sulemani, Ala naxan sugandixi, na munma kɔxɔ, a mi wanla kolon singen. Wanla naxan be, a gbo, bayo banxini ito mi tima muxune xan xa fɔ Marigina Alatala. <verse eid="1CH 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 29:2"/>N bata n sɛnbɛn birin nawali alogo n xa Ala Batu Banxin ti feni tɔn. N bata xɛmaan nun gbeti fixɛn nun sulan nun wuren nun wudin nun gɛmɛ tofaɲin nun dayimu daxin sifan birin nun gɛmɛ faɲi fixɛ gbegbe malan. <verse eid="1CH 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 29:3"/>N naxan birin yitɔn yire sariɲanxin ti feen na, n bata n ma xɛmaan nun n ma gbeti fixɛn fan sa na fari n sɔtɔ seene yɛ bayo n na n sɔbɛ soxi Ala Batu Banxina fe ma. <verse eid="1CH 29:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 29:4"/>Na yatɛne ni i ra: xɛmaan kilo wuli kɛmɛ wuli firin naxan keli Ofiri yi e nun gbeti fixɛ faɲin kilo wuli kɛmɛ firin wuli tonge saxan e nun solomasɛxɛ. Na sama banxi kankene nan ma. <verse eid="1CH 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 29:5"/>Xɛmaan nun gbeti fixɛni itoe sama seene nan ma a lan e xa sa naxanye ma e nun yiirawanle yii funfune birin. Iki, nde en tan yɛ naxan ɲɛnigen tongɛ Alatala xa to?”<verse eid="1CH 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 29:6"/>Denbaya xunne nun Isirayila bɔnsɔn xunne nun sofa kuntigin naxanye yi muxu wuli nun muxu kɛmɛ xun na e nun mangana wali xunne, ne birin yi ɲɛnigen tongo wanli ito xili yi. <verse eid="1CH 29:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 29:7"/>E yi fa finmaseni itoe ra Ala Batu Banxin ti feen na: xɛmaan kilo wuli kɛmɛ wuli tonge solofere kilo solomasɛxɛ e nun naanin, e nun gbeti fixɛn kilo wuli kɛmɛ saxan wuli tonge naanin e nun sulan kilo wuli kɛmɛ sennin wuli fu nun firin e nun wuren kilo miliyɔn saxan wuli kɛmɛ naanin. <verse eid="1CH 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 29:8"/>Birin yi gɛmɛ tofaɲine so Gɛrisɔn yixɛtɛn Yɛxiyɛli yii, Alatala Batu Banxin nafulu ramarana. <verse eid="1CH 29:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 29:9"/>Yamaan yi sɛwa na ɲɛnige ma seene fe ra, bayo e bata na liga e bɔɲɛn birin na Alatala xa. Manga Dawuda fan yi sɛwa na fe ra.<verse eid="1CH 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dawuda Ala maxandina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 29:10"/>Dawuda yi Alatala tantun yamaan birin yɛtagi. A yi a fala, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:10">“Nxu benba Isirayilaa Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:10">Alatala, tantunna i xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:10">habadan han habadan.<verse eid="1CH 29:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 29:11"/>I tan, Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:11">gboon nun sɛnbɛn nun binyen</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:11">nun mangayaan nun tantunna birin i xa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:11">Seen naxan birin kore xɔnna nun bɔxɔ xɔnna ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:11">i tan nan gbee ne birin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:11">I tan, Alatala nan mangan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:11">I tan nan dunuɲa birin xun na.<verse eid="1CH 29:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 29:12"/>Bannayaan nun xunna kenla fataxi i tan nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:12">I tan nan feen birin xun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:12">sɛnbɛn nun fangan birin i tan nan yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:12">Sɛnbɛna i tan nan na i muxune fe yitɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:12">i yi e sɛnbɛ so.”<verse eid="1CH 29:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 29:13"/>“Iki, nxɔ Ala, nxu i tantunma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:13">nxu yi i xili magaxuxin binya.<verse eid="1CH 29:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 29:14"/>Nanse n tan na?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:14">Nanse n ma yamaan na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:14">naxan a ligɛ nxu yi nɔ finmaseen sifani itoe fiyɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:14">A birin kelixi i tan nan yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:14">Nxu naxan soma i yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:14">na birin kelixi i tan nan singe yii.<verse eid="1CH 29:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 29:15"/>Nxu findixi xɔɲɛne nan na i yɛɛ ra yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:15">alo nxu benbane yi kii naxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:15">Nxɔ siimayaan luxi nɛn dunuɲa yi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:15">alo nininna naxan danguma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:15">Yigi yo mi nxu xa.<verse eid="1CH 29:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 29:16"/>Alatala, nxɔ Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:16">finmase faɲini itoe birin kelixi i tan nan yii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:16">nxu naxan malanxi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:16">alogo nxu xa banxin ti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:16">i xili sariɲanxin binyama dɛnaxan yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:16">I tan nan gbee na birin na.”<verse eid="1CH 29:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 29:17"/>“N ma Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:17">n na a kolon a i muxune bɔɲɛ yi feene kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:17">tinxinyaan mɔn nafan i ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:17">N bata saraxani ito ɲɛnige i xa n bɔɲɛ tinxinxini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:17">N mɔn bata a to sɛwani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:17">i ya yamaan fan be</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:17">alogo e xa ɲɛnige ma saraxane ba i xa.<verse eid="1CH 29:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 29:18"/>Alatala, nxu benbane Iburahima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:18">nun Isiyaga nun Isirayilaa Ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:18">i xa xaxinli ito sa i ya yamaan bɔɲɛni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:18">alogo e xa lu i fɔxɔ ra habadan.<verse eid="1CH 29:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 29:19"/>I xa n ma diin Sulemani mali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:19">alogo a fan xa lu i ya yamarine nun i ya sariyane fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:19">a lu i ya tɔnne fɔxɔ ra a bɔɲɛn ma feu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:19">A mɔn yi banxini ito ti n naxan ti fe yitɔnxi.”<verse eid="1CH 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sulemani yi ti Dawuda ɲɔxɔni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 29:20"/>Dawuda yi a fala yamaan birin xa, a naxa, “Tantunna Alatala xa, ɛ Ala.” Yamaan birin yi Alatala tantun, e benbane Ala, e fa e yigodo, e e xinbi sin Alatala nun mangan yɛtagi. <verse eid="1CH 29:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 29:21"/>Na xɔtɔn bode, Isirayila kaane yi saraxane ba Alatala xa. E saraxa gan daxi gbegbe ba, tura wuli keden nun konton wuli keden e nun yɛxɛɛ dii wuli keden. E mɔn yi minse saraxane nun saraxa gbɛtɛ wuyaxi ba Isirayila birin ma fe ra. <verse eid="1CH 29:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 29:22"/>Na lɔxɔni, e yi e dɛge, e yi e min Alatala yɛtagi sɛwa gbeeni. E mɔn yi Dawudaa diin Sulemani dɔxɔ mangan na a firindeni. E yi turen sa a xunni Alatala yɛtagi, a xa findi e yɛɛratiin na. E yi Sadɔki fan dɔxɔ saraxaraliin na. <verse eid="1CH 29:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 29:23"/>Sulemani yi dɔxɔ Alatalaa manga gbɛdɛni, a findi mangan na a fafe Dawuda ɲɔxɔni. A yi xunna kenla sɔtɔ, Isirayila birin yi a yamarin suxu. <verse eid="1CH 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 29:24"/>Kuntigine nun sofa wɛkilɛxine nun Manga Dawudaa dii xɛmɛne birin yi dɛ xuiin tongo a e luma nɛn Manga Sulemani a yamarin bun ma. <verse eid="1CH 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 29:25"/>Alatala yi Sulemani a fe yite Isirayila muxune birin yɛtagi. A yi a mangayani te dangu Isirayila manga singene birin na.<verse eid="1CH 29:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dawuda saya fena</para>
  <para style="r">Mangane Singen 2.10-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 29:26"/>Yese a diin Dawuda yi mangayaan liga Isirayila birin xun na. <verse eid="1CH 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 29:27"/>A ɲɛɛ tonge naanin nan ti mangayani Isirayila xun na, ɲɛɛ solofere Xebiron taani, ɲɛɛ tonge saxan e nun saxan Yerusalɛn taani. <verse eid="1CH 29:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 29:28"/>A siimaya xunkuyen sɔtɔ nɛn, a laxiraya foriya faɲin nun sɛwani. Hɛrisigɛ kanna nan yi a ra, a binyen fan sɔtɔ nɛn. A dii Sulemani yi findi mangan na a ɲɔxɔni. <verse eid="1CH 29:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 29:29"/>Manga Dawuda kɛwanle, a fɔlɔna han a raɲanna, ne birin sɛbɛxi fetoon Samuyɛli nun Nabi Natan nun fetoon Gadi e kɛdine kui. <verse eid="1CH 29:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 29:30"/>Kɛdini itoe a mangayaan nun a wɛkilɛn nan ma fe falama e nun feen naxanye liga a waxatini Isirayila yamanan nun yamana gbɛtɛne yi.<verse eid="1CH 29:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 29"/>
</usx>
